e want to return the next day?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495472/size7/49f2e662fe988adbe41d7411b2b7585f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495472/size7/49f2e662fe988adbe41d7411b2b7585f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-106261","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-106261","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":163,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43877","title":"Our Holidays","authors":["Rose Larsen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"How do you spend your holidays? Join the characters in this book as they describe the things they do during their holidays.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101419/size7/a70081c575ef41c895932302704ba952.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101419/size7/a70081c575ef41c895932302704ba952.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43877","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-43877","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":164,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-54021","title":"Have You Seen Sundari?","authors":["Aindri C"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Dina’s best friend Sundari is hiding. Can you help her find him?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727061/size7/136f05ee6d48dd5d7c58d50da93c79cd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727061/size7/136f05ee6d48dd5d7c58d50da93c79cd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-54021","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0