hts and quiet fears of a child's first experience of going to school.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188697/size7/79ebc726393d2b2e496f93b434607bda.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188697/size7/79ebc726393d2b2e496f93b434607bda.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-139254","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-139254","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":168,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-19721","title":"You Can't Find Me!","authors":["Jemma Jose"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mia is the best in the world at hiding. Can you find her? A hide-and-seek book where you have to find Mia and the items on her Ma’s shopping list.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/116826/size7/426af0a182efe12d8719ad2b2404bdee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/116826/size7/426af0a182efe12d8719ad2b2404bdee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-19721","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-19721","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":169,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26810","title":"The Little Bird in the Big Mountains","authors":["Bulbul Sharma"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Meera is going to the market to buy new shoes. On the way, Meera, her brother and\nMa rescue an injured bird. A story that brings alive the sights and sounds of mountain life and\nits gentle rhythms.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726566/size7/fc6939958e491931b99e6b78e305a572.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726566/size7/fc6939958