am","authors":["Gouri Srinidhi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Reba comes home, she realises that a shopkeeper has given her too much change. Should she tell the shopkeeper the truth?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93887/size7/d8f14b0124e4a95d660994b1141c79e2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93887/size7/d8f14b0124e4a95d660994b1141c79e2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-37371","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37371","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":182,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26371","title":"Best Foot Forward","authors":["Rustom  Dadachanji"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mr. Centipede wears 21 pairs of boots on his morning walk. But with so many legs to choose from, how does he\nknow which foot to use first? Join Mr. Centipede and his garden friends in this story about counting and indecision!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/646248/size7/785eeebf26aca45dc9fc4f56cedba1a6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/646248/size7/785eeebf26aca45dc9fc4f56cedba1a6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26371","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26371","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":183,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16939","title":"What is it?","authors":["Tanya Luther Agarwal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Meet the new singing sensation of  the Jungle!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118239/size7/24acd1b6280faa5efff9d119b107c8d2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.s