i and the Tiger","authors":["Shalini Reys"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Bulli is a little girl growing up in Assam, in a basket-weavers’ community. When the bamboo suppliers threaten to raise the rates and put their whole village in jeopardy, Bulli knows she has to find other ways of finding bamboo, even if it means facing the legendary tiger!  Shalini Reys’s adventure-filled story is illustrated by Nankusiya Shyam in the Gond style.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/37004/size7/8d39fc51a21264dddb80ad83f482be7a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/37004/size7/8d39fc51a21264dddb80ad83f482be7a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-12643","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-12643","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":252,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-105363","title":"I Love Me","authors":["Menaka Raman"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rubina has just moved to a new home and doesn’t know anyone there. No one wants to play with her. Can Rubina find a friend of her own?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/214248/size7/924c337c1c01987477444de3b4a774a2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/214248/size7/924c337c1c01987477444de3b4a774a2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-105363","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-105363","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":253,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-1112","title":"We Are All Animals","authors":["Rohini Nilekani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A nice interaction between animals and children