ferences and work as a team?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724120/size7/c43ae4c1438930b9a3020cbb109e471a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724120/size7/c43ae4c1438930b9a3020cbb109e471a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-32723","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-32723","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":318,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-17775","title":"What Are These For?","authors":["Bhavini"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"This charming tale with vibrant illustrations and visual clues showcases an innovative blend of learning and laughter. The kitchen is a mess! Who did this? Things are on the floor. What are these objects for?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130164/size7/ff56e0366777fa6b2338456e64b1e8d6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130164/size7/ff56e0366777fa6b2338456e64b1e8d6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-17775","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-17775","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":319,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-409","title":"Colours of Nature","authors":["Bulbul Sharma"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"An eminent artist plays with the colours of nature. A lovely offering for early readers.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721742/size7/e6cd378a92a264ce09409ce1aa323988.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721742/size7/e6cd378a92a264ce09409ce1aa323988.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-409","type":"a