 that’s the way a button rolls. A story as cute as a button.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-112040","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-112040","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":323,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103458","title":"Book of Bhoots","authors":["Shabnam  Minwalla"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Who whispers your name in the wind on this moonless night? Maybe nothing. Maybe something. Turn the pages of this book, and maybe you’ll hear it. And if you do, there’s no going back.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723696/size7/e0ce37ed7c3c01ca31cf9fd159adcc8b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723696/size7/e0ce37ed7c3c01ca31cf9fd159adcc8b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103458","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103458","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":324,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42989","title":"Who is Faster?","authors":["Rose Larsen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Which animal is fast and which is slow? This book tells young readers which animals are faster than others.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101398/size7/20ce9555025b846ccb27ae94345a490a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101398/size7/20ce9555025b846ccb27ae94345a490a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/a