y do about it? A story about pollution and the declining state of water bodies.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/196528/size7/4b27744f1d84c940dbf9370defe8966a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/196528/size7/4b27744f1d84c940dbf9370defe8966a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-111303","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-111303","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":337,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-108113","title":"Bobo and the Worms","authors":["Abokali Jimomi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Worms are chewing up plants. Bobo is on a mission to stop them. Can she manage it?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495594/size7/9fec4d87f484e7a1832f21cae4834f7b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495594/size7/9fec4d87f484e7a1832f21cae4834f7b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-108113","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-108113","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":338,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-99552","title":"Gudugu Thadugu","authors":["Ashok Rajagopalan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Muni the mason has to break a shed and make a new clinic. He goes up the hill asking various people to help him. But sometimes help takes on an unexpected form!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495625/size7/cb7272fca8729d1afce929ec613d09f9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495625/size7/cb7272fca8729d1afce929ec613d09f9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-99552","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-99552","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":339,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-31922","title":"Why are Bubbles Round?","authors":["Sukanya  Sinha"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maya and Manu want to see if they can make bubbles of different shapes. Like them, you too can learn about bubbles and their shapes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717015/size7/7e694fb5fdd89111f6964e007a88db37.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717015/size7/7e694fb5fdd89111f6964e007a88db37.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-31922","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-31922","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":340,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-269397","title":"The Birthday Cake","authors":["Andaleeb Wajid"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Azad, Haniya, Charulata and Piyush love to play in front of their house — as long as they avoid the grumpy old woman at the end of the street. One day, when they find out that it's her birthday, the four friends decide to bake her a cake. After all, no one should spend their birthday alone. \nA charming story about fraternity and empathy.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524457/size7/3de4e044e2aa994fccf7b609981e035c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524457/size7/3de4e044e2aa994fccf7b609981e035c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-269397","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-269397","type":"application/e