front of her mouth while she speaks! Let us find out what is happening this winter.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/702420/size7/42fc34e6412fa8bae45d57c80db0b6f3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/702420/size7/42fc34e6412fa8bae45d57c80db0b6f3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-86","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-86","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":394,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-361814","title":"The Theatre of Ghosts","authors":["Pankaj Saikia"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Junali and Rimjhim are off to see Bhaona, the traditional drama on the river island of Majuli. But shadows loom everywhere! A mischievous story that celebrates this wonderful folk practice of Assam.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527480/size7/ee0972905caf4eaced9ee6839e37f386.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527480/size7/ee0972905caf4eaced9ee6839e37f386.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-361814","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-361814","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":395,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-36678","title":"Rat and Goat","authors":["Sanjana  Khoobchandani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rat loves to play hopscotch but he has no one to play with. His neighbour, Goat, is at home but he prefers to be alone. Can Rat persuade Goat to play with him?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101334/size7/34ea188d375dede8e22508a9013dc8eb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101334/size7/34ea188d375dede8e22508a9013dc8eb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-36678","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-36678","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":396,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-146242","title":"Body","authors":["Little Zebra Books"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Do you know all your body parts? Find out!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/204563/size7/04d25cba78ec60edb6623ac79e48520b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/204563/size7/04d25cba78ec60edb6623ac79e48520b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-146242","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-146242","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":397,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-2380","title":"The Story of Stories","authors":["Roopa Pai"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In a happy, happy, happy forest lives Journalist Bear who is sad because he can't find a 'BREAKING NEWS' story. A Journalist Bear without a 'BREAKING NEWS' story, can you imagine! Then along comes Singing Sardarji who helps Bear see who he really is. Read this story which celebrates the power and magic of stories, and the people who weave them into being.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699237/size7/a73ebf9c0be3829daf205c8376e0f49d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699237/size7/a73ebf9c0be3829daf205c8376e0f49d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-2380","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-2380","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":398,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-5619","title":"The Fascinating Fibonaccis","authors":["Dr. Shonali Chinniah"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Almost a thousand years ago, an Indian scholar called Hemachandra discovered a fascinating number sequence. A century later, the same sequence caught the attention of Italian mathematician Fibonacci, who wrote about it. The Fibonacci sequence, as it began to be called, was straightforward enough - what made it fascinating was that this particular set of numbers was repeated many, many times in nature - in flowers, seashells, eggs, seeds, stars... Find out more inside this book!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712400/size7/10f094938687f1ee29a48d028eca1101.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712400/size7/10f094938687f1ee29a48d028eca1101.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-5619","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-5619","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":399,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-31874","title":"Who's on  Divya's Map?","authors":["Rohan Jahagirdar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Divya is excited that her cousin Ravi is going to come to Gajapur soon. But she is not sure how he will find her house. Would a map help?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717011/size7/6c1c36d92ace6c0269eb253f538a74bd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717011/size7/6c1c36d92ace6c0269eb253f538a74bd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-31874","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-31874"