":468,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-3625","title":"Why Do Bees Buzz?","authors":["Nabanita Deshmukh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Why can't bees work quietly? They buzz because there are some very good reasons to do so. Learn about the humble bees in this book.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712557/size7/923f83c35af803721c0069afdc49bd7f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712557/size7/923f83c35af803721c0069afdc49bd7f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-3625","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-3625","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":469,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-98337","title":"Sports Day","authors":["Menaka Raman"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lace up your shoes, drink some water, and get ready for Sports Day. Happy, sad, nervous, excited - the students of KV School are feeling so many emotions. Aska-lakadi-gala-galoo, cheer them, won’t you?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495676/size7/969538e582d44ed3863f7c2fe495445a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495676/size7/969538e582d44ed3863f7c2fe495445a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-98337","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-98337","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":470,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-4991","title":"Up World, Down World","authors":["Padmaparna Ghosh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In a canopy forest in India, the Up World and Down World have always been suspicious of each other. But it all changes when Gopa the dormouse drops her book by accident on Fatima’s head. A story about the biodiversity of the canopy forests and friendship.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723877/size7/512e37faaf23415856672bb730140ee1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723877/size7/512e37faaf23415856672bb730140ee1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-4991","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-4991","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":471,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-151534","title":"Let's Fly a Plane!","authors":["Anjna Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Have you ever dreamed of being a pilot? Open this book, step into the cockpit and let’s fly an aeroplane!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/216369/size7/243eb9630a42e8b6462dfb3774b9d6b0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/216369/size7/243eb9630a42e8b6462dfb3774b9d6b0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-151534","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-151534","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":472,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-127","title":"The Missing Bat","authors":["Vaishali Shroff"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"There was a cricket bat missing from Rehman Chacha's warehouse, and he suspected that young Ahmed had stolen it. A funny tale from Kashmir, the land of the willow trees.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709415/size7/e95e51b7c1b18b6cf495e95f90fd659e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709415/size7/e95e51b7c1b18b6cf495e95f90fd659e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-127","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-127","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":473,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-352043","title":"Achchachi's Bagbrella","authors":["Aithihya Ashok Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sahyadri lost her umbrella at school, again. Amma is going to be very angry. Luckily for Sahyadri, Achchachi is going to help her make a new umbrella. A story that introduces the concept of pie charts.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727418/size7/37170842b20a8ced11ae674f17ce3855.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727418/size7/37170842b20a8ced11ae674f17ce3855.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-352043","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-352043","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":474,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-342703","title":"Posto, Please Clean Your Desk!","authors":["Adrija Ghosh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Posto’s desk is messy. Crayons, pencils, paintbrushes and books are scattered all over. Ma wants him to clean it up. Read this delightful picture book to find out whether Posto cleans and sorts his desk.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527519/size7/84aea45597ceebd0788b864c215f96bd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527519/size7/84aea45597ceebd0788b864c215f96bd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-342703","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-342703","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"ht