, Start, Go!","authors":["Nikhil Gulati"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Have you ever wondered how a motorcycle works? It all begins with a kick!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188858/size7/de395e43c427984657880d799020ce6f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188858/size7/de395e43c427984657880d799020ce6f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-136847","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-136847","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":499,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-14178","title":"Fly By Bye!","authors":["Sonal Goyal","Sumit Sakhuja"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In this wordless story, let's explore our world from the perspective of a fly.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717941/size7/a6572759ac00204199b69d9e391c4836.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717941/size7/a6572759ac00204199b69d9e391c4836.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-14178","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-14178","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":500,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-34990","title":"It's a Laddoo Party!","authors":["Srividhya Venkat"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mira and Mihir have a box full of laddoos. Just when they want to eat… DING DONG!\nOh, a guest. They have twelve laddoos.\nHow many laddoos do they each get?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117565/size7/399dc3e5ef943846b6f10d2347afdec5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117565/size7/399dc3e5ef943846b6