4561","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-214561","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":558,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-986","title":"Tok Tok","authors":["Vidya Pradhan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The food-loving king of Sonapur could not sleep because of a mysterious sound in his chambers. What could it be?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706157/size7/93c759f49808e92b7f9cefb99d3989f4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706157/size7/93c759f49808e92b7f9cefb99d3989f4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-986","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-986","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":559,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15961","title":"Lion on the loose","authors":["Paro Anand"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Do rainy days make you feel that the world is full of possibilities? The lion in the story certainly believes so! Read this story to meet him as he takes a rainy day holiday from the zoo and have as much fun as the children in the story. After all, the author maintains that this story is ‘almost true’!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/42881/size7/91de93728ea0174899f988fca4f160ee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/42881/size7/91de93728ea0174899f988fca4f160ee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15961","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15961","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":560,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-342422","title":"The Plant Whisperer","authors":["Sayantan Datta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Young Jaishree loves nothing more than plants. She wants to understand them, which is why she decides to spend her life studying plants. This biography of ecologist Dr H Jaishree Subrahmaniam is a story of passion and gumption.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/491323/size7/1990bf6c5f6788bca49cd0131c95f55a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/491323/size7/1990bf6c5f6788bca49cd0131c95f55a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-342422","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-342422","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":561,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-34419","title":"Sitara Grows Up","authors":["Anjum Hasan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sitara’s family is going on a trip to see the grand Taj Mahal. But children who suck their thumbs are not allowed on trains! Poor Sitara. Will she miss out on an adventure just because she sucks her thumb?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/66201/size7/eba059167763ce56ee9701d9255a8fcb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/66201/size7/eba059167763ce56ee9701d9255a8fcb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-34419","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-34419","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":562,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-58731","title":"How to Be an Otter","authors":["Nisarg Prakash"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"An otter passes on wisdom to a group of otter pups. Listen in to find out more about these wonderful river creatures.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715404/size7/365e0c31b59a2d51ada925f28ec98ab9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715404/size7/365e0c31b59a2d51ada925f28ec98ab9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-58731","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-58731","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":563,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-4782","title":"Bonda and Devi","authors":["Roopa Pai"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Do best friends always have to be alike? Devi and Bonda are best friends, but Devi is a little girl, while Bonda is a… Well, he can lift heavy boxes, he can extend his arms and legs, he never forgets anything he’s told, he can be turned on and off. Can you guess what he is?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723790/size7/52bbadeb3606658617b9a6032bc22021.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723790/size7/52bbadeb3606658617b9a6032bc22021.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-4782","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-4782","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":564,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-256820","title":"Monumental Maths","authors":["Veena Prasad"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What do the pyramids, ancient temples\nand Jantar Mantar all have in common?\nMaths! Innovative architects across the\nworld have used mathematics to build\nwonders that we still marvel at today.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715991/size7/fed27aa128d74c4879f6305804722539.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715991/size7/fed27aa128d74c4879f6305804722539.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-256820","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-256820","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":565,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10497","title":"The Hundred and Thirty-Seventh Leg","authors":["Sai Keskar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A millipede hurts herself. She needs help. \nNow, which is the leg that needs help? \nA delightful picture book from a winner of \nSahitya Akademi’s Bal Sahitya Puraskar.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721674/size7/952ffd984ed4aae01e69beed3373fcc6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721674/size7/952ffd984ed4aae01e69beed3373fcc6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10497","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10497","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":566,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-162282","title":"P.S. What's up with the climate?","authors":["Bijal Vachharajani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It’s too hot. It’s too cold. There’s no rain. There’s too much rain. There’s less snow. There’s too much carbon in the atmosphere. Grizzly bears don’t know whether to sleep, penguins don’t know what to eat. Kangaroos are escaping forest fires, bees are groggy from all the pesticide. In a world overrun by the climate crisis, is it time to panic yet?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/234334/size7/e8a8b21f43aaa4d1a27745b56b34a5d1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/234334/size7/e8a8b21f43aaa4d1a27745b56b34a5d1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-162282","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-162282","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":567,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-265508","title":"You Won't Believe Me","authors":["Jairaj Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Here is a boy who likes his school a lot, but is sure that his school does not like him back. His classmates bully him. His teachers shout at him. But there is a pond full of fish — where he discovers that he’s not alone.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524464/size7/495e026e7af09c81f3d5813cf16cdcb8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524464/size7/495e026e7af09c81f3d5813cf16cdcb8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-265508","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-265508","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":568,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-213141","title":"Train","authors":["Ashwini Joshi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"This story is about a day in the life of a train. Read more to explore!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/288152/size7/4435796d8c6785d40d5db5c2142ceb98.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/288152/size7/4435796d8c6785d40d5db5c2142ceb98.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213141","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-213141","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":569,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22511","title":"Unnie and Innie","authors":["Magdalena  Cooper"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When summer comes, Unnie spends all of his time playing with his toys. After a while, he gets bored with his toys and wants something new to do. He notices that his neighbour, Innie, is never bored. Where do you think Innie finds these adventures?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128564/size7/dd06f9294be47e8b32dd4aeae974f392.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128564/size7/dd06f9294be47e8b32dd4aeae974f392.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22511","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22511","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":570,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-39756","title":"Two Mice","authors":["Rose Larsen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"One day, a real mouse met a computer mouse. Suddenly, a cat began to chase the real mouse and tried to catch him. What happened next?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99497/size7/c0dcb0a313c6150a9be9967ce352d6d7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99497/size7/c0dcb0a313c6150a9be9967ce352d6d7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-39756","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-39756","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":571,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-12756","title":"Chintu","authors":["Kanchan Bannerjee"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Meet Chintu. He is a special dog! There are other dogs in this story too. Would you like to meet them?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/389128/size7/19ea2321a4747fc5040f6f361eaa4de5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/389128/size7/19ea2321a4747fc5040f6f361eaa4de5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-12756","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-12756","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":572,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50338","title":"What Will Happen?","authors":["Varsha Seshan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What will happen if Sunita presses her belly button? Or if she pulls her ears? A story about the power of imagination which also introduces children to different parts of the body.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726929/size7/15b2e1748d152812ed5526070aca52ef.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726929/size7/15b2e1748d152812ed5526070aca52ef.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50338","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50338","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":573,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-337219","title":"Our Library","authors":["Raviraj Shetty"],"language":"","readingLevel":"reading","publisher":"","summary":"Do you like cars, and dinosaurs, and reading about them? Do you have questions and ideas? Do you like to be read to? Or do you like to read alone in a quiet corner? Come in, welcome to our library!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/434081/size7/6a48dc7eadd7baa7367e105d529b809f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/434081/size7/6a48dc7eadd7baa7367e105d529b809f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-337219","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-337219","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":574,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10824","title":"Kallu's world 3 - Mangu Mali and the Ambia Bhoot","authors":["Subhadra Sen Gupta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Welcome to Khajuria – a village where young Kallu and his gang run delightful adventurous riots almost everyday. Sometimes they question the village traditions, defy bullies or might just be going about their daily business but Kallu and his gang are up for anything. Join them as they grow wiser and wittier, happily roaming the village finding new things to do, and see what they come up with!\nEverybody in Khajuria knew about Munia's temper. Everybody also knew how stingy Mangu Mali was about giving away mangoes from the tree in his orchard. Now, Munia wanted mangoes...really badly and that too from Mangu Mali's orchard. Can you imagine a situation like this? Read on, to find out what happens...","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/31115/size7/6d83c8e348dae277f57773d74ef2f9e2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/31115/size7/6d83c8e348dae277f57773d74ef2f9e2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10824","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10824","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":575,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-34983","title":"Under the Invisibility Cloak","authors":["Varsha  Joshi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What would you do if you had an invisibility cloak? For one, playing hide-and-seek would be great fun. But is anyone making invisibility cloaks? Or do they exist only in science fiction and fantasy stories? Arnav and Tanisha head to the library to find out. Let’s follow them quietly – they can’t see us, we are invisible in their world.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117560/size7/aea0af0ba611e75850bc4dd4c24a7c54.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117560/size7/aea0af0ba611e75850bc4dd4c24a7c54.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-34983","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-34983","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":576,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-137568","title":"Your Body Is Yours","authors":["Yamini Vijayan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Your body is unique and it belongs only to you. Get to know it, and learn to take good care of it. A book that aims to start open and healthy conversations around our bodies, and our right to say no to anyone who does not respect boundaries.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/351313/size7/0c614a8f942e3f373bae64513e91c3cd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/351313/size7/0c614a8f942e3f373bae64513e91c3cd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-137568","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-137568","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":577,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-66391","title":"Catch a Ride on Raindrops","authors":["Anjali Vaidya"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A group of children travel into the skies and go on an adventure after they catch a ride on raindrops.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715549/size7/a5c8a47dabfa60113e88bae316878c5e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715549/size7/a5c8a47dabfa60113e88bae316878c5e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-66391","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-66391","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":578,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-127711","title":"Discovering Dinosaurs","authors":["Anjali  Alappat"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Long before humans evolved, dinosaurs roamed the Earth. Let’s find out more about these amazing reptiles.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715618/size7/b5a7b07919a59bf4a6e9c6b95f96544f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715618/size7/b5a7b07919a59bf4a6e9c6b95f96544f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-127711","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-127711","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":579,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15787","title":"Serious Accident","authors":["Clare Verbeek","Thembani  Dladla","Zanele Buthelezi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A boy and a girl witness a serious accident while walking down the road","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/685988/size7/76180c5f6bb40ab378c2ca9fa8f5266b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/685988/size7/76180c5f6bb40ab378c2ca9fa8f5266b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15787","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15787","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":580,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-2711","title":"The Day It Rained Fish","authors":["Ramendra Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Strange things happen at Ballu the bear's birthday party. Follow him and Avanti the zookeeper as they get drenched in a rain of fish.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722398/size7/f73385299a53bc587c014d7afde87c78.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722398/size7/f73385299a53bc587c014d7afde87c78.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-2711","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-2711","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":581,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-13966","title":"Zanele Situ: My Story","authors":["Andy Thesen","Jesse Breytenbach","Liz  Sparg"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"As a young girl Zanele Situ was told that she would never walk again. Being in a wheelchair did not stop her. She worked and trained hard and became a winning athlete on the world stage. This is her story…","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/39297/size7/64d60d6ba385c1007cb33b03a26bbd48.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/39297/size7/64d60d6ba385c1007cb33b03a26bbd48.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-13966","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-13966","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":582,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-336637","title":"How Big Is a Whale Shark?","authors":["Varsha Seshan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A whale shark is a big fish. How big is it? Is it bigger than a blue whale? Or smaller than a dolphin? Set in the marine world, this book introduces the concept of comparison.","coverUrl":"htt