mals. But he forgot to invite the elephant! What happens next? Read more to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283921/size7/8280372371062a095080656a68411143.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283921/size7/8280372371062a095080656a68411143.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213364","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-213364","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":819,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-213116","title":"The Key's Lock","authors":["Kaminee Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sandeep found a key but he cannot find its lock. Read more to find out what happens.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/285312/size7/c42453cb742c40a243d46a70cc96d28e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/285312/size7/c42453cb742c40a243d46a70cc96d28e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213116","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-213116","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":820,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-213126","title":"Hide and Seek","authors":["Nancy Siddhant Dogra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"There is a girl hiding in a tree. She will come down only when a special person calls her. Who? Read more to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283174/size7/01e070e72742d77a40bc7710b7efffcd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283174/size7/01e070e72742d77a40bc7710b7efffcd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213126","type":"application/pdf+zip","r