 wanted to take it home. Will the rat be able to take it home? Read more to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/335913/size7/cbc9859db830f4ccb48ff04472e45dae.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/335913/size7/cbc9859db830f4ccb48ff04472e45dae.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213104","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-213104","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":901,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-561819","title":"Grace: One engineer's fight to make science education accessible for all","authors":["Sayantan Datta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Grace had many questions. Why did she have to sit outside her classroom? Why did she have to wear pants instead of a dress? Why could transgender persons not study engineering? She wondered why science and technology education was not accepting of differences in people. And she decided to find answers in the courtroom. This is the story of Grace Banu, who is working towards making science and technology education more accessible for all.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727661/size7/3c8694a938efd491878f737a36124812.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727661/size7/3c8694a938efd491878f737a36124812.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-561819","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-561819","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":902,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-18135","title":"The Fox and the Lump of Clay","authors":["Amrit Mishra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A fox was friends with a lump of clay. The lump fell into the water and the fox was very sad. What happened next makes the Kui tribe sing and dance!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704024/size7/db3e2397e1ffac2670d4973ea72f7363.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704024/size7/db3e2397e1ffac2670d4973ea72f7363.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-18135","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-18135","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":903,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-11187","title":"Badshahi Park","authors":["Pragya Gopinath"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It was forbidden to go there, and to go at night to hammer a nail at the head of the grave? Ashhar was either a fool, or he was trying to be oh-so-brave. Why else would he accept Zulfi’s challenge? Would Ashhar enter the haunted tomb on a full moon night?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721706/size7/7455c3e7d30a58b67c0cb76a80888ca8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721706/size7/7455c3e7d30a58b67c0cb76a80888ca8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-11187","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-11187","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":904,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-111363","title":"Under the Microscope","authors":["C G Salamander"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Did you know that there are tiny creatures all around us? Look under a microscope to see them for yourself!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715281/size7/0875751e769cb804e0b165acf043ee1f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illust