en light and plays the jaltarang to bewitch innocent people near the village pond. Kaasni and Faizan decide to investigate if she even exists because they don't believe in jadugarnis  and paris ! This lively play interweaves fantasy and reality with rib-tickling humour to establish the importance of a clean environment. Read it and get inspired to perform it for hours of fun.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722702/size7/0189efcf74b2b1f4cb71300140844284.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722702/size7/0189efcf74b2b1f4cb71300140844284.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10735","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10735","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":955,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-136824","title":"Have You Ever Heard a Whale Sing?","authors":["Divya Panicker"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The underwater world is a noisy place. Read all about some of the strongest, largest and loudest singers under the sea — whales!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715623/size7/0c7b5790f598f06344c78303bef521d3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715623/size7/0c7b5790f598f06344c78303bef521d3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-136824","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-136824","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":956,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-20641","title":"Nomvundla and the Chilli-Eating Contest","authors":["Fortune  Tazvivinga"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nomvundla and Soko are off to the Chilli-Eating Contest. Animals come from far and wide 