39755","title":"Pig Leads the Way!","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"All the animals are hungry and the farmer hasn’t come yet to feed them. They decide to feed themselves. And that’s when things get wild!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99496/size7/ed82443804f2f535628e156279cd35a2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99496/size7/ed82443804f2f535628e156279cd35a2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-39755","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-39755","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1005,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-56802","title":"Frog's Starry Wish","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Frog loves to gaze at the stars. One night he decides he wants to touch them. He climbs a rock, a tall coconut tree, even a hillock! But the stars are always out of reach. Will Frog ever find a way to be near the stars?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/96013/size7/e997f05de22463de507bd6c3b5021ef9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/96013/size7/e997f05de22463de507bd6c3b5021ef9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-56802","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-56802","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1006,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-9909","title":"Dhyan Singh 'Chand': Hockey's Magician","authors":["Dilip D'Souza"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The man who came to be called the Wizard of Hockey, Dhyan Chand, started playing hockey with a branch of a palm tree. What did he like to eat as a child? How did he prove Hitler wrong? Here is the story of a man who might just inspire you to pick up a hockey stick and play.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/423286/size7/114b83068d8987a3daff442ef73f4a1e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/423286/size7/114b83068d8987a3daff442ef73f4a1e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-9909","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-9909","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1007,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-84798","title":"Woof-woof!","authors":["Sindiwe Magona"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Doggy wants to play, but Baby is scared.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130518/size7/d5dd746311f1650efd8d9b8ead106b39.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130518/size7/d5dd746311f1650efd8d9b8ead106b39.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-84798","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-84798","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1008,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-17482","title":"Moo Moo Brown Cow, Have You Any Milk?","authors":["Divaspathy Hegde"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Does milk come out of a packet or out of a cow? When city boy Raju visits his Ajji’s farm in the village,\nhe watches Ajji milking her cows. Raju loves the sight of the fresh milk frothing in the bucket,\nbut there is something he enjoys even more. What do you think it is?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722295/size7/a780a6ba3e61b9d677447dc481b6442b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_cro