-19835","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-19835","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1014,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-507800","title":"I See the Sea","authors":["Aditi Mali"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Chiku spills paint, Sonu doesn’t see a mess. Instead they find a whale, jellyfish and the whole ocean. Their imaginations soar as they dive in and splatter paint, juice and mud to create a whole new world out of mistakes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/582053/size7/e8ae871d00b28e2942870e1e35ee69b4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/582053/size7/e8ae871d00b28e2942870e1e35ee69b4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-507800","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-507800","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1015,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-41029","title":"The King's Crown","authors":["Richa Bhaskar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When King Anawrahta looked up to admire the tall pagoda, his crown fell down. Read this story set in present-day Myanmar to see if the crown stayed on his head.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726964/size7/0ae16bb956d9050f08df35fe1dabc4dd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726964/size7/0ae16bb956d9050f08df35fe1dabc4dd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-41029","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-41029","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1016,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-41518","t