d Tumi","authors":["Mohale  Mashigo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"“What if there’s a monster under my bed?” Tumi is scared. Mama tries to show him that everything is okay.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527548/size7/0bacccee2370b502d39470570de6f7ef.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527548/size7/0bacccee2370b502d39470570de6f7ef.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60929","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60929","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1144,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22217","title":"A Very Tall Man","authors":["Cornelius Wambi  Gulere"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A man is so tall that everything around him is too short or small. How does he resolves things?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130941/size7/4d838d03634aeb299865d8b14fd8b1f5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130941/size7/4d838d03634aeb299865d8b14fd8b1f5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22217","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22217","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1145,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-69733","title":"Spit, Spit and Spit!","authors":["Swagata Sen Pillai"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In the bushes, on the roads, while playing, while fighting -- humans love to go thoo thoo thoo. This hilarious rhyme explores the length and breadth of our spitting abilities.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727098/size7/2f57802c19b3b7c8da536d61066591c1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.stor