tp://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1155,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-177414","title":"Drop By Drop Makes the Ocean","authors":["Bhumija  Rishi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A pond in the village gradually get polluted. How does granny help the kids revive the health of the pond?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/334960/size7/711d5be5b25638a79fb7fa56bae4185f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/334960/size7/711d5be5b25638a79fb7fa56bae4185f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-177414","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-177414","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1156,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-609071","title":"Ajay of Agumbe and the Signal Snake","authors":["Zai Whitaker"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ajay is off to work. His office is in Agumbe. His job is to find the king cobra. We can see the antenna he carries, but where on earth is the radio that transmits to it? Walk with Ajay as he follows the king of snakes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705616/size7/6c58e3ce173f8062b499f3fa44a02cd5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705616/size7/6c58e3ce173f8062b499f3fa44a02cd5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-609071","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-609071","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1157,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-23593","title":"Did You Steal My Chestnuts?","authors":["Erica Cuellar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Early in the spring, Squirrel finds an empty tree trunk that is perfect for storin