0826/size7/05263f12d9868de1d6af3a29fefa59d4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/670826/size7/05263f12d9868de1d6af3a29fefa59d4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-606932","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-606932","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1334,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-608210","title":"Opposites","authors":["Eleanor  Sangma"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Let’s go on a fun trip to the Garo Hills through this book of opposites!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/695689/size7/1988a8881de7b64eb5348597841e7901.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/695689/size7/1988a8881de7b64eb5348597841e7901.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-608210","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-608210","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1335,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-602564","title":"Ban's Journey in Music","authors":["Nida Hynniewta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Music courses through the veins of Wahkhen village. Children begin to form a connection with music at a young age, however, a young boy named Ban has some trouble doing that. This is the story of Ban, seeking to find his footing in, and connection with music. This is a tale of discovering inspiration in the most unexpected, and the most everyday experiences.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675088/size7/69936945b55e1575234623c2982ed7ab.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675088/size7/69936945b55e1575234623c2982ed7ab.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://