guage and thoughtful illustrations, Kilbe explores the birth of  a creature born of unconditional love, their friendship with Due, and their encounter with Tongte Gongge, a misunderstood creature with inverted feet.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/676040/size7/da539083e5efa4919e90d7a689f50537.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/676040/size7/da539083e5efa4919e90d7a689f50537.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-605650","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-605650","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1399,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-442715","title":"All by Myself","authors":["Mini Shrinivasan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Grown-ups think I can't do anything at all. But I CAN get dressed all by myself!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727502/size7/852f48e4ee086274879b4c0f745d42e7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727502/size7/852f48e4ee086274879b4c0f745d42e7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-442715","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-442715","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1400,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-94278","title":"Shepherd and his Best Friend","authors":["Biniam Asfaw"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A young shepherd is saved from danger by his fury best friend. What danger was he facing? Read and find out!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/141813/size7/6f7e2f47799dcefb50c738deccc7fe9b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/141813/size7/6f7e2f47799dcefb50c738deccc7fe9b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-94278","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-94278","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1401,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38072","title":"Ou Ou Wants to Have Friends","authors":["Shannon David"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ou Ou likes to sing, dance and play. But he does not like his sharp porcupine spines because no one wants to play with him. A little mouse sees that Ou Ou is a good friend and his spines are not scary. Will the other animals see it too?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93511/size7/94cd17b7de02a28ee46765da68566ea4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93511/size7/94cd17b7de02a28ee46765da68566ea4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38072","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38072","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1402,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-23078","title":"The Cat's Lost Bread","authors":["Magdalena  Cooper"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Three cats always make sure they have three pieces of delicious sweet bread for dinner. But one day they find that a piece of their sweet bread has gone missing. The next day, the same thing happens! Can you help them find the thief?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120448/size7/68ee91788554c0b644271db145ac5481.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120448/size7/68ee91788554c0b644271db145ac5481.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-23078","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-23078","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1403,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-185298","title":"Gulli-danda","authors":["Vanshika Goyal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Gulli-danda is the king of all games, is simple with no rules or bets or bats or nets. Steeped in the rural scene of India, it is free of any division and discrimination. As the narrator comes back to his hometown as an established engineer, yearning for a game of gulli-danda, somehow his status and wealth has crept up between him and his childhood friends from the village, taking away the wild essence and freedom from his beloved gulli-danda.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/526072/size7/f17ddf36822d900f0c9ffb125c23b10f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/526072/size7/f17ddf36822d900f0c9ffb125c23b10f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-185298","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-185298","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1404,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-597453","title":"The Magic in Pottery","authors":["Nida Hynniewta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In a village called Siju, runs the Simsang river. The silt and clay formed in the embankments of this river help make the strongest pots in Garo Hills. Aski, a young girl who is curious about the daily activities of her grandmother, embarks on a journey of not just discovering the magic in crafting pottery, but also acquires the knowledge that is passed down from her ancestors.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675179/size7/5ec5f57eaf3aebcc928cc50430dae340.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/67