. Mai jingjing...mai jingjing..ambi mikki echoes throughout the groves.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675222/size7/020d53acd398fd550e97b7e7d2760ca8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675222/size7/020d53acd398fd550e97b7e7d2760ca8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-611147","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-611147","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1499,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-176866","title":"The Story of Help Us Green","authors":["Bhumija  Rishi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ankit Aggarwal and Bholu from Aaj Ka Jungle talk about Ankit's company 'Help us Green'. What does it do? Find out in this interesting interview.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/334950/size7/6a9e0cfd88d60120b450dc1a5336f8d6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/334950/size7/6a9e0cfd88d60120b450dc1a5336f8d6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-176866","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-176866","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1500,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-41156","title":"Look Again!","authors":["Shruthi  Rao"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Putti and Akka are coming back from the park, Putti sees a dog with ponytails! She also sees a scary monster! Look into this book to see if you can see what she saw. And if you can’t see what the sisters can see, look again at the pictures!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726966/size7/15635f91953824a04da6422127147fd7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illu