y indeed!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/637493/size7/6a932f87cf93394ae9a3b57fa0e2ff0e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/637493/size7/6a932f87cf93394ae9a3b57fa0e2ff0e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-470240","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-470240","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1513,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-122400","title":"The Cat and the Fiddle","authors":["L Frank Baum"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Bobby's left back home as his parents go to town to sell some butter and eggs and bring back groceries in exchange for them. Bobby has his fiddle that he loves to play on, the tabby-cat, the yellow dog and the moolie-cow as his companions. What happens next?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/230910/size7/a67673292351197c3650c8b928242560.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/230910/size7/a67673292351197c3650c8b928242560.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-122400","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-122400","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1514,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-648754","title":"A Home Made of Books","authors":["Jairaj Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"reading","publisher":"","summary":"A house full of books is one that’s bursting with the magic of stories. Even when\naway from home like Dadu, who is in the hospital, books become a reminder of\neverything that’s familiar, of the friendship of beloved characters, and of the hope\nthat families share together.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/744442/size7/bee736646c9dd495cb81d3b099ff6ea3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/744442/size7/bee736646c9dd495cb81d3b099ff6ea3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-648754","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-648754","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1515,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-611412","title":"Nokpante","authors":["Jody B Sangma"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Goddess Minima builds a Nokpante for her grandsons and decides to host a housewarming celebration. Seeking a brave human to join her and the other mites, they invite young Noro. Noro becomes the first human to witness and learn about the Nokpante.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675512/size7/d3cd25bb71f32f42a24669e7f16524e3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/675512/size7/d3cd25bb71f32f42a24669e7f16524e3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-611412","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-611412","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1516,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-308094","title":"The Guardians of Bodha","authors":["Niranjan  Rajkumar Priya"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"There is some bad news – all the villages around Bodha are flooded. But Bodha is safe and sound! What saved this village from disaster? Who are the Guardians of Bodha? A wise man, Gautham, shares the secret in this story.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/410162/size7/b42667dc6d17a0af3efed8f052cc333d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/410162/size7/b42667dc6d17a0af3efed8f052cc333d.jpg"