fuses to clean up. Then one night she has a dream. What happens after that?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720260/size7/bfaca307e321a40d4fce0bf9bade9047.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720260/size7/bfaca307e321a40d4fce0bf9bade9047.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-202","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-202","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":25,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-39753","title":"Rabbit Becomes a Chef","authors":["Magdalena  Cooper"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Raw carrots for breakfast. Raw carrots for lunch. Raw carrots for dinner. Rabbit is tired of eating raw carrots and wants to learn how to cook them into a tasty curry.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/105036/size7/18f8fd4a121fc54acd71d658d4013da8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/105036/size7/18f8fd4a121fc54acd71d658d4013da8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-39753","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-39753","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":26,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-27121","title":"When Will Amma Be Back?","authors":["Prathiba Swaminathan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Roja’s mother leaves for work early in the day. She promises to be back by bedtime. What will Roja do all day without Amma?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524572/size7/86f5aa351b9a396b64694cb8b5f0a555.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524572/size7/86f5aa351b9a396b64694cb8b5f0a555.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":