","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37232","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":32,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-34971","title":"Sailing Ships and Sinking Spoons","authors":["Jamyang Gyaltsen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tenzin and Tashi, two young Tibetan monks, and Genla, the beloved storyteller of the monastery, wonder why a small steel spoon sinks in water but a huge ship floats. Their science teacher Miss Sonam helps them experiment with an apple, a spoon and a tub-full of water to learn more about objects that float.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717230/size7/b192003f504666cffb50823a65999e64.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717230/size7/b192003f504666cffb50823a65999e64.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-34971","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-34971","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":33,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-946","title":"Too Much Noise","authors":["Rohini Nilekani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sringeri Srinivas, the farmer,  has to take his cows along the new highway, to the cattle fair. But the highway is just too noisy. What does he do? How does he solve this problem? Read on to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703953/size7/788a320045339daf95e6616b6a80dd8e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703953/size7/788a320045339daf95e6616b6a80dd8e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-946","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-946","type":"applicatio