ary":"This picture book describes various fishing techniques – from fishing with traditional rods to using nets. The entire village in this story has gone for fishing. Let’s go fish with them!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93896/size7/94d5619b2dd7478c430b5dc5f669a763.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93896/size7/94d5619b2dd7478c430b5dc5f669a763.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-36201","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-36201","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":160,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-28887","title":"Creatures of Old","authors":["Veena Prasad"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ever wondered what the planet was like millions of years ago? What kind of creatures roamed the Earth? What trees grew in the prehistoric forests? Well, there is a way to find out—through palaeontology, a special science that is all about digging up and unscrambling clues to the past.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724109/size7/ffde7fb4ad46096f5a5b5ac794c0dfce.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724109/size7/ffde7fb4ad46096f5a5b5ac794c0dfce.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-28887","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-28887","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":161,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-39842","title":"Whale in the Sky","authors":["Siddharth  Chakravarty"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Join Dadu and Muznah on their cloud-watching expedition, and dive into the ocean to learn about blue whales.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illus