ent kinds. It can be soft, it can be rough, you can smell it and even taste it.  Best of all is that you can picnic on grass.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/474156/size7/d3b59531e7aa166d232530da42547ac8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/474156/size7/d3b59531e7aa166d232530da42547ac8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-336656","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-336656","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":213,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-353206","title":"The Birthday Menu","authors":["Meenu Thomas"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It is Kanchi’s birthday and she can’t go out to her favourite restaurant. Knowing that baingan bharta is all she has to look forward to, she is really upset. But her neighbours in Sunrise Society know that the best way to turn things around is with a feast! A story about community, compassion, and the food we eat.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727417/size7/6a5199c6c3a470dbd30154529ea8a4bc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727417/size7/6a5199c6c3a470dbd30154529ea8a4bc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-353206","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-353206","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":214,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-184","title":"Look At Me","authors":["Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"100daysreadingcampaignPunjab2022","publisher":"","summary":"Meet the children in the book. They are just like you!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721874/size7/8ecac1b7b1c40058b7d2b62254e358d7.jpg",