 She talks with Rahmat, the Kabuliwala. Rahmat gives her cashews and kishmish. A beautiful relationship develops between them based on the airy hills of Afghanistan and his own daughter who he had to leave behind at home. But circumstances force Rehmat to end up in jail!\nYears later, it’s Mini’s wedding day and Rehmat walks out with his freedom into a world that has moved on without him.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/331524/size7/38c3ac68b99d765c8c2402b06ac97b71.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/331524/size7/38c3ac68b99d765c8c2402b06ac97b71.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-181480","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-181480","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":244,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-32832","title":"Behind the Lie","authors":["Asha Nehemiah"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Valli and Ramesh live under a cloud of fear because of their father, who has a frightening temper. Will things ever change for them? A story about domestic violence, grit and hope.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713827/size7/f0bc807027e81b582713864f4cb60cf1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713827/size7/f0bc807027e81b582713864f4cb60cf1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-32832","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-32832","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":245,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-45722","title":"Bow Meow Wow","authors":["Priya Kuriyan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A dog, a cat and a hilarious encounter await in this action-packed book about colours.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727012/size7/b69da3dedb4c4da0dbfa9620a8999af8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727012/size7/b69da3dedb4c4da0dbfa9620a8999af8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-45722","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-45722","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":246,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-981","title":"Wailers Three - A Folktale From China","authors":["Greystroke"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mrs. Chang gets a letter from her son one day. She asks Warrior Wen to read it out to her. One look at the letter and Warrior Wen bursts into tears. Very soon, Mrs.Chang starts bawling. Next, Peddlar Peng, who is passing, by joins the sobbing duo. What has happened to Mrs. Chang's son? Find out for yourself in this delightful folktale from China?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-981","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-981","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":247,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-13919","title":"Little Sock and the Tiny Creatures","authors":["Jon Keevy"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It’s wash day for the Socks, but where has Little Sock gone?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38638/size7/bba9d63774f7cfbb4f7792882b0029f1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38638/size7/bba