w what they were called? Let's meet a delightful herd of dinosaurs.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727137/size7/9d54b0e2111078b83bc6d3ec447c18ee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727137/size7/9d54b0e2111078b83bc6d3ec447c18ee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-96446","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-96446","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":322,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-112040","title":"Button Box","authors":["Aparna  Kapur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Whatever you wear, a button knows. After all, that’s the way a button rolls. A story as cute as a button.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-112040","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-112040","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":323,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103458","title":"Book of Bhoots","authors":["Shabnam  Minwalla"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Who whispers your name in the wind on this moonless night? Maybe nothing. Maybe something. Turn the pages of this book, and maybe you’ll hear it. And if you do, there’s no going back.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723696/size7/e0ce37ed7c3c01ca31cf9fd159adcc8b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723696/size7/e0ce37ed7c3c01ca31cf9fd159adcc8b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103458","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103458","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":324,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42989","title":"Who is Faster?","authors":["Rose Larsen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Which animal is fast and which is slow? This book tells young readers which animals are faster than others.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101398/size7/20ce9555025b846ccb27ae94345a490a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101398/size7/20ce9555025b846ccb27ae94345a490a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42989","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42989","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":325,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-95108","title":"Wet or Dry","authors":["Lovleen  Misra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What do you do with your waste? Do you have separate bins for the wet and the dry? Read this fun poem and give it a try.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/145759/size7/beb14f9fe944bd7f5b8da10710b44755.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/145759/size7/beb14f9fe944bd7f5b8da10710b44755.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-95108","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-95108","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":326,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-91871","title":"Sringeri Srinivas's Cow Must Moo!","authors":["Rohini Nilekani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sringeri Srinivas is back with a new problem. His cow has stopped mooing and he is very angry. The farmer frowns at her. His children feed her sweets. But the cow does not moo. Join this lovable farmer's family and his new cat Manuli, in this tale with a twist.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703876/size7/b8450198b14417eb987648711d009944.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703876/size7/b8450198b14417eb987648711d009944.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-91871","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-91871","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":327,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-111783","title":"A Kulfi for Free!","authors":["Sherein Bansal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Childhood, hot summers and the narrow lanes of Jodhpur are uniquely connected to mouth-watering kulfi! How many kulfis should Bhanwari buy?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715260/size7/21022b43ed0c07247343a2f2b5de77f9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715260/size7/21022b43ed0c07247343a2f2b5de77f9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-111783","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-111783","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":328,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43364","title":"Chunu and Munu Read","authors":["Stephanie  Wei"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Chunu and Munu discover the joys of reading!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101414/size7/027db7659010cd4302f65b21b02a5688.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101414/size7/027db7659010cd4302f65b21b02a5688.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43364","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-43364","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":329,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-111755","title":"Rainbow Girls","authors":["Kamla Bhasin"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Are all girls alike? Do they like the same things, should they all dress similarly? Let's think about it.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723769/size7/9f2d836cd9446a608320018eb9b12086.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723769/size7/9f2d836cd9446a608320018eb9b12086.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-111755","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-111755","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":330,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-119223","title":"The Time-Travelling River","authors":["Parinita Shetty"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Imagine all the stories rivers could tell us about the past, present and future!\nRivers were there when humans wanted to grow food. They were there when humans started to build cities. They are still here, providing water, food and livelihoods. But they are also being treated like rubbish bins. Rivers know how to take care of us, but if we want a future with them, maybe it is time for humans to take care of our precious water bodies.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/196531/size7/011dc21c4087678d4acf7f20de6a0ff6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/196531/size7/011dc21c4087678d4acf7f20de6a0ff6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-119223","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-119223","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":331,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-113431","title":"Home","authors":["Fausto Aarya De Santis"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Hasina and her family live happily in their rainy village. Until one day the tides turn, and Amma and young Hasina are swept away by fear. They join a river of escaping people. They become refugees in a new country, away from everything that is familiar. A story that explores the meaning of home.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/518337/size7/f324e69b9a98fdcaed6a391bcd6c4412.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/518337/size7/f324e69b9a98fdcaed6a391bcd6c4412.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-113431","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-113431","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":332,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-13814","title":"A Tiny Seed: The Story of Wangari Maathai","authors":["Nicola  Rijsdijk"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In a village on the slopes of Mount Kenya, a little girl worked in the fields with her mother. She worried as she saw the big forests disappearing, but she knew the power of a tiny seed.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38302/size7/5d549c1f79ee67ff88457eb15e032565.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38302/size7/5d549c1f79ee67ff88457eb15e032565.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-13814","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-13814","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":333,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103141","title":"Let's Count Legs","authors":["All Children Reading Cambodia"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Whose legs are these? Let's count them!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527520/size7/597c7c2e4a75d9b72656ffce8afbca3a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527520/size7/597c7c2e4a75d9b72656ffce8afbca3a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103141","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103141","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":334,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15050","title":"How Many?","authors":["Clare Verbeek","Thembani  Dladla","Zanele Buthelezi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Some animals and birds want to meet you! All they are asking you to do is count some things for them. Will you?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118192/size7/73fd05ed78bd9a4e5e6ac8a0ef70f181.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118192/size7/73fd05ed78bd9a4e5e6ac8a0ef70f181.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15050","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15050","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":335,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-9838","title":"Handmade in India","authors":["Olivia Fraser"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Olivia Fraser has travelled around India painting for the past many years. This book has arisen from her observations of the vast colourful array of people she has come across \nduring her travels.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117159/size7/443e0dc11c25b7e2248a06b2096057c1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117159/size7/443e0dc11c25b7e2248a06b2096057c1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-9838","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-9838","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":336,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-111303","title":"I Spy a Lake!","authors":["Menaka Raman"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Manju and Hamid are playing a game of I Spy by the lake. But why is the game making Hamid sad? And what can they do about it? A story about pollution and the declining state of water bodies.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/196528/size7/4b27744f1d84c940dbf9370defe8966a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/196528/size7/4b27744f1d84c940dbf9370defe8966a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-111303","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-111303","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":337,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-108113","title":"Bobo and the Worms","authors":["Abokali Jimomi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Worms are chewing up plants. Bobo is on a mission to stop them. Can she manage it?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495594/size7/9fec4d87f484e7a1832f21cae4834f7b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495594/size7/9fec4d87f484e7a1832f21cae4834f7b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-108113","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-108113","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":338,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-99552","title":"Gudugu Thadugu","authors":["Ashok Rajagopalan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Muni the mason has to break a shed and make a new clinic. He goes up the hill asking various people to help him. But sometimes help takes on an unexpected form!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495625/size7/cb7272fca8729d1afce929ec613d09f9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495625/size7/cb7272fca8729d1afce929ec613d09f9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-99552","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-99552","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":339,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-31922","title":"Why are Bubbles Round?","authors":["Sukanya  Sinha"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maya and Manu want to see if they can make bubbles of different shapes. Like them, you too can learn about bubbles and their shapes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717015/size7/7e694fb5fdd89111f6964e007a88db37.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717015/size7/7e694fb5fdd89111f6964e007a88db37.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-31922","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-31922","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":340,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-269397","title":"The Birthday Cake","authors":["Andaleeb Wajid"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Azad, Haniya, Charulata and Pi