nging Birds","authors":["Sanjana  Khoobchandani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Bounthy’s father captures birds and puts them in cages. Bounthy likes listening to the birds singing, but one day the birds stop singing. Will Bounthy be able to make the birds sing again?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93888/size7/1ef129b63ff5f374611f1296857cd642.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93888/size7/1ef129b63ff5f374611f1296857cd642.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-36289","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-36289","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":360,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-8028","title":"Avani and the Pea Plant","authors":["Shruthi  Rao"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Who did it? Avani does not know. Her mother does not know. But you will know who did it when you read this book about a pea plant.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/26596/size7/c506a61bdb5cf05f48f5d62d9067927c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/26596/size7/c506a61bdb5cf05f48f5d62d9067927c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-8028","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-8028","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":361,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-352163","title":"Paati's Gold","authors":["Meenu Thomas"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Paati and Appa are worried because of the failing rice crops. But Paati has an answer hidden in a wooden box, a secret more precious than gold. Savi and Selvan watch Paati unlock the power of indigenous seeds and knowledge 