wl and prowl. Watch out!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/157772/size7/c22c969c00ed3abf7b7e06e6075fa53c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/157772/size7/c22c969c00ed3abf7b7e06e6075fa53c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-48013","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-48013","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":402,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-123206","title":"Why Do Sunflowers Love the Sun?","authors":["Siddharth Mehta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"All Viveka wants to do is paint the perfect picture of the sunflower field next to her house. But why won’t the flowers stay still?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/541210/size7/b5c6ad71003d7f28d6aeceef1a5e5a95.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/541210/size7/b5c6ad71003d7f28d6aeceef1a5e5a95.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-123206","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-123206","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":403,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-59533","title":"Why Don't Birds Comb Their Hair?","authors":["Suchi Govindarajan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Some birds have hair that sticks out in funny ways. What would you do if you had hair like that? Read this book to meet some fascinating birds.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715403/size7/facfcb3ed0569c840e40a087e98ba009.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715403/size7/facfcb3ed0569c840e40a087e98ba009.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pd