ition"}]},{"id":467,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-28241","title":"My Inside Weather","authors":["Jen  Thorpe"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sometimes our feelings are hard to talk about, but everyone knows how to talk about the weather.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85534/size7/6e8e6e5ebe8a509c6cac6b397e0ad36a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85534/size7/6e8e6e5ebe8a509c6cac6b397e0ad36a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-28241","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-28241","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":468,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-3625","title":"Why Do Bees Buzz?","authors":["Nabanita Deshmukh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Why can't bees work quietly? They buzz because there are some very good reasons to do so. Learn about the humble bees in this book.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712557/size7/923f83c35af803721c0069afdc49bd7f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712557/size7/923f83c35af803721c0069afdc49bd7f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-3625","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-3625","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":469,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-444797","title":"Where Is Your School?","authors":["Sai Keskar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Schools are not just for kids! On his way to school, Pintoo finds some interesting schools! Do you want to see them? Look inside!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727493/size7/21776053ccf55e215d97c6b50d6c8bc5.jpg","thumb