562.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93901/size7/28d55955f272bfc6991e98ebea109562.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-36470","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-36470","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":491,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-121978","title":"The Grass Seeker","authors":["Uddalak Gupta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"As the weather turns warm, Room Singh takes his flock of goats and sheep and scales the Himalayas for fresh grass. With global warming a reality, this photo book traces the journey that a Gaddi shepherd has been making for the last 40 years.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/674076/size7/bd639ecc34bcfc59ac0f39900fe565bd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/674076/size7/bd639ecc34bcfc59ac0f39900fe565bd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-121978","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-121978","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":492,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-51767","title":"A Suitable Shell","authors":["Radha Rangarajan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mili the hermit crab has lost her shell. She combs the beach for a suitable shell, but all she meets is litter, people, and angry snails. Will Mili find a shell before it gets too hot?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/537878/size7/fcee6e9d81481cb027d4fd946e8012f8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/537878/size7/fcee6e9d81481cb027d4fd946e8012f8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-51767","type"