":"Mama Wagtail is worried because her baby Grumpus does not know how to show that he is happy. But how do animals and birds show that they are happy? Find out in this wonderful story about animals and birds.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91201/size7/0ee8dc76299cc7e12a8829ab47850ca3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91201/size7/0ee8dc76299cc7e12a8829ab47850ca3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-51276","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-51276","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":498,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-136847","title":"Kick, Start, Go!","authors":["Nikhil Gulati"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Have you ever wondered how a motorcycle works? It all begins with a kick!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188858/size7/de395e43c427984657880d799020ce6f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188858/size7/de395e43c427984657880d799020ce6f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-136847","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-136847","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":499,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-14178","title":"Fly By Bye!","authors":["Sonal Goyal","Sumit Sakhuja"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In this wordless story, let's explore our world from the perspective of a fly.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717941/size7/a6572759ac00204199b69d9e391c4836.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717941/size7/a6572759ac00204199b69d9e391c4836.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://stor