 angry voices. The night is dark but a fire rages in the distance. Chaitu is terrified for her family, friends and home. Why are these voices so angry? What do they want? A story set in a world fed by fear\nand intolerance.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/710426/size7/dc91ffc6c1d42b6c393ee8c400316dfa.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/710426/size7/dc91ffc6c1d42b6c393ee8c400316dfa.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-122657","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-122657","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":503,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-23017","title":"Princess Bahati","authors":["Sanjana  Khoobchandani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Princess Bahati’s kingdom is facing a big problem, and the young princess has an idea that might help. But will the King and the elders listen to her advice?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120011/size7/7ea9bcf241ee1a4202197ed639d95233.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120011/size7/7ea9bcf241ee1a4202197ed639d95233.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-23017","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-23017","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":504,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15758","title":"Grandfather Goes on Strike","authors":["K.S.  Nagarajan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Most grandfathers are content to lie back\nin an armchair and lazily read the day's \nnewspaper. Not our tree loving senior citizen.\nHe goes on strike for his beloved trees\nand a series of hilarious events liven up this \nentertaining tale. Read on to find out\nwho saves the day and who saves the trees!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697279/size7/ac806eb8fbccf09f3be7e392bb3ba9b2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697279/size7/ac806eb8fbccf09f3be7e392bb3ba9b2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15758","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15758","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":505,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-149071","title":"Arun in Ruins","authors":["C G Salamander"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Arun and Arunachalam are stuck inside a mysterious old palace. The only way they can get out is by building an electronic circuit. But how will they do it?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/202930/size7/56578534ef3390627c24976344c17172.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/202930/size7/56578534ef3390627c24976344c17172.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-149071","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-149071","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":506,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-162851","title":"Emotions Come and Go","authors":["Mimi  Werna"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Look out for the emotions you feel and why!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/231859/size7/bdb9d057c77432781e3e911d92aa1bfe.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/231859/size7/bdb9d057c77432781e3e911d92aa1bfe.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-162851","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acq