 leaves are tiny, others are not. Some taste sweet, others bitter. There are so many different kinds of leaves around us. Leaf through the leaves of this book about leaves.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725226/size7/853dcaabef8ae2b388b4ccc36003a038.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725226/size7/853dcaabef8ae2b388b4ccc36003a038.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-259479","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-259479","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":510,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22483","title":"A Very Green Day","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Greeny has so much energy. She doesn't want to nap! One day, she decides to run away. After playing in the hot sun for a while, Greeny gets tired and wants to go home. But now she's lost! How will she get home to her dad?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128573/size7/1c8f6b19b30f9b21d2e8056d18a04ab7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128573/size7/1c8f6b19b30f9b21d2e8056d18a04ab7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22483","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22483","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":511,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-45764","title":"Where is Lulu?","authors":["Clyde   Beech","Mohale  Mashigo","Nkosingiphile  Mazibuko"],"language":"","readingLevel":"reading","publisher":"","summary":"Where is Lulu and why is she hiding?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/86909/size7/e76f4e617cb3e6b2221821f6f21c447a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.