7/c0dcb0a313c6150a9be9967ce352d6d7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99497/size7/c0dcb0a313c6150a9be9967ce352d6d7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-39756","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-39756","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":571,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-12756","title":"Chintu","authors":["Kanchan Bannerjee"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Meet Chintu. He is a special dog! There are other dogs in this story too. Would you like to meet them?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/389128/size7/19ea2321a4747fc5040f6f361eaa4de5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/389128/size7/19ea2321a4747fc5040f6f361eaa4de5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-12756","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-12756","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":572,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50338","title":"What Will Happen?","authors":["Varsha Seshan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What will happen if Sunita presses her belly button? Or if she pulls her ears? A story about the power of imagination which also introduces children to different parts of the body.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726929/size7/15b2e1748d152812ed5526070aca52ef.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726929/size7/15b2e1748d152812ed5526070aca52ef.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50338","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50338","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":573,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-337219","title":"Our Library","authors":["Raviraj Shetty"],"language":"","readingLevel":"reading","publisher":"","summary":"Do you like cars, and dinosaurs, and reading about them? Do you have questions and ideas? Do you like to be read to? Or do you like to read alone in a quiet corner? Come in, welcome to our library!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/434081/size7/6a48dc7eadd7baa7367e105d529b809f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/434081/size7/6a48dc7eadd7baa7367e105d529b809f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-337219","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-337219","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":574,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10824","title":"Kallu's world 3 - Mangu Mali and the Ambia Bhoot","authors":["Subhadra Sen Gupta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Welcome to Khajuria – a village where young Kallu and his gang run delightful adventurous riots almost everyday. Sometimes they question the village traditions, defy bullies or might just be going about their daily business but Kallu and his gang are up for anything. Join them as they grow wiser and wittier, happily roaming the village finding new things to do, and see what they come up with!\nEverybody in Khajuria knew about Munia's temper. Everybody also knew how stingy Mangu Mali was about giving away mangoes from the tree in his orchard. Now, Munia wanted mangoes...really badly and that too from Mangu Mali's orchard. Can you imagine a situation like this? Read on, to find out what happens...","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/31115/size7/6d83c8e348dae277f57773d74ef2f9e2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/31115/size7/6d83c8e348dae277f57773d74ef2f9e2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10824","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10824","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":575,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-34983","title":"Under the Invisibility Cloak","authors":["Varsha  Joshi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What would you do if you had an invisibility cloak? For one, playing hide-and-seek would be great fun. But is anyone making invisibility cloaks? Or do they exist only in science fiction and fantasy stories? Arnav and Tanisha head to the library to find out. Let’s follow them quietly – they can’t see us, we are invisible in their world.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117560/size7/aea0af0ba611e75850bc4dd4c24a7c54.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117560/size7/aea0af0ba611e75850bc4dd4c24a7c54.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-34983","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-34983","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":576,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-137568","title":"Your Body Is Yours","authors":["Yamini Vijayan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Your body is unique and it belongs only to you. Get to know it, and learn to take good care of it. A book that aims to start open and healthy conversations around our bodies, and our right to say no to anyone who does not respect boundaries.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/351313/size7/0c614a8f942e3f373bae64513e91c3cd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/351313/size7/0c614a8f942e3f373bae64513e91c3cd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-137568","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-137568","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":577,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-66391","title":"Catch a Ride on Raindrops","authors":["Anjali Vaidya"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A group of children travel into the skies and go on an adventure after they catch a ride on raindrops.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715549/size7/a5c8a47dabfa60113e88bae316878c5e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715549/size7/a5c8a47dabfa60113e88bae316878c5e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-66391","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-66391","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":578,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-127711","title":"Discovering Dinosaurs","authors":["Anjali  Alappat"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Long before humans evolved, dinosaurs roamed the Earth. Let’s find out more about these amazing reptiles.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715618/size7/b5a7b07919a59bf4a6e9c6b95f96544f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715618/size7/b5a7b07919a59bf4a6e9c6b95f96544f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-127711","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-127711","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":579,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15787","title":"Serious Accident","authors":["Clare Verbeek","Thembani  Dladla","Zanele Buthelezi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A boy and a girl witness a serious accident while walking down the road","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/685988/size7/76180c5f6bb40ab378c2ca9fa8f5266b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/685988/size7/76180c5f6bb40ab378c2ca9fa8f5266b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15787","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15787","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":580,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-2711","title":"The Day It Rained Fish","authors":["Ramendra Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Strange things happen at Ballu the bear's birthday party. Follow him and Avanti the zookeeper as they get drenched in a rain of fish.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722398/size7/f73385299a53bc587c014d7afde87c78.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722398/size7/f73385299a53bc587c014d7afde87c78.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-2711","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-2711","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":581,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-13966","title":"Zanele Situ: My Story","authors":["Andy Thesen","Jesse Breytenbach","Liz  Sparg"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"As a young girl Zanele Situ was told that she would never walk again. Being in a wheelchair did not stop her. She worked and trained hard and became a winning athlete on the world stage. This is her story…","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/39297/size7/64d60d6ba385c1007cb33b03a26bbd48.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/39297/size7/64d60d6ba385c1007cb33b03a26bbd48.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-13966","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-13966","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":582,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-336637","title":"How Big Is a Whale Shark?","authors":["Varsha Seshan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A whale shark is a big fish. How big is it? Is it bigger than a blue whale? Or smaller than a dolphin? Set in the marine world, this book introduces the concept of comparison.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/436694/size7/84cc78460481cb7264e291c1f3137fb0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/436694/size7/84cc78460481cb7264e291c1f3137fb0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-336637","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-336637","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":583,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-23622","title":"May Searches for the Sea","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"May lives in a mountaintop village miles away from the sea. When her teacher tells her class about his own village by the ocean, May is breathless. She is desperate to see this mysterious sea—but how?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128565/size7/1846c85eeb6d6751a5d2ea8e7235c6ac.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128565/size7/1846c85eeb6d6751a5d2ea8e7235c6ac.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-23622","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-23622","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":584,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-265897","title":"At Home","authors":["Shweta Ganesh Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ammini misses school, and her brother Unni misses his aunt. Both of them miss playing in the park. But everyone has to stay indoors. Maybe they can go out for a walk today? Ammini hopes so. A day in the life of two children in a time of lockdowns and social distancing.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362389/size7/92cfd489ab32329c3852cad118700016.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362389/size7/92cfd489ab32329c3852cad118700016.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-265897","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-265897","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":585,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-14785","title":"Ah! Football!","authors":["Stella   Kihweo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"On their way to buy salt and oil for grandma, two boys start playing football with their friends!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40589/size7/c5c5da7d40486a5acbefd71a7d7d1e17.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40589/size7/c5c5da7d40486a5acbefd71a7d7d1e17.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-14785","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-14785","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":586,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-263984","title":"Everyday Superheroes","authors":["Minakshi  Dewan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Superheroes don’t always wear capes, or carry weapons. They don’t always fly. Some superheroes wear masks and protective suits. Some carry stethoscopes and thermometers. And some look through microscopes and examine lab reports. A book on everyday heroes in the time of a pandemic.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-263984","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-263984","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":587,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-146096","title":"What Happens When You Flush?","authors":["Vani Vasudev"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nozy the pet rat finds himself in the underground sewers. It’s a good thing Cheeky is around to take him on a splashy, smelly adventure!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/203168/size7/3d957f5d94c59837655fef02fa903ba4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/203168/size7/3d957f5d94c59837655fef02fa903ba4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-146096","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-146096","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":588,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-36223","title":"My Cousin Visits My Village","authors":["Silima Keopaseuth"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nouy lives in a village in the countryside. One day, her cousin Ek comes to visit. He is from the city. Nouk shows him everything she loves about her village. Will Ek love her village, too?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93890/size7/6aa12ace7b85c87658972c06a0659da9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93890/size7/6aa12ace7b85c87658972c06a0659da9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-36223","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-36223","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":589,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-60807","title":"Ma! Hurry Up!!","authors":["Madhav Chavan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"100daysreadingcampaignPunjab2022","publisher":"","summary":"The boy in the story is in a real hurry. \nWouldn’t you like to find out why?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722227/size7/b27ba54e44d9b32557ac07737dc6ca74.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722227/size7/b27ba54e44d9b32557ac07737dc6ca74.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60807","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60807","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":590,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25462","title":"3... 2... 1... Blast-off!","authors":["Praba Ram","Sheela Preuitt"],"language":"go","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"This count-down book introduces readers to fascinating celestial objects, to space concepts and to the people involved in the various facets of astronomy. It may just inspire them to take a step towards a career in astronomy. Come, let us go space travelling!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725409/size7/68faf41858abcdbc3d0c3dc087899216.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725409/size7/68faf41858abcdbc3d0c3dc087899216.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25462","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25462","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":591,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-160297","title":"Moonlight in the Sea","authors":["Kartik Shanker"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Fatima grows up on an idyllic island in the Lakshadweep, watched over by Nihla, the moon. She falls in love with the underwater world of colourful corals, fascinating fish, mysterious manta rays, grizzled old turtles and dancing dolphins. One day, in a terrible storm, she gets lost at sea. Join Fatima on her incredible adventure on remote islands with wonderful marine creatures.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495444/size7/426c88236440f481778e9bd837e0aafa.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495444/size7/426c88236440f481778e9bd837e0aafa.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-160297","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-160297","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":592,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-136996","title":"Ma, Is That You?","authors":["Aakanksha Mittra","Parth Nadkarni"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Who’s that at the door? Is it Ma or a big, scary monster? Bibi, Azeem, Juzer and Thei Thei must make sure that it’s the right person before they let them enter their clubhouse.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/216392/size7/2c6aa8668929bca782c729939ece2bfe.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/216392/size7/2c6aa8668929bca782c729939ece2bfe.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href"