? A deer? Follow Rinki as she finds out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725077/size7/8de0f29bfba8ad0e01dcbff59b0a46b0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725077/size7/8de0f29bfba8ad0e01dcbff59b0a46b0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-127691","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-127691","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":610,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-70193","title":"The Starlight Adventure","authors":["Parinita Shetty"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Naina and Madhav decide to settle their disagreement in outer space. They end up meeting a host of odd characters – from a unicorn who can't stop eating to a dragon who won't stop crying. But who are these glowy creatures? A space adventure that introduces readers to constellations in the night sky.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715246/size7/9836f4784ff49053c387040a01426ad6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715246/size7/9836f4784ff49053c387040a01426ad6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-70193","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-70193","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":611,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25932","title":"Stick Your Tongue Out!","authors":["Praba Ram","Sheela Preuitt"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Do you think all tongues are soft and pink like yours? Animals have tongues of various shapes, sizes and colours. They use their tongues in many different ways, but not for talking like humans do.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724139/size7/a690782932e9a84bf87b3e0184a17cfc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724139/size7/a690782932e9a84bf87b3e0184a17cfc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25932","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25932","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":612,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16","title":"Vayu, the Wind","authors":["Rohini Nilekani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A nice story about this silent and always present friend, the wind does a lot of things without anybody's notice!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722240/size7/f6b5a4048ee646dd2c32af6ac5e66e23.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722240/size7/f6b5a4048ee646dd2c32af6ac5e66e23.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-16","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":613,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22302","title":"Squirrel Goes to School","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Trang lives in a mountaintop village with her friend Squirrel. One day, she asks Squirrel to come to school. But school sounds like no fun. And school is so far away. Will Squirrel be brave for his best friend?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119964/size7/3103ddb647070d37eccd9a8555696161.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119964/size7/3103ddb647070d37eccd9a8555696161.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22302","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"http