her? Can Sharanya find a way to talk to him?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720046/size7/61f7713e7da97aaeaba6086bf69eca76.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720046/size7/61f7713e7da97aaeaba6086bf69eca76.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-113896","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-113896","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":617,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-261640","title":"My Red T-shirt","authors":["Rohini Nilekani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Aman loves his red T-shirt, because it is so bright and so soft. His Ma hates it, because it is old and has holes in it. She wants to throw it away. He wants to keep it. What is Aman going to do?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/719500/size7/7a8e3961bad059f312c0aae8026e38ea.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/719500/size7/7a8e3961bad059f312c0aae8026e38ea.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-261640","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-261640","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":618,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-12513","title":"The Dance of  the Flamingo","authors":["Anita Mani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Living like lotus flowers on water, the sight of pink flamingos is one of the most beautiful sights of the natural world. Why are they pink? Do they put on make-up? Do they have even a single bone in their long neck? Here is a book of photographs that answers all the questions about these graceful birds.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/35241/size7/754e9eccdfecc87ccbcee58026ff636e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/35241/size7/754e9eccdfecc87ccbcee58026ff636e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-12513","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-12513","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":619,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-60914","title":"My Dream in The Drawer","authors":["Fred Strydom"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"I once had a dream, so small and light, I kept it in a box. I kept it hidden, safe and sound, In my drawer of socks.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527477/size7/ec03a8394b99362fadf3d7773b55ce92.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527477/size7/ec03a8394b99362fadf3d7773b55ce92.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60914","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60914","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":620,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-188","title":"Sister, Sister, Why don't things fall up?","authors":["Roopa Pai"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Little Brother's inquisitive mind is always full of questions for Big Sister. He knows Big Sister has all the answers, because she is always reading one big fat book or another. In this book, Little Brother wonders why things don't 'fall up'? At least Mother wouldn't grumble about the mess he was always making on the floor! Of course, Big Sister has the right answer in the end, but before you start reading this fun book to find out, tell us: why do YOU think things fall down?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722409/size7/6fba8609c6e66c4289bbcef0bfcb7e0a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722409/size7/6fba8609c6e66c4289bbcef0bfcb7e0a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-188","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-188","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":621,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-9847","title":"The Adventures of Philautus Frog","authors":["Kartik Shanker"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Philautus, the little tree frog wants to see the wide blue sea, so far away from his home on Big Tree, in the middle of a forest. Take a magnificent trek with Philautus across the Western Ghats teeming with creatures that are funny, fat and fascinating. Seasoned with humour, this lush book reveals the splendours of the wild through a compelling tale.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/29639/size7/cfbcf6f1aa30ca587bf2ba269bb87a31.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/29639/size7/cfbcf6f1aa30ca587bf2ba269bb87a31.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-9847","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-9847","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":622,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-188181","title":"Jackpot","authors":["Poonam S. Kudesia"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Vikram has high and lofty dreams. He wants to travel the world like a prince and build a library that's unparalleled in its glory. But Vikram can't be bothered with working hard to earn his desires. He looks for the easy way to attain his dreams, and hence proceeds to buy a lottery ticket. Does he win the lottery and finally travel the world? Or does his life begin to crumble due to his thirst and greed for easy money?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/526075/size7/7b79b1b0249f33e7c975016f745073c4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/526075/size7/7b79b1b0249f33e7c975016f745073c4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-188181","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-188181","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":623,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-213147","title":"Grandpa's Teeth","authors":["Nancy Siddhant Dogra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Before sleeping, Grandpa kept his set of teeth in water. But in the morning, it was not there. Where did Grandpa's set of teeth go? Let us find out...","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/300008/size7/58dbc6b955079b7f2e34c25b3d2de6eb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/300008/size7/58dbc6b955079b7f2e34c25b3d2de6eb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213147","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-213147","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":624,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15195","title":"My Red Ball","authors":["Khothatso Ranoosi","Marion  Drew"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A girl kicks a red ball. Where does it go?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118202/size7/66045eb37943f1dc073843fe9d32b92e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118202/size7/66045eb37943f1dc073843fe9d32b92e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15195","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15195","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":625,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-213119","title":"Ants","authors":["Kaminee Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Do you know where ants build their homes and what they eat? Read more to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283168/size7/e3c7076c903ab9f82ec702f514a18a25.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283168/size7/e3c7076c903ab9f82ec702f514a18a25.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-213119","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-213119","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":626,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-160","title":"Suraj and Sher Singh","authors":["Anupa Lal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Meet Suraj and Sher Singh as they have fun in the park!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127522/size7/8cf9a2a4c77304b36929ad3151cad63e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127522/size7/8cf9a2a4c77304b36929ad3151cad63e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-160","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-160","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":627,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-123172","title":"Why Do Sunbirds Eat All Day?","authors":["Anusha Shankar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Have you ever seen small colourful birds flying about in your garden? Why do they keep flitting from flower to flower? How do they get the energy to stay up in the air? Follow the two sunbirds, Loten and Lily, to find out.","coverUrl":"h