elp? Find out in this sweet little tale.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721692/size7/040ac5b172e914d0f3f2872a1332c805.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721692/size7/040ac5b172e914d0f3f2872a1332c805.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-405","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-405","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":640,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38066","title":"Putu and Gutu","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Putu is a small fish. Gutu is a big fish with big teeth! Oh no! Gutu is coming for Putu? How will Putu escape?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93512/size7/74d816aa0bbb2aa73df9cfa2f6b5be37.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93512/size7/74d816aa0bbb2aa73df9cfa2f6b5be37.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38066","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38066","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":641,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-839","title":"Flying High","authors":["Rohini Nilekani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Go along with Chandu as he dreams of flying. What do you dream of?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722226/size7/ad14cad678c8a03f6879020afcbf60b5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722226/size7/ad14cad678c8a03f6879020afcbf60b5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-839","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW