ures on the earth below?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99499/size7/d27303d88a37902d5f07d5ba8f213801.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99499/size7/d27303d88a37902d5f07d5ba8f213801.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-39996","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-39996","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":666,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-29549","title":"Fly in Space","authors":["Aashima  Freidog"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Two fruit flies are born on Earth and raised in space.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724110/size7/b2d320b4b71aac07a42a43edacc77861.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724110/size7/b2d320b4b71aac07a42a43edacc77861.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-29549","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-29549","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":667,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-300220","title":"A Friend for Poochi","authors":["Meera Ganapathi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Making friends isn’t easy, especially if you’re a hairy, scary Poochi. But one day Poochi ventures out of his hiding place to make a friend. Join him, won’t you?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621788/size7/2783d2c2ca6b720a3821276ee8967b44.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621788/size7/2783d2c2ca6b720a3821276ee8967b44.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-300220","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"http