r the six naughty children!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721202/size7/6e38f782e652b5931b13f22d1f71379c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721202/size7/6e38f782e652b5931b13f22d1f71379c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-136566","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-136566","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":855,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22327","title":"My Teacher","authors":["Hlengiwe  Zondi","Zimbili  Dlamini"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"How much do you love your teacher?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/92778/size7/c46013ed18e3a87b20c3f493722c20f2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/92778/size7/c46013ed18e3a87b20c3f493722c20f2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22327","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22327","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":856,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-142339","title":"Where Did My Call Go?","authors":["Samidha Gunjal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When we make phone calls, our voice is able to travel to places that are far away. Have you ever wondered how cell phones can make a voice travel over long distances?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/216365/size7/d4a5d158d2688512fdccc901a63c125c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/216365/size7/d4a5d158d2688512fdccc901a63c125c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-142339","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href