 can be the biggest\nadventure of all!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85544/size7/1bec959a236b14835f6f2e18865eb1e8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85544/size7/1bec959a236b14835f6f2e18865eb1e8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-27876","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-27876","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":885,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22506","title":"The Smart Frog","authors":["Gouri Srinidhi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A lonely frog sneaks into the bedroom of a lazy boy. Soon, he finds letters and numbers and learns how to read and do math. What will he do with his new talents?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128558/size7/a5a2583ee67f6efbe154174de36d7583.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128558/size7/a5a2583ee67f6efbe154174de36d7583.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22506","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22506","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":886,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-578053","title":"A Cotton Candy Cloud","authors":["Swarnavo Datta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A pink cloud of cotton candy adds a bit of hope and cheer to the streets of Mumbai.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642430/size7/6221fdfb5794f5ad0980342ee1549e35.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642430/size7/6221fdfb5794f5ad0980342ee1549e35.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-578053","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http: