ny secrets about Himalayan bears.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/338743/size7/c05eddae0c19fbc46d6f76c842257141.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/338743/size7/c05eddae0c19fbc46d6f76c842257141.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10029","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10029","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":978,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-80351","title":"Amma, There is a Bat in My Sambar!","authors":["Menaka Raman"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Suppi is not at all happy to see a bat flying about in his house. In fact, he is quite scared of the bat. How can Suppi and Amma get the bat back to her family?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123158/size7/d0d693e146f6a7addc7937a2c944ed6a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123158/size7/d0d693e146f6a7addc7937a2c944ed6a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-80351","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-80351","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":979,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24314","title":"Hello","authors":["Jennie  Marima"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lolo has many lovely friends. They are Sun and Moon and Star and Bird too. She would love to introduce them to you.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118446/size7/4ca0cda97d26f32a0f530692b0c97981.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118446/size7/4ca0cda97d26f32a0f530692b0c97981.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24314","type":"appl