ATM? Why do people pay tax? \nThis is Book 2 out of 4 in the Rupiya Paisa series.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723603/size7/ac32ac4ee2b4016aa6e508125a0192d4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723603/size7/ac32ac4ee2b4016aa6e508125a0192d4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-91933","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-91933","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":985,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-121814","title":"Anuradha Dances the Bihu","authors":["Rajesh Khar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Bihu's just around the corner, and Anuradha cannot wait. But, there's one small problem — it just won't stop raining. Will Anuradha be able to go out and dance the Bihu with her friends?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727174/size7/53b5f7b949e9df9d350ecbed881271d1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727174/size7/53b5f7b949e9df9d350ecbed881271d1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-121814","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-121814","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":986,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22501","title":"Baby Giraffe and the Sun","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mother Giraffe works long days in an orange grove, sweating under the hot sun. Baby Giraffe wants to do something to make her more comfortable. So he comes up with a plan. He will get rid of the sun!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130418/size7/8631becb602b46256ee7b57589060984.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.