ly ones, neon ones —\nwhere do all the socks go? This charming\nstory in verse will finally solve the mystery\nof the missing socks.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/287603/size7/fba59e27bdadfb9da6ce4325d90e068a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/287603/size7/fba59e27bdadfb9da6ce4325d90e068a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-209887","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-209887","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":992,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42777","title":"Toothless Charu","authors":["Erica Cuellar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"This is the story of a little girl named Charu who is scared of pulling her loose tooth out. Read the story to find out how Charu becomes toothless.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99519/size7/5914d4e2d5bf0ed13811afce9f6736a1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99519/size7/5914d4e2d5bf0ed13811afce9f6736a1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42777","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42777","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":993,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50160","title":"Magical Rainbow River","authors":["Mimi  Werna"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A mother tells her children oh how rainbows came to be in the sky.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127048/size7/a6c6c2b2653bec6e88befd8bf6919b8e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127048/size7/a6c6c2b2653bec6e88befd8bf6919b8e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50160","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50160","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":994,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-478574","title":"My Home Holds Us All","authors":["Siddhi   Vartak"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What are homes made of? Sounds and memories, friends and animals, smells and colours. Join Bela as she welcomes you into her home, which is more than just a house.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/636954/size7/6a7950e041fc4a444ac4b3a10072e6b8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/636954/size7/6a7950e041fc4a444ac4b3a10072e6b8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-478574","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-478574","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":995,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-93369","title":"Happy Maths : Time and Money","authors":["Mala Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"This is a mathematics book with a difference. There are more stories here than problems! So read the stories, absorb the mix of facts and fiction and enjoy teasing your brain.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703454/size7/4635f366876fd787fef4f3c04925cec3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703454/size7/4635f366876fd787fef4f3c04925cec3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-93369","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-93369","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":996,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-130251","title":"Good Morn