5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22217","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22217","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1145,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-92545","title":"The Money Managers","authors":["Mala Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The Rupaiya Paisa Series brings out many useful facts about money that will help children to use money wisely as they grow up in an ever-changing world. \nMeet Team Kuber, Team Dhanadhan and Team Chanakya in this book. They help you save money; they lend you money when you need it and they help you increase your wealth. How do people with very little money start a business?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/518442/size7/26b49def1d3fc5370d1ee1d5c48bf641.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/518442/size7/26b49def1d3fc5370d1ee1d5c48bf641.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-92545","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-92545","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1146,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-69733","title":"Spit, Spit and Spit!","authors":["Swagata Sen Pillai"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"In the bushes, on the roads, while playing, while fighting -- humans love to go thoo thoo thoo. This hilarious rhyme explores the length and breadth of our spitting abilities.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727098/size7/2f57802c19b3b7c8da536d61066591c1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727098/size7/2f57802c19b3b7c8da536d61066591c1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-6973