ob is to find the king cobra. We can see the antenna he carries, but where on earth is the radio that transmits to it? Walk with Ajay as he follows the king of snakes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705616/size7/6c58e3ce173f8062b499f3fa44a02cd5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705616/size7/6c58e3ce173f8062b499f3fa44a02cd5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-609071","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-609071","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1157,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-177414","title":"Drop By Drop Makes the Ocean","authors":["Bhumija  Rishi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A pond in the village gradually get polluted. How does granny help the kids revive the health of the pond?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/334960/size7/711d5be5b25638a79fb7fa56bae4185f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/334960/size7/711d5be5b25638a79fb7fa56bae4185f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-177414","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-177414","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1158,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-541242","title":"We Hope: Children on Climate Change","authors":["Abhiraj","Abhivakti  Mishra","Atharva  Raut","Ayush  Jadhav","Bethany","Dilip  Mashya","Lakshika  Soni","Mahesh  Nayak","Mehran  Shafi","Pooja  Bhadoria","Poorna  Nama","Radha Rangarajan","Ronak  Kumar","Sathvik","Shabnam  Biswas","Yash  Rajendra Dole"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Earth is home. But the wonderful world we love is altered because of the climate crisis. Chil