 Rhino","authors":["Shannon David"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"This is the story of a little rhino who lives in a big grassland. He loves to explore, but one day he strays too far from his mother and gets lost. Read on to find out how he gets out of trouble.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99520/size7/f72be906c0cf11b24dce19f4ac8da635.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99520/size7/f72be906c0cf11b24dce19f4ac8da635.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42792","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42792","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1185,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-237734","title":"Amara and the Magic Tree","authors":["Tasnim  Muradmia"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Amara was walking in a park and came across a tree that needed water. (This story was originally created at a storybook development workshop with 22 educators, in February 2019, in partnership with the British Council and the Development of Basic Education, South Africa).","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/337778/size7/b75d341e32e61211f2257441fcb6d587.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/337778/size7/b75d341e32e61211f2257441fcb6d587.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-237734","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-237734","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1186,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-104687","title":"I Will Help You","authors":["Andrea Abbott"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Mama Heron needs help, Lungile comes to her rescue.","coverUrl":