 Warrior","authors":["Priya Dali"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maya doesn’t feel like she belongs. She doesn’t fit in with the girls or the boys in her class. Follow her on a journey of self discovery. A book about learning to love yourself.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716362/size7/8fcefdc21a57b30da3233cf571ec89f8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716362/size7/8fcefdc21a57b30da3233cf571ec89f8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-141559","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-141559","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1211,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-139008","title":"Hope, Where are you for Bo?","authors":["Armand Doucet","Elisa Guerra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The schools are closed and Bo from Asia is staying with his Aunt because his parents are doctors who are at the hospital fighting the crisis. He is worried for them. What does he do?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/206549/size7/c440ea312362221478fde7cde363673a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/206549/size7/c440ea312362221478fde7cde363673a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-139008","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-139008","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1212,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-268344","title":"Fossils: Tales of Long Ago","authors":["Anupama Chandrasekaran"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Fossils can answer many questions about our past—about beasts that are extinct, early humans, forests that have become deserts. Learn abou