s!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727551/size7/2307101d6f28a5ee418a1c48e250f83d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727551/size7/2307101d6f28a5ee418a1c48e250f83d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-446504","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-446504","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1451,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-608851","title":"The Bull Comes Home","authors":["Eleanor  Sangma"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A child carves a bull from a jackfruit leaf, starting a friendship that blooms like flowers in spring. They share laughter in the warm sun and dreams under the moonlight. As time goes by, the bull slowly fades away and becomes a distant memory. But, as with all things in nature, there’s always a homecoming.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/672582/size7/64a9c5f6e3ade615aeaa0dd9a0128d2e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/672582/size7/64a9c5f6e3ade615aeaa0dd9a0128d2e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-608851","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-608851","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1452,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-49488","title":"Devil's scarf","authors":["Azeb Worku  Sibane"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A couple promises a gift to the devil on the birth of their child. How will they get out it?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93403/size7/fdd9fa2236b0754c488ccfe23e462189.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93403/size7/fdd9fa2236b0754c488ccfe23e462189.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-49488","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-49488","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1453,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-314534","title":"A Balloon Ride","authors":["Deepa Ganesh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"How nice it would be to soar in the sky with a bunch of balloons. Little Yentanna takes off with his balloons. This fantastical poem takes a journey with a child and balloons to the moon.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723777/size7/5baa0e9dd10e0d144d1e4e1f324956e6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723777/size7/5baa0e9dd10e0d144d1e4e1f324956e6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-314534","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-314534","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1454,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-91637","title":"Nature's Webmasters","authors":["Ranjit Lal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nature is full of unexpected wonder. Read this fascinating account about the life of spiders in Ranjit Lal's inimitable style. Packed with information and interesting facts about nature's original webmaster, this book will weave a silken web over you!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722330/size7/119fe6c3bdf3723f7f50aa6e75f275dc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722330/size7/119fe6c3bdf3723f7f50aa6e75f275dc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-91637","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-91637","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1455,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-28776","title":"Elephant and the Spirit","authors":["Ann Logialan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Who is stronger? Elephant or spirit?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127096/size7/18a5f19dcac03a06f2876148660f84eb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127096/size7/18a5f19dcac03a06f2876148660f84eb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-28776","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-28776","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1456,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-49330","title":"Goat, the false king","authors":["Alice  Nakasango"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ever wondered why a goat refuses to move when pulled? Read the story of the Goat King to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/354773/size7/97e4af497967309e7760d7b02bf26252.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/354773/size7/97e4af497967309e7760d7b02bf26252.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-49330","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-49330","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1457,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-459504","title":"Chupuk Chapaak","authors":["Pankaj Saikia"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Konkon’s walk to school has many sounds. Walk alongside Konkon, Oimili and their classmates to listen in.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/580942/size7/64ef262735bae98332df63da6d68389a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://stat