/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22366","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1460,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-612122","title":"The Growing Up Book","authors":["Yamini Vijayan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Dealing with the changes that come with puberty can be confusing and difficult. This engaging and informative book prepares preteens and teens for some of the most complex years of their lives.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/676918/size7/a6cf8415233915d3e377842e3c066cee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/676918/size7/a6cf8415233915d3e377842e3c066cee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-612122","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-612122","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1461,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-633629","title":"Chik-chik Girl","authors":["Komilla Raote"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mona loves to complain. Sometimes about the tasty khichdi her Amma cooks and sometimes about Dada’s long legs. Meet the chik-chik girl and her family.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723583/size7/e929b19c45eb6edf8cbe74160163cb46.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723583/size7/e929b19c45eb6edf8cbe74160163cb46.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-633629","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-633629","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1462,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-446293","title":"No More No!","authors":["Anushka  Ravishankar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Pitku and Mommy are always fighting. Pitku is fed up of his mother because she is always saying no. But is Mommy fed up of Pitku too? How will this fight end?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727501/size7/69fcd691fc638f55c78f60e2a28df3b3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727501/size7/69fcd691fc638f55c78f60e2a28df3b3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-446293","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-446293","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1463,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-45908","title":"Mother Hen","authors":["Brian Kavanagh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mother Hen wants to throw a party for her newly-hatched chicks, but she needs help gathering supplies. Who will help Mother Hen?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99524/size7/1d28f8e62ec7bb75b6a3b90b29ee9153.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99524/size7/1d28f8e62ec7bb75b6a3b90b29ee9153.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-45908","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-45908","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1464,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-153638","title":"The Man on the Seat of Justice","authors":["Dr. Ramneet Kaur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Algu Chowdhry and Jumman Sheikh are different from each other in every way one can imagine. Yet both of them are best friends, helping out each other in every way they can. But their friendship is suddenly threatened by a situation neither thought they would find themselves in. Algu is chosen to deliver justice in a panchayat where Jumman is the wrong-doer. Will Algu forego the truth to save his friend? Or will his duty towards justice destroy their friendship?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/311724/size7/a699cdd38d39be59bb9d74afb0bb4830.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/311724/size7/a699cdd38d39be59bb9d74afb0bb4830.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-153638","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-153638","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1465,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-64116","title":"Neelu and the Phenomenal Printer","authors":["Riddhi Dastidar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Neelu loves animals. When he sees an injured horse on the streets of Kolkata, he wants to help the animal. Neelu is introduced to the world of 3D printing where whatever you think of can be printed. Cups, plates, pencils and, in the future, even hooves for a horse! Can technology help injured animals live a better life?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120863/size7/5863a34c6d94a16e22da796afd94c44e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120863/size7/5863a34c6d94a16e22da796afd94c44e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-64116","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-64116","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1466,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-141962","title":"What Was That?","authors":["Rajesh Khar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The jungle is filled with sounds of swaying trees, birds and animals, and insects. But in the dark, these sounds gets magnified. No wonder, Hiren is a little scared when walking back to his camp. What was that noise he heard? Listen carefully and find out for yourself.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727188/size7/82b021d2a9def2a929d383e474c5cc5f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727188/size7/82b021d2a9def2a929d383e474c5cc5f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-141962","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-141962","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1467,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24046","title":"The Rainbow Fish","authors":["Divaspathy Hegde"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"All of us enjoy watching fish, especially bright and colourful ones, swimming around in tanks that we keep in\nour homes. But do the fish enjoy it as much? Let’s listen in on the conversation Raju and the rainbow fish have in this book, and find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722296/size7/df538b82c3564bb42b0d7213482d820a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722296/size7/df538b82c3564bb42b0d7213482d820a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24046","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24046","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1468,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-632299","title":"My Friends","authors":["Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"I have many friends. I like all of them but one of them is really special. Can you guess who?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721910/size7/08a4e9f9c5199165073e54117f25ceeb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/7219