":"Why don’t we ever hear the koel’s sweet song in our cities anymore? City kid Raju finds out the answers to this and many other questions when he chats with a koel on his grandfather’s farm.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722314/size7/eaafe192563b3d5c62345ba000badfa8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722314/size7/eaafe192563b3d5c62345ba000badfa8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-18078","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-18078","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1505,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-91599","title":"Rocket's Day out","authors":["Arundhati Venkatesh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Launchpad Mihir does not want  Rocket Lila to go off into space.  What if the sky swallows Lila, or the sea?  But Rocket Lila is not worried at all!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696672/size7/cc16221ddd26b31a3d14a5603b79de0f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696672/size7/cc16221ddd26b31a3d14a5603b79de0f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-91599","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-91599","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1506,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-451529","title":"What's Next?","authors":["Rayhaanah  Williams"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Once the school bell rings, the excitement begins. Grandpa picks Fatima up from school. What adventures will they have?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/536174/size7/02524ff90f8195d62248f1c27d190bb9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illust