gs find a solution for his grumbling by introducing him to Eri, a silkworm. Will Grumble Wings find his peace?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/678728/size7/a349bbfb64283e266ab14bf287deecbe.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/678728/size7/a349bbfb64283e266ab14bf287deecbe.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-613695","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-613695","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1558,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-609331","title":"Jaiñtia Garments","authors":["The Forgotten Folklore Project"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Let us explore some Jaiñtia  Garments from Meghalaya, through this book which is part of The Garment Series.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/673160/size7/7d24132bc2b81389c454d128fb4b7e69.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/673160/size7/7d24132bc2b81389c454d128fb4b7e69.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-609331","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-609331","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1559,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-608295","title":"Garo Garments","authors":["The Forgotten Folklore Project"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Let us explore some Garo Garments from Meghalaya through this book which is part of The Garment Series.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/672894/size7/390f4b4dabf6efde7b01fc936576323e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/672894/size7/390f4b4dabf6efde7b01fc936576323e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.o