blisher":"","summary":"Fifi has a brown teddy bear that she loves very much. But where is Teddy?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/641657/size7/b4661e2ea1a35e8a6f44353e79098934.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/641657/size7/b4661e2ea1a35e8a6f44353e79098934.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-544925","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-544925","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1612,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-641668","title":"Piku and His Magical Pishi","authors":["Somak Ghoshal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Is Piku’s Pishi made up of magic? After all, Pishi can turn into different people. Piku discovers the world of theatre and finds himself making a few friends too!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712882/size7/7910af3bbb76b165a9e341132e1e9af2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712882/size7/7910af3bbb76b165a9e341132e1e9af2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-641668","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-641668","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1613,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-613224","title":"Apjon Apjon","authors":["Iwakani Challam"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When fluffy clouds make different shapes in the sky, children gather to sing a merry song. What do you sing when you see shapes in the clouds? \nApjon! Apjon!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/678033/size7/9bf9c0f0b9cbfba3c3a2ffe8c403072f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/678033/size7/9bf9c0f0b9cbf