ir","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Installe-toi confortablement dans ton lit et découvre cette petite histoire sur les histoires qu'une maman lit à son fils pour l'endormir.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/34952/size7/cd9982004d7e6ea392ebe738a42cb276.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/34952/size7/cd9982004d7e6ea392ebe738a42cb276.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24946","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24946","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":57,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26299","title":"Où va le Soleil la nuit ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Où le Soleil se cache-t-il donc la nuit ? Va-t-il tout simplement se coucher après sa dure journée de travail ou plonge-t-il dans l'océan pour offrir de la lumière aux sirènes ? Découvre-le dans cette petite histoire.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722403/size7/bb21401a90260fde1161c0d0b384ab76.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722403/size7/bb21401a90260fde1161c0d0b384ab76.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26299","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26299","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":58,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-95905","title":"Anansi Donne Les Histoires Au Monde","authors":["Anne Duranceau","Translators withoutBorders"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Long ago, the sky kept all stories locked up in a wooden box. People asked clever Anansi to ask the sky god for the stories. The sky god agreed, but on