velle autoroute pour mener ses vaches à la foire au bétail. Mais notre fermier trouve qu'il y a beaucoup trop de bruit!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703953/size7/788a320045339daf95e6616b6a80dd8e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703953/size7/788a320045339daf95e6616b6a80dd8e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-11451","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-11451","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":102,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103432","title":"Comptons les pattes","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"À qui sont des pattes ? Comptons-les !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527520/size7/597c7c2e4a75d9b72656ffce8afbca3a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527520/size7/597c7c2e4a75d9b72656ffce8afbca3a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103432","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103432","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":103,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-41666","title":"Le mystère du réservoir asséché","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lorsque le réservoir du village de Ranj tombe à sec, Ranj décide de partir à la recherche de l'eau. Viens jouer les détectives avec elle!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724112/size7/1c190e70406411ab7431038cc2aaea88.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724112/size7/1c190e70406411ab7431038cc2aaea88.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-41666","type":"ap