cquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-7162","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":118,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25316","title":"Les fabuleuses machines d'Ammachi","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sooraj et sa mamie ADORENT les inventions.  Fais leur connaissance tandis qu'ils utilisent des machines simples pour fabriquer un barfi à la noix de coco.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712718/size7/9afb2c00f7a211ff4c8699e66ca7db0b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712718/size7/9afb2c00f7a211ff4c8699e66ca7db0b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25316","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25316","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":119,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-4293","title":"L'histoire des histoires","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Dans une forêt très, très, très heureuse vit Bear le journaliste. Bear est triste parce qu'il ne parvient pas à trouver d''ALERTE INFO'. Un journaliste sans 'ALERTE INFO' ? Inimaginable ! Heureusement, survient Sardaji le chanteur qui aide Bear à comprendre qui il est vraiment. Découvre dans ce livre la force et la magie des histoires, et les écrivains qui en tissent la trame.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699237/size7/a73ebf9c0be3829daf205c8376e0f49d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699237/size7/a73ebf9c0be3829daf205c8376e0f49d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-4293","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-4293","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":120,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-49800","title":"Tine et l'irrésistible appel de la montagne","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Houuuu! Houuuu! Dans son village d'Echali, Tine a entendu un murmure. Ce sont les montagnes qui l'appellent. En grandissant, Tine rêve de les approcher. Mais sera-t-elle capable d'escalader la plus haute montagne du monde? Cette histoire, basée sur la vie d'une alpiniste indienne, célèbre la puissance des rêves et la confiance en soi.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/83442/size7/2499ede9af5c09c5a97f7cea234d4a65.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/83442/size7/2499ede9af5c09c5a97f7cea234d4a65.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-49800","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-49800","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":121,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24710","title":"Attention! Voilà le tigre!","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lorsqu'un tigre se déplace dans la forêt, tous les animaux et les oiseaux le savent. Découvre leurs cris d'alarme à l'approche du roi des félins.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495589/size7/0ffeaffc8b06617aca654bbe2fa9542b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495589/size7/0ffeaffc8b06617aca654bbe2fa9542b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24710","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24710","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":122,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50000","title":"Le grand livre des monstres","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Attention, les monstres sont partout et font très peur. Ils surgissent pour punir les enfants qui ne sont pas sages. Viens faire leur connaissance. Ils sont de toutes les tailles et de toutes les formes, farceurs et râleurs.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/157772/size7/c22c969c00ed3abf7b7e06e6075fa53c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/157772/size7/c22c969c00ed3abf7b7e06e6075fa53c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50000","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50000","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":123,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-4143","title":"C'est mon poisson ! — Non, c'est le mien !","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Découvre cette petite histoire amusante à propos de trois amis et de trois poissons très intelligents !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721012/size7/1db7298d5b01da68f1fd305946c8895a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721012/size7/1db7298d5b01da68f1fd305946c8895a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-4143","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-4143","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":124,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61962","title":"Le petit poisson prisonnier","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un bébé poisson-ballon est coincé dans une mare, à marée basse. Parviendra-t-il à se libérer et rentrer chez lui?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724195/size7/7c77fc33d367383329d2c2e7c042303b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724195/size7/7c77fc33d367383329d2c2e7c042303b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61962","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61962","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":125,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42162","title":"Se brosser les dents, quel tourment!","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rohan déteste se brosser les dents ou prendre son bain. Mais sa sœur, Riya, lui avoue son secret et cela change tout!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527487/size7/3b22d4a144943a8e5648a8ff9a4364de.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527487/size7/3b22d4a144943a8e5648a8ff9a4364de.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42162","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42162","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":126,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-136726","title":"Un Poisson et un Cadeau","authors":["African Storybook Project Team"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un vendredi pas comme les autres, le père de Yusuf s’habille bien avant l’apparition dans le ciel des premières lueurs du jour. Il endosse sa lourde veste à l’épreuve des intempéries et met son bonnet vert de laine qui lui couvre les oreilles. Il envoie la main à son garçon. Les yeux de Yusuf brillent quand son papa lui annonce : « Aujourd’hui, je vais attraper un poisson et te rapporter un cadeau. »","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/155649/size7/3118077f575876e068b4279d62872201.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustrat