ont les courses","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tara et Ravi vont au marché acheter des fruits et des légumes. Mais à chaque fois, des fruits finissent écrasés dans leur sac de courses! Découvre dans ce petit livre comment trier les fruits et légumes afin de ne pas les abimer.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717010/size7/0bef1395055c740659b27b823aeea0ac.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717010/size7/0bef1395055c740659b27b823aeea0ac.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-100107","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-100107","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":130,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103309","title":"Le lion court et la vache marche","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Comment les animaux se déplacent-ils ? Découvre-le dans ce petit livre.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/149127/size7/dd29038a57092d016e4bd6f3d3dafb8b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/149127/size7/dd29038a57092d016e4bd6f3d3dafb8b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103309","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103309","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":131,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-64500","title":"Ours blanc adore les couleurs","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ours blanc adore les couleurs. Il tombe fou amoureux de toutes les couleurs qu'il rencontre. Viens faire sa connaissance tandis qu'il explore un monde plein de couleurs.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93903/size7/0a9bcf1123b6cf65ac42dfa8c6258c1d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93903/size7/0a9bcf1123b6cf65ac42dfa8c6258c1d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-64500","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-64500","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":132,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24839","title":"Mon frère et moi","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Viens faire la connaissance de deux frères et  découvre ce qu'ils font ensemble tout au long de la journée.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/35077/size7/32c5acbb641dda85c65de0146802be36.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/35077/size7/32c5acbb641dda85c65de0146802be36.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24839","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24839","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":133,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43430","title":"Histoire du téléphone","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lorsque Alexander Graham Bell a inventé le téléphone, en 1870, il n'y en avait que deux dans toute la ville! De nos jours, tout le monde en possède un. Découvre l'évolution des téléphones, du filaire au cellulaire, dans ce livre.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716429/size7/4e13bfbe328c114f3ca7223d66f6674f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716429/size7/4e13bfbe328c114f3ca7223d66f6674f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43430","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://