.org.in/illustration_crops/118249/size7/aae8a267965f0c2a49786702662a82e1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118249/size7/aae8a267965f0c2a49786702662a82e1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-29075","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-29075","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":170,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103413","title":"J'apprends à compter avec les animaux","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Peux-tu compter le nombre d'animaux et dire ce qu'ils font ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527521/size7/cd395acb2d2b113ed19ea84443ce034f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527521/size7/cd395acb2d2b113ed19ea84443ce034f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103413","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103413","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":171,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-290739","title":"Confinés à la maison","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ammini s'ennuie de l'école et son petit frère Unni s'ennuie de sa tante. Ils aimeraient aller jouer dans le parc, mais les sorties sont interdites. Pourront-ils aller se promener, aujourd'hui ? Découvre dans ce petit livre la journée d'Ammini et d'Unni, confinés chez eux avec leur papa et leur maman.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362389/size7/92cfd489ab32329c3852cad118700016.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362389/size7/92cfd489ab32329c3852cad118700016.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-290739","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-290739","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":172,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-27064","title":"Un lion en cavale","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"T'arrive-t-il de penser, lorsqu'il pleut, que le monde réserve plein de possibilités ? Dans cette petite histoire, le lion, lui, en est persuadé. Fais sa connaissance tandis qu'il s'échappe du zoo et amuse-toi autant que les enfants qu'il rencontre. Après tout, l'auteur de cet ouvrage prétend que cette histoire est « presque vraie » !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/42881/size7/91de93728ea0174899f988fca4f160ee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/42881/size7/91de93728ea0174899f988fca4f160ee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-27064","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-27064","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":173,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43619","title":"Rage de dents royale","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Même le roi de la jungle doit se nettoyer les dents. Découvre dans cette petite histoire amusante qui a osé le lui rappeler.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721939/size7/730a74fae41af958bee4353aff545c11.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721939/size7/730a74fae41af958bee4353aff545c11.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43619","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-43619","type":"application/epub+zip","re