a5c1ddb8df5d8896702a75e1d8538.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91650/size7/402a5c1ddb8df5d8896702a75e1d8538.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-52608","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-52608","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":200,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-136679","title":"Mon premier imagier des animaux","authors":["Anne-Claire Olivo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"De nombreux animaux nous entourent. Mais connais-tu leur nom? Allons à leur rencontre dans ce livre imagé.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727069/size7/dfc9cc9e3e6a9f350e411c1300b1f39f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727069/size7/dfc9cc9e3e6a9f350e411c1300b1f39f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-136679","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-136679","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":201,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-147369","title":"Le Quirquincho et le Renard - Un conte populaire de l ’Argentine","authors":["Dr. Priti Bhatia and Tarka Indulkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un quirquincho et un renard sont de bons amis et ils passent tout leur temps à s'amuser ensemble. Mais, par un beau matin ensoleillé, le quirquincho décide de commencer à travailler, tandis que son ami, le renard, a d'autres projets ... Découvrez ce qui leur arrive dans cette terre vibrante de l'Argentine.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721044/size7/8d44f88b1d324cf09b40cdda343db71c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721044/size7/8d44f88b1d324cf09b40cdda343db71c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-147369","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-147369","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":202,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-134775","title":"Tu peux rester avec moi","authors":["Anne-Claire Olivo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tendai est une tortue et sa Grand-Mère est blessée à la carapace, alors Maman et Papa devront aller l'aider. \"Tu peux rester avec moi\", suggéra le meilleur ami de Tendai. Il s'agit de Busi le Lapin. Et ensemble ils s'amusèrent beaucoup.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527479/size7/c27aed7bef82c0d48e6c6bbfd3c447fd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527479/size7/c27aed7bef82c0d48e6c6bbfd3c447fd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-134775","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-134775","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":203,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24654","title":"Miss Bandicota Bengalensis, exploratrice du bord de mer","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Miss Bandicota Bengalensis n'est pas un petit rat bandicot du Bengale comme les autres. Elle veut tout découvrir. Chaque nuit, elle fait ses bagages. Un explorateur doit toujours être prêt à partir à l'aventure, selon celle qui n'emprunte jamais deux fois la même galerie. Viens te promener avec elle au bord de la mer et faire la connaissance d'étranges créatures.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117644/size7/345aa877047222aeb24a3b5c333a5da8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117644/size7/345aa877047222aeb24a3b5c333a5da8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24654","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24654","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":204,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-99564","title":"Lapin veut être le premier de sa classe","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lapin espère se faire beaucoup d'amis dans sa nouvelle école. Pour cela, il pense que s'il est le premier dans toutes les matières, tous les autres élèves l'aimeront. Tu penses que c'est une bonne idée ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130425/size7/2e4d4add0e35a3db53bd82108f04f926.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130425/size7/2e4d4add0e35a3db53bd82108f04f926.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-99564","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-99564","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":205,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-4253","title":"Le petit chien d'Ammu","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ammu n'a pas de petit chien, mais elle raconte à ses amis qu'elle en a un. Son petit chien s'appelle Shankar et il aime les bananes. Elle en parle tellement que ses amis veulent venir chez elle pour le voir. Que va donc bien pouvoir faire Ammu ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696665/size7/5c7d534c8828504a66ff3855ce3b80ab.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696665/size7/5c7d534c8828504a66ff3855ce3b80ab.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-4253","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-4253","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":206,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50425","title":"Le cycle de la vie","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Une maman vautour emmène son fils effectuer son premier vol. Dans les airs, ils aperçoivent un oryx en train de mourir. La maman vautour explique alors à son fils que la fin de la vie d'un être peut aussi constituer le début de la vie pour d'autres.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/95033/size7/5ef27d26a930dab306ca8dee604278ae.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/95033/size7/5ef27d26a930dab306ca8dee604278ae.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50425","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50425","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":207,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-98097","title":"Corail rêve d'océan","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Corail adore explorer la rivière. Un jour, elle sauve un poisson arc-en-ciel coincé dans des plantes aquatiques. Ensemble, ils entament un périple sous-marin.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120475/size7/bc746f104dad3b53057ebbdadd6e1aea.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120475/size7/bc746f104dad3b53057ebbdadd6e1aea.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-98097","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-98097","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":208,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25660","title":"Ding, Dong!","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Comment Bébé peut-il s'endormir avec tous ces bruits autour de lui? Découvre dans ce petit livre ce qui le dérange.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123536/size7/4715c5ce5d3320cc4921d64fde8272ef.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123536/size7/4715c5ce5d3320cc4921d64fde8272ef.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25660","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25660","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":209,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-44104","title":"Aujourd'hui, je suis...","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Megha va être qui, aujourd'hui? Une exploratrice, une spationaute, une artiste?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524542/size7/c273da52c55bd7e5d79cd98401ab3ab2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524542/size7/c273da52c55bd7e5d79cd98401ab3ab2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-44104","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-44104","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":210,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26671","title":"Pourquoi Nita est la tête en bas ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nita est pendue, la tête en bas. Est-ce qu'elle peut se remettre dans le bon sens ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128884/size7/1fa2b2a01dab7f48d722d0a1d0346068.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128884/size7/1fa2b2a01dab7f48d722d0a1d0346068.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26671","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26671","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":211,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61484","title":"Deux souris","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un jour, une vraie souris rencontra une souris d'ordinateur. Soudain, un chat commença à chasser la vraie souris et essaya de l'attraper. Que se passa-t-il ensuite ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99497/size7/c0dcb0a313c6150a9be9967ce352d6d7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99497/size7/c0dcb0a313c6150a9be9967ce352d6d7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61484","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61484","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":212,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-27144","title":"Le chat triangle, rectangle","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Voici un chat qui adore les formes géométriques. Viens faire sa connaissance, ainsi que celle de son amie, la souris, et découvre toutes les formes géométriques qui les entourent.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720849/size7/129b533b0a0d7b69a71cff6ce379b5a3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720849/size7/129b533b0a0d7b69a71cff6ce379b5a3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-27144","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-27144","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":213,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-29750","title":"Ce n'est pas moi !","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maman est sortie cinq minutes. Qu'est-ce qui pourrait se passer de mal ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/58508/size7/6e9fdac63fb687e5264daa81fc0115b9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/58508/size7/6e9fdac63fb687e5264daa81fc0115b9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-29750","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-29750","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":214,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-11728","title":"Le vélo de Kalpana","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Kalpana apprend à faire du vélo, mais c'est loin d'être facile! Elle n'arrête pas de tomber et se fait parfois très mal. Va-t-elle réussir à apprendre? Va-t-elle abandonner? Découvre cette histoire émouvante sur l'importance d'essayer.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713553/size7/3ad6ce1af3d4d426a2cb31704c688037.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713553/size7/3ad6ce1af3d4d426a2cb31704c688037.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-11728","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-11728","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":215,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26864","title":"Quand Maman est allée à l'école","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un jour, la maman de Meera est allée dans son école, mais tout le monde avait disparu. Meera, ses amis, ses professeurs, et même le directeur. Où étaient-ils donc tous passés?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723634/size7/30d13d0b8c4072a4032ab2309f586a32.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723634/size7/30d13d0b8c4072a4032ab2309f586a32.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26864","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26864","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":216,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-152162","title":"Un OEuf Pour Le Prix De La Fiancée","authors":["Marianne Pasty Abdul Wahid","Translators withoutBorders"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A young man is given en egg that is to lead him to his bride. He loses it on his way. Find out what happens next.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/204914/size7/964c000a907727d36a08b373109bdea3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/204914/size7/964c000a907727d36a08b373109bdea3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-152162","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-152162","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":217,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24394","title":"Tu ne me trouveras jamais!","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mia est la meilleure du monde au jeu de cache-cache. Viens jouer à cache-cache avec elle. Essaie de la trouver et de trouver tout ce qu'il y a sur la liste de courses de sa maman.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/116826/size7/426af0a182efe12d8719ad2b2404bdee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/116826/size7/426af0a182efe12d8719ad2b2404bdee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24394","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24394","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":218,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61729","title":"Je suis comme je suis !","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Matko est trop gros pour pouvoir passer par le portail. Ses amis les moutons lui donnent des conseils pour le faire maigrir. Mais rien n'y fait. Matko finit par trouver une solution sur mesure.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91966/size7/0dd597833ba92602ccca0646f0cad212.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91966/size7/0dd597833ba92602ccca0646f0cad212.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61729","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61729","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":219,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26545","title":"Manikantan pète les plombs","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"L'amulette de Manikantan peut dire quand il est heureux, triste, malade ou en bonne santé. Elle peut lui dire quand manger ou dormir, elle peut l'aider à faire ses devoirs et informer sa mère s'il ne se sent pas bien. Magie ou technologie? Découvre ce qu'il se passe lorsque Manikantan et sa mère quittent leur village pour s'installer dans une ville intelligente.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712349/size7/80baf01ee305956f7dc6a39548938ed4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712349/size7/80baf01ee305956f7dc6a39548938ed4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26545","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26545","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":220,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-96994","title":"Noisette a peur d'aller à l'école","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Trang habite avec son ami l'écureuil Noisette dans un village situé dans les montagnes. Un jour, elle lui demande de venir avec elle à l'école. Mais Noisette n'a aucune envie d'aller à l'école, d'autant qu'elle est très loin du village. Noisette trouvera-t-il le courage d'accompagner sa meilleure amie ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119964/size7/3103ddb647070d37eccd9a8555696161.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119964/size7/3103ddb647070d37eccd9a8555696161.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-96994","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-96994","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":221,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10198","title":"Chat propre","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tu prends un bain mais pas les chats. Pourtant, ne dit-on pas qu’ils sont propres ? \nCe livre fait partie de la collection « Les animaux qui nous entourent », qui comporte quatre livres.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704876/size7/64305c3dcc61674c119e049ed04c6f3f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704876/size7/64305c3dcc61674c119e049ed04c6f3f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10198","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10198","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":222,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-110450","title":"Les nombres de Fibonacci","authors":["goofy"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"En observant les suites de nombres, découvrons comment les motifs géométriques pour les représenter  peuvent se retrouver dans la nature.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712400/size7/10f094938687f1ee29a48d028eca1101.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712400/size7/10f094938687f1ee29a48d028eca1101.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-110450","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-110450","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":223,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-151263","title":"Le sourire de Sizwe","authors":["African Storybook Project Team"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Il pleuvait depuis des jours, et tout le monde était de mauvaise humeur. Tout le monde sauf Sizwe, qui se réveillait tout les matins avec un grand sourire.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/203865/size7/772910c0f15f19f20d847209e0ab59d1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/203865/size7/772910c0f15f19f20d847209e0ab59d1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-151263","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-151263","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":224,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-100550","title":"Ma grande famille","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Parfois, avoir une grande famille peut être pénible et fatiguant. Serait-ce plus facile d'être tout seul ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119931/size7/b84b1797749955d6f8103d2d980266c4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119931/size7/b84b1797749955d6f8103d2d980266c4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-100550","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-100550","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":225,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-101092","title":"À quoi servent les signes de ponctuation ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La virgule, le point, le point d'exclamation et le point d'interrogation habitent dans les livres. Mais à quoi servent-ils ? Trouveront-ils tous une place dans les phrases ? Découvre-le dans cette petite histoire.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130420/size7/eb84d45780d5eb2a1f528864b6bf1070.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130420/size7/eb84d45780d5eb2a1f528864b6bf1070.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-101092","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-101092","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":226,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-71157","title":"Les gorilles vont à la plage","authors":["Jordan Hairabedian"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Saute, danse, joue! Les gorilles sont à la plage aujourd'hui. Que font-ils? Ce livre présente des verbes simples avec une touche de couleurs.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727081/size7/71dba9e0d57f48debbb73e859b0c45fe.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727081/size7/71dba9e0d57f48debbb73e859b0c45fe.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-71157","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"ht