Id":"urn:uuid:SW-16686","title":"Suma","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Suma est seule et s’ennuie. Lis cette histoire pour savoir ce qu'elle fait pour s'amuser !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/34972/size7/7660d346761cc28650c41a864263b5f3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/34972/size7/7660d346761cc28650c41a864263b5f3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16686","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-16686","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":249,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-289875","title":"Planète en surchauffe","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"L'homme est apparu sur Terre il y e environ deux millions d'années. Mais au cours des 250 dernières années, il a engendré un monstre, le changement climatique. Ce monstre augmente la température de la planète et menace les vies de tous les êtres qui y vivent. Comment en sommes-nous arrivés là ? Et que pouvons-nous faire pour y remédier ? Découvre dans cet ouvrage pourquoi la crise climatique doit nous faire ruer dans les brancards.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621795/size7/bf212bf61e522b6f4d6d83b07ad4934f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621795/size7/bf212bf61e522b6f4d6d83b07ad4934f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-289875","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-289875","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":250,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-151668","title":"La Natte Spéciale D’Akai","authors":["Meike Wernicke"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Akai has a special mat given to her by her aunt. One day she gets lost. What happens next?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/202075/size7/45590c641bbb09a51ba8d180bc27904d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/202075/size7/45590c641bbb09a51ba8d180bc27904d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-151668","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-151668","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":251,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-44053","title":"La carte postale de Ritu","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La petite Ritu a très hâte de voir son cousin. Elle lui envoie donc une carte postale très spéciale.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696671/size7/5a67c4862d76b9ca92826bddea4fa06d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696671/size7/5a67c4862d76b9ca92826bddea4fa06d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-44053","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-44053","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":252,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-48588","title":"Coupe","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Une paire de ciseaux met la journée d'Avi et de Toto sens dessus dessous. Le frère et la sœur vont-ils avoir des ennuis ? Une histoire sans texte pleine de malice et de grabuge.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495566/size7/1b7001d2c4ddf2c017bfb4589f885f91.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495566/size7/1b7001d2c4ddf2c017bfb4589f885f91.jpg","acquisitions"