":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un groupe de cerfs-volants colorés vole haut dans le ciel !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/282952/size7/eb0f647eb11fc2423960eb9295c21a0b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/282952/size7/eb0f647eb11fc2423960eb9295c21a0b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-225776","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-225776","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":337,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-64837","title":"Monsieur Lapin cherche le Roi de la forêt","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Monsieur Lapin se met en quête du Roi de la forêt pour lui dire que son royaume est attaqué. Parviendra-t-il a le trouver ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101685/size7/ca57df044a0738be3db3b2b26c8ad3a5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101685/size7/ca57df044a0738be3db3b2b26c8ad3a5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-64837","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-64837","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":338,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42171","title":"Les Gardiennes de graines","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sans graines, nous n'aurions ni nourriture ni vêtements. Voici l'histoire, inspirée de la réalité, d'un village dont les agriculteurs se sont unis pour créer une banque de graines.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/89005/size7/c376949d6d1c81338903a0c7d238c634.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/89005/size7/c376949d6d1c81338903a0c7d238c634.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42171","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42171","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":339,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-75457","title":"Une coquille parfaite","authors":["Jordan Hairabedian"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mili, un bernard-l'hermite, a perdu sa coquille. Elle la cherche sur la plage, mais elle ne rencontre que des déchets, des gens et des escargots en colère. Mili trouvera-t-elle une coquille avant qu'il ne fasse trop chaud ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/537878/size7/fcee6e9d81481cb027d4fd946e8012f8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/537878/size7/fcee6e9d81481cb027d4fd946e8012f8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-75457","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-75457","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":340,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-75478","title":"Fati et l'arbre à miel","authors":["Mathilde  Pitaval"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Chaque jour est une nouvelle aventure pour Fati, une petite fille qui essayes toujours de faire les choses comme il faut. Dans cette histoire, Fati découvre que grimper aux arbres peut lui attirer des ennuis. Fati et l'arbre à miel est basé sur les vraies aventures d'une fille qui grandit dans le nord du Ghana.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/90633/size7/725605a3cf6c390d5f035cd03c89fe2f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/90633/size7/725605a3cf6c390d5f035cd03c89fe2f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-75478","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-75478","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":341,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16624","title":"Les maisons","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Les gens vivent dans différents types de maisons tout autour de toi. Regardons !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85017/size7/e88e8e085cdf3ddc8f661f59b167b71e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85017/size7/e88e8e085cdf3ddc8f661f59b167b71e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16624","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-16624","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":342,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-129349","title":"Au feu!","authors":["Suzanne Lehn"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Goa manque à Ana. Mais elle trouve fascinante sa nouvelle habitation. Tout paraît si différent dans la bruyante Mumbai. Dans certains grands immeubles, elle voit des haut-parleurs et des douches. Étonnant! Ils ne fonctionnent même pas. Jusqu'au jour où...","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717034/size7/201d96d6b2f02a74a45fa386e61d59a3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717034/size7/201d96d6b2f02a74a45fa386e61d59a3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-129349","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-129349","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":343,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62098","title":"Le mystère des bulles","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Toot-Toot a peur de l'eau, jusqu'au jour où elle y découvre des bulles rigolotes. Pop ! Pop ! Pop ! D'où peuvent bien provenir les bulles de la mare où elle se baigne ? Toot-Toot parviendra-t-elle à résoudre ce mystère ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/427053/size7/9cafc47475f7d6eed6edb7877a504d6e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/427053/size7/9cafc47475f7d6eed6edb7877a504d6e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-62098","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-62098","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":344,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25268","title":"Toc, toc, toc!","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Le roi gourmand de Sonapur ne peut pas fermer l'œil à cause d'un bruit mystérieux. Que cela peut-il bien être?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706157/size7/93c759f49808e92b7f9cefb99d3989f4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706157/size7/93c759f49808e92b7f9cefb99d3989f4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25268","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25268","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":345,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-7165","title":"Veeru va au cirque","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Veeru revient du cirque Jumbo-Mumbo avec quelques grandes idées. Continue ta lecture pour en savoir davantage.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721025/size7/4d5245425fec73a2fc96ab944c5d1b0c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721025/size7/4d5245425fec73a2fc96ab944c5d1b0c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-7165","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-7165","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":346,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-128585","title":"Le jour où les légumes allèrent à l'école","authors":["Anne-Claire Olivo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Raju n'en croit pas ses yeux. Sur le chemin de l'école, il rencontra des légumes de formes diverses et variées, un cartable sur le dos. Personne ne semblait surpris de les voir, pas même sa maîtresse ! Que se passera-t-il?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722318/size7/17abcfb72df4343564c63356594732e8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722318/size7/17abcfb72df4343564c63356594732e8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-128585","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-128585","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":347,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62721","title":"La grande maison de Malar","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Malar adore fabriquer plein de choses. Que va-t-elle fabriquer aujourd'hui ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715434/size7/5613393324b2c4300bc530bb88cb1e16.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715434/size7/5613393324b2c4300bc530bb88cb1e16.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-62721","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-62721","type":"appli