cquisition"}]},{"id":430,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26607","title":"La poudre magique","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"or","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Il était une fois, dans un petit village situé au bord de l'Irrawaddy, une jeune femme appelée Thuza. Elle était mariée au jeune et beau Theingi. Ils formaient un couple heureux. Mais une chose ennuyait Thuza, son mari se prenait pour un alchimiste et passait son temps à rêver à la façon de changer la poussière en or. A-t-il réussi ? Découvre-le dans ce conte populaire du Myanmar.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697435/size7/1a89e33ee73ca7454a57ef29be7d2dab.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697435/size7/1a89e33ee73ca7454a57ef29be7d2dab.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26607","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26607","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":431,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103988","title":"Tamara va à l'école pour la première fois","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tamara ne rêve que d'une seule chose, aller à l'école comme son frère et sa sœur aînés. Parviendra-t-elle à réaliser ce rêve ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127083/size7/7ff6e579d99d04c71a0f3407e357f2a6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127083/size7/7ff6e579d99d04c71a0f3407e357f2a6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103988","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103988","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":432,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-17026","title":"Trop petite ! Trop grande !","authors":["goofy"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Anita est bien embarrassée : trop grande et trop petite à la fois, elle ne sait plus quoi faire dans sa famille…","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/42852/size7/0a1060a113ec19cf656ea8d7ef5b0ad9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/42852/size7/0a1060a113ec19cf656ea8d7ef5b0ad9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-17026","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-17026","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":433,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-485008","title":"Ma maison nous accueille tous","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"De quoi sont faites les maisons ? De sons et de souvenirs, d'amis et d'animaux, d'odeurs et de couleurs. Rejoins Bela qui t'accueille dans sa maison, qui est plus qu'une simple maison.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/636954/size7/6a7950e041fc4a444ac4b3a10072e6b8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/636954/size7/6a7950e041fc4a444ac4b3a10072e6b8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-485008","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-485008","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":434,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25879","title":"Les sept couleurs de l'arc-en-ciel","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Regarde autour de toi. Peux-tu repérer les sept couleurs de l'arc-en-ciel ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40606/size7/43c5c9bb857fff55ea3a117230fc9067.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40606/size7/43c5c9bb857fff55ea3a117230fc9067.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25879","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25879","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":435,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42960","title":"Partage équitable","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Comment partages-tu quelque chose de façon équitable avec un ami? Comment divises-tu une chose en deux parts égales? Rani et Jiya vont à la fête du village. Viens te joindre à elles et découvre comment elles utilisent la méthode du « un sur deux » pour se partager un délicieux repas.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723972/size7/68be81afff6476c2e972c6dea33ed083.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723972/size7/68be81afff6476c2e972c6dea33ed083.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42960","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42960","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":436,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26300","title":"Maaloo, Kaaloo... et c'est tout ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maaloo et Kaloo sont de retour. Cette fois, nos deux amis exercent leurs talents de détectives chez la grand-mère de Maaloo.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722825/size7/a8f6d625f16864f8d814762e38c0e384.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722825/size7/a8f6d625f16864f8d814762e38c0e384.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26300","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26300","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":437,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43498","title":"Une main tendue","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Il y a une nouvelle à l'école et le prof m'a demandée d'être son amie et de la présenter à tout le monde. Mais je ne suis pas sûre d'en avoir bien envie. Elle... n'est pas comme nous. Découvre cette histoire passionnante sur fond d'amitié et d'intégration, racontée sous forme de lettres.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/710834/size7/51608bab8fd9f6d6579d86ce735c1dcb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/710834/size7/51608bab8fd9f6d6579d86ce735c1dcb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43498","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-43498","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":438,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-299131","title":"Combien de glaces ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Les enfants, les étés étouffants et les ruelles étroites d'une ville indienne… Tout cela donne envie de déguster une glace ! Combien de glaces Bhanwari doit-elle acheter pour sa famille ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715260/size7/21022b43ed0c07247343a2f2b5de77f9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715260/size7/21022b43ed0c07247343a2f2b5de77f9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-299131","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-299131","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":439,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-484449","title":"Un bouquet de fleurs","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Qu'arrive-t-il à la mère de Peri ? Sa mère dort toujours, sa chambre est toujours sombre comme une épaisse forêt de grands arbres. Dans ce livre sans paroles pour les premiers lecteurs, Peri réfléchit à des moyens de ramener le plein air et le soleil dans leur maison et dans les yeux de sa mère.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527510/size7/34996dcb4ae6d0731bb0d88630443cec.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527510/size7/34996dcb4ae6d0731bb0d88630443cec.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-484449","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-484449","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":440,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-319337","title":"Le jouet perdu","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un enfant a perdu son jouet préféré. Il est très triste. Est-ce que de gentils inconnus vont l'aider ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/329577/size7/ea3675056ea84a16dd62180e9a4540fa.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/329577/size7/ea3675056ea84a16dd62180e9a4540fa.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-319337","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-319337","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":441,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-225779","title":"Le pique-nique","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Cinq amis sont allés dans une forêt. Que vont-ils y faire ? Lis la suite pour le savoir !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283708/size7/961bb11444e1ed0e553910f436a4620e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283708/size7/961bb11444e1ed0e553910f436a4620e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-225779","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-225779","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":442,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-98084","title":"Rhino joue à cache-cache","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rhino, qui est très timide, est invitée à jouer à cache-cache avec Oscar le lézard et les autres animaux. Viens faire leur connaissance et jouer avec eux !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118508/size7/25fa266a6aedb0b35321e759ca976942.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118508/size7/25fa266a6aedb0b35321e759ca976942.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-98084","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-98084","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":443,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-507311","title":"La petite mangouste recherche une grenouille","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La petite mangouste veut manger une grenouille pour changer. Alors, elle se met en quête d'une grenouille. Mais elle n'a aucune idée de son apparence. Sera-t-elle capable d'en chasser une ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727558/size7/7c4a2e3ccca88374a14974c26f3b7138.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727558/size7/7c4a2e3ccca88374a14974c26f3b7138.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-507311","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-507311","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":444,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-75434","title":"Biscotte","authors":["Julia Huang"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un pique-nique dans un jardin magnifique qui se transforme en aventure. Qui aura la biscotte ? Et seront-ils capable de la garder ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85004/size7/8f73f81ff76321f1010533a99691911b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85004/size7/8f73f81ff76321f1010533a99691911b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-75434","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-75434","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":445,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-99518","title":"Les délices de Tigre","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tigre adore faire la cuisine. Chaque jour, il prépare de délicieuses tartes et tourtes, mais aucun animal de la forêt ne souhaite les lui acheter. Un jour, Tigre décide de comprendre pourquoi.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119967/size7/e7b56d43732fd3ca27dff8cce431db58.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119967/size7/e7b56d43732fd3ca27dff8cce431db58.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-99518","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-99518","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":446,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25203","title":"Keya explore le bord de mer","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Fais la connaissance de Keya, la petite crabe soldat, tandis qu'elle explore le bord de mer avec sa maman, et découvre plusieurs autres espèces de crabes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714194/size7/56f741bbf87a304122d2aa03d106d334.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714194/size7/56f741bbf87a304122d2aa03d106d334.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25203","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25203","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":447,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62666","title":"Grincheux, le petit oisillon","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maman Bergeronnette est inquiète car Grincheux, son petit oisillon, ne sait pas montrer qu'il est content. Comment font les autres animaux et les oiseaux pour montrer qu'ils sont contents? Découvre-le dans ce livre.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91201/size7/0ee8dc76299cc7e12a8829ab47850ca3.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91201/size7/0ee8dc76299cc7e12a8829ab47850ca3.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-62666","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-62666","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":448,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-37044","title":"Maths au parc d’attraction","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Leelu est au parc d’attraction avec sa classe de 36 élèves. Mais le professeur doit tout le temps les compter pour voir combien de billets acheter et pour s’assurer que personne n’est perdu. Existe-t-il un moyen plus simple de compter jusqu’à 36 que compter de un en un 1,2,3 ...? Le concept de tables est introduit à travers une histoire sur le comptage en groupe.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716368/size7/ee43a59b4f099703679c055db6a7e43e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716368/size7/ee43a59b4f099703679c055db6a7e43e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-37044","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37044","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":449,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61203","title":"Un nid spécial","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Une dame oiseau essaie de se construire un nid. Mais partout où elle construit un nid, quelqu'un la dérange. Que va-t-elle faire ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/100169/size7/6ba43714a19f5bc87346890ae7c45e3b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/100169/size7/6ba43714a19f5bc87346890ae7c45e3b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61203","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61203","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":450,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62309","title":"Petite cigale veut apprendre à chanter","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Petite cigale adore chanter et rêve d'apprendre de nouvelles chansons. Elle décide donc de rendre visite à des oiseaux et des insectes pour qu'ils lui apprennent à chanter. Parviendra-t-elle à chanter de nouvelles chansons ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93874/size7/6a2a68bdd190f3d01e363776795b72e6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93874/size7/6a2a68bdd190f3d01e363776795b72e6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-62309","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-62309","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":451,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-41613","title":"Mama, le gros paresseux","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lorsque Raghu Mama, ce gros paresseux, prétend qu'il peut partir à l'aventure sans bouger de son fauteuil, Amish et Soni sont sceptiques. Comment cela est-il possible ? Est-ce qu'ils peuvent, eux aussi, partir à l'aventure ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714195/size7/3774467adccf3e2d6841cf43aa22d880.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714195/size7/3774467adccf3e2d6841cf43aa22d880.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-41613","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-41613","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":452,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-71173","title":"Jouons","authors":["Jordan Hairabedian"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"À vos marques, prêts, partez... Apprends un peu de science liée au jeu.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717460/size7/371430b9f5e5718d4be9c13d0336e745.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717460/size7/371430b9f5e5718d4be9c13d0336e745.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-71173","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/S