ur son vélo ! Mais est-ce que le loisir de Papa est de faire du vélo ou… ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642856/size7/fffc5ae3834b649a5c02e07c08104f79.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642856/size7/fffc5ae3834b649a5c02e07c08104f79.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-590952","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-590952","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":517,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-12803","title":"Le Manguier","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Une petite fille aime se cacher dans un grand manguier. Devine qui la trouvera finalement ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/33304/size7/23a920a3cbb156501ad40ddc9e72c040.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/33304/size7/23a920a3cbb156501ad40ddc9e72c040.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-12803","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-12803","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":518,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10109","title":"Que voit Anu ?","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Anu voit beaucoup de belles choses autour d’elle. Les vois-tu aussi ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709418/size7/22151a159d215e955b9c33345d9ea352.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709418/size7/22151a159d215e955b9c33345d9ea352.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10109","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://st