 fille qui rencontre des feuilles qui rient, des écureuils qui glapissent et des avions violets.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725181/size7/1eecde11730d4c7871996ca387dfe6bd.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725181/size7/1eecde11730d4c7871996ca387dfe6bd.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-41732","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-41732","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":534,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61900","title":"Qui vient de passer par là ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"À qui sont ces empreintes ? Qui a laissé ses traces derrière lui ? Découvre dans ce livre les traces que les animaux laissent sur le sol.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714338/size7/79cec9b30eb76917a457653a32a5b3e2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714338/size7/79cec9b30eb76917a457653a32a5b3e2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61900","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61900","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":535,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43623","title":"Et si on jouait à dessiner ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Jeenu et sa grand-mère Ajji dessinent des cercles, des triangles et des carrés. Elles les transforment ensuite en un tas de choses. Cette histoire simple présente le concept des formes aux enfants et les encourage à utiliser leur imagination.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716431/size7/6bc9c1887a5230a7f0d6708d14a9982d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.st