ortante en ce qui concerne la conservation. Un disciple découvre qu’il n’est pas si facile d’obtenir la permission du Bouddha  pour acquérir un nouveau châle!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/34090/size7/c31d9b84745910cec40b60594965f35f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/34090/size7/c31d9b84745910cec40b60594965f35f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-147127","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-147127","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":571,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-641277","title":"Il pleut, il pleut","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Vogue avec le nuage car il apporte de la pluie et de la joie !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721934/size7/f35be74fc3bef97057a90688a52adc0c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721934/size7/f35be74fc3bef97057a90688a52adc0c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-641277","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-641277","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":572,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24322","title":"Les couleurs dans la rue","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Il y a tellement de choses à voir dans une rue. Fais une promenade tout en couleurs avec Sonu, Monu et Rina.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703514/size7/2abd90f3ae29e713fad56ce8eb55e637.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703514/size7/2abd90f3ae29e713fad56ce8eb55e637.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/stor