],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tu crois que les langues sont toutes douces et roses ? Détrompe-toi ! Les animaux possèdent des langues de différentes formes, tailles et couleurs. Ils les utilisent pour faire mille et une choses, sauf parler comme nous les humains.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724139/size7/a690782932e9a84bf87b3e0184a17cfc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724139/size7/a690782932e9a84bf87b3e0184a17cfc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26498","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26498","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":593,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26883","title":"Pourquoi ne luisons-nous pas comme les lucioles ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sais-tu que les lucioles sont aussi appelées vers luisants ? Et sais-tu que les bébés lucioles utilisent la lumière qu'ils produisent pour repousser leurs prédateurs ? Lis ce petit livre et tu découvriras plein d'autres choses sur ces créatures qui illuminent les ténèbres.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712545/size7/7b77bada31449b4371f8220006d7b99f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712545/size7/7b77bada31449b4371f8220006d7b99f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26883","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26883","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":594,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-48606","title":"L'autre côté","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Il n’est pas nécessaire d’aller très loin pour découvrir les merveilleux secrets de la nature. Ils sont tous présents dans le parc de ton quartier. \nUne histoire pour en savoir plus sur les contraires dans la nature.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714299/size7/a1ba8666ed08595b45d6d54a0a225994.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714299/size7/a1ba8666ed08595b45d6d54a0a225994.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-48606","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-48606","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":595,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-128089","title":"Le marché","authors":["Anne-Claire Olivo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"C'est une belle journée ensoleillée et jour de marché. Il y a de l'agitation et beaucoup de choses se passent. Essaye de trouver les choses demandées.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/28989/size7/b85c56bd98b5d5599a73af421c2e6a5b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/28989/size7/b85c56bd98b5d5599a73af421c2e6a5b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-128089","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-128089","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":596,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-285480","title":"L'école, c'est pour les imbéciles","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sambha ne veut pas aller à l'école. Il pense que c'est que pour les imbéciles. Un jour, la maîtresse vient le chercher pour l'emmener en classe. Cela lui plait beaucoup, mais voudra-t-il y retourner le lendemain ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495472/size7/49f2e662fe988adbe41d7411b2b7585f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495472/size7/49f2e662fe988adbe41d7411b2b7585f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-285480","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-285480","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":597,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-345935","title":"Les plantes sont partout","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Les plantes poussent partout : sur les hautes montagnes, sur les terres arides, et même sous la mer. Explore les différents types de plantes dans ce livre...","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/434073/size7/3927b068f2f1009ae79ef445c56eb5be.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/434073/size7/3927b068f2f1009ae79ef445c56eb5be.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-345935","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-345935","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":598,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-148425","title":"Pourquoi les navires flottent et les cuillères coulent dans l’eau?","authors":["Dr. Priti Bhatia and Tarka Indulkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tenzin et Tashi, deux jeunes moines tibétains, et Genla, le conteur bien-aimé du monastère, se demandent pourquoi une petite cuillère en acier coule dans l'eau alors qu'un énorme navire flotte. Leur enseignante des sciences, Madame Sonam, les aide à expérimenter avec une pomme, une cuillère et une cuvette remplit d'eau avec le but d’apprendre davantage  les objets qui flottent.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717230/size7/b192003f504666cffb50823a65999e64.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717230/size7/b192003f504666cffb50823a65999e64.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-148425","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-148425","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":599,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-594019","title":"Le chien saucisse","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Thembsie souhaite vraiment avoir un chien, mais elle ne peut pas en avoir un. Alors Thembsie a une idée pour avoir le sien.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/639105/size7/1cb8ba8360e41054dbc5bd3751e17d58.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/639105/size7/1cb8ba8360e41054dbc5bd3751e17d58.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-594019","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-594019","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":600,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-283038","title":"Les Super-héros du quotidien","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Les super-héros ne portent pas toujours de capes. Ils ne sont pas toujours armés jusqu'aux dents et ne volent pas toujours. Certains portent des masques et des équipements de protection, des stéthoscopes et des thermomètres. D'autres sont penchés au-dessus de leurs microscopes et étudient des rapports de laboratoires. Tous contribuent à sauver le monde. Découvre dans ce livre ce que font tous ces super-héros en pleine pandémie.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-283038","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-283038","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":601,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43147","title":"C'est loin comment ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Si tu pensais que la maison de ton ami, située à l'autre bout de la ville, était très loin, c'est que tu n'as pas lu ce livre ! Viens grimper à l'échelle mathématique magique pour aller jusqu'au sommet de l'Everest, au Cachemire, sur la Lune, sur le Soleil et au fin fond de l'univers. Allez, prêt ? Partez !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/711290/size7/90252bc769af8a1277ff89c784b24f7f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/711290/size7/90252bc769af8a1277ff89c784b24f7f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43147","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-43147","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":602,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-373785","title":"Combien en vois-tu ?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Poissons, escargots, papillons, cochons, vers de terre... Parviendras-tu à les compter tous ? Découvre les additions dans ce petit livre.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527516/size7/2ce50b116586b7652ec79c738028bc67.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527516/size7/2ce50b116586b7652ec79c738028bc67.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-373785","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-373785","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":603,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25876","title":"La meilleure chose de tous les temps","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Muzi adore utiliser ses jouets pour faire des constructions. Mais lorsqu'il doit les laisser chez lui pour rendre visite à Gogo, il découvre quelque chose d'étonnant sur le monde. Et il apprend quelque chose de nouveau sur lui-même.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118153/size7/bc2ba70b6ef08fef7c20b01264e48156.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118153/size7/bc2ba70b6ef08fef7c20b01264e48156.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25876","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25876","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":604,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61193","title":"Le lion et le lapin","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Comment un lapin trompe-t-il un lion pour rester en vie ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99630/size7/e4e0b6c0f880dd0b5a8ee9ac904202f2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99630/size7/e4e0b6c0f880dd0b5a8ee9ac904202f2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61193","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61193","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":605,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-28457","title":"Allons acheter des livres !","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Viens faire la connaissance de ce frère et de cette sœur tandis qu'ils choisissent des livres dans une librairie, et découvre comme c'est agréable de partager ses expériences avec les autres.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705052/size7/6225cce32ab12a3bb090cda5048de0ea.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705052/size7/6225cce32ab12a3bb090cda5048de0ea.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-28457","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-28457","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":606,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62585","title":"Éric, le petit porc-épic qui pique","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Éric aime chanter, danser et s'amuser. Mais il n'aime pas ses piquants car à cause d'eux, personne ne veut jouer avec lui. Sa nouvelle amie, la petite souris, n'a pas peur de ses piquants, elle. Pourra-t-elle lui venir en aide ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93511/size7/94cd17b7de02a28ee46765da68566ea4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93511/size7/94cd17b7de02a28ee46765da68566ea4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-62585","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-62585","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":607,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-49638","title":"Pourquoi y a-t-il un trou dans le rocher ?","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"« Pourquoi y a-t-il un trou dans la paroi ? » demandait Lungisa. Il a reçu de nombreuses réponses intéressantes... mais il continuait à poser la question.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/86170/size7/c66c75ee9e2ac7aa2ec9d0f82394f7cc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/86170/size7/c66c75ee9e2ac7aa2ec9d0f82394f7cc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-49638","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-49638","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":608,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-484280","title":"La plante heureuse","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"J'ai une petite plante. Elle danse dans le vent et sourit au soleil. Elle est heureuse, tout comme moi !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727424/size7/aeb95b466ed3e20ad5b9e8450f064d6b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727424/size7/aeb95b466ed3e20ad5b9e8450f064d6b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-484280","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-484280","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":609,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-652678","title":"Je ne suis pas un chat","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Est-ce Alia ou un est-ce un lion ? Rejoins Bir, Alia et leurs amis dans un jeu d'imitation d'animaux.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/745687/size7/bbb0c512c5c43bdcf87cda57896d6da1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/745687/size7/bbb0c512c5c43bdcf87cda57896d6da1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-652678","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-652678","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":610,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103054","title":"On dirait qu'on jouerait à...","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Thabo refuse d'inviter sa petite sœur Keitu dans son monde imaginaire. Elle a pourtant beaucoup d'imagination !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85000/size7/0f735076e57f760f3244789c9ccbd395.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85000/size7/0f735076e57f760f3244789c9ccbd395.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103054","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103054","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":611,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-65759","title":"Thembi et l'arbre qui chante","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Thembi adore venir s'asseoir toute seule sous le gros arbre pour l'écouter chanter. La mamie de Thembi est inquiète. Elle décide de découvrir pourquoi sa petite-fille est toujours toute seule.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99515/size7/c23d25e822ca13d7d4b1b981d2e7219b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99515/size7/c23d25e822ca13d7d4b1b981d2e7219b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-65759","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-65759","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":612,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-346881","title":"La petite plante","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Regarde attentivement les plantes qui t'entourent, il y a tant à voir, tant de créatures à rencontrer et tant à apprendre !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715981/size7/10130d05074d4687484c87f23e820b1b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715981/size7/10130d05074d4687484c87f23e820b1b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-346881","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-346881","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":613,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-131975","title":"Les trois pleureurs - un conte populaire chinois","authors":["Suzanne Lehn"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un jour, Mme Chang reçoit une lettre de son fils. Elle demande à Wen le guerrier de la lui lire. Au premier coup d'oeil sur la lettre, Wen le guerrier éclate en sanglots. Mme Chang est bientôt en larmes. Puis Peng le colporteur, passant par là, se joint au duo de pleureurs. Qu'est-il arrivé à Mme Chang? Tu trouveras la réponse en lisant ce joli conte traditionnel de Chine.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-131975","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-131975","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":614,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16720","title":"Le palmier","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Sais-tu combien un palmier est important ? Lis cette histoire pour le découvrir !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40977/size7/200d171137e08b21e1fbccdad5edf80d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40977/size7/200d171137e08b21e1fbccdad5edf80d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16720","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-16720","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":615,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26524","title":"Pleins feux sur les fêtes indiennes","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Meenu veut apprendre à jouer du mrudangam, dham, dham dham, et sa maman souhaite apprendre à conduire un scooter. Les vacances de Dussehra promettent d'être drôles !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/702492/size7/7e3531c64e0b2ad008042698b9cb8516.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/702492/size7/7e3531c64e0b2ad008042698b9cb8516.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26524","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26524","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":616,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-102808","title":"Un nouveau venu dans la jungle","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tous les animaux sont enchantés d'accueillir un nouveau visiteur dans la jungle. À ton avis, de qui s'agit-il ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128593/size7/7c708bc319d33b7a8b92c0d816c6032d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/128593/size7/7c708bc319d33b7a8b92c0d816c6032d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-102808","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-102808","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":617,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50433","title":"La mission très Spéciale de Thuli","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Thuli a des cookies. Spéciale rêve de cookies. Quel est leur secret ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85622/size7/fb185ad601ae73e3426b3521b53ec521.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85622/size7/fb185ad601ae73e3426b3521b53ec521.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50433","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50433","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":618,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25256","title":"Câlins dans la ville","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Viens faire la connaissance de Jilly. Aujourd'hui, elle a fait des câlins à la plupart des chats de la ville !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/29567/size7/3b99c56a34d0cfcfc37440bdd0610dd7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/29567/size7/3b99c56a34d0cfcfc37440bdd0610dd7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25256","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25256","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":619,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-280381","title":"Ton corps t'appartient","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ton corps est unique et il t'appartient. Apprends à le connaître et à en prendre soin. Ce livre permet d'aborder la question du corps de façon saine et ouverte, et d'évoquer le droit de dire non à toute personne qui ne respecte pas les limites.",