p://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-304999","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":639,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-65224","title":"Les oiseaux de Bounthy ne chantent plus","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Le père de Bounthy capture des oiseaux et les met dans des cages. Bounthy aime entendre les oiseaux chanter, mais un jour, ceux-ci arrêtent de chanter. Bounthy parviendra-t-il à les faire chanter à nouveau ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93888/size7/1ef129b63ff5f374611f1296857cd642.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93888/size7/1ef129b63ff5f374611f1296857cd642.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-65224","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-65224","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":640,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-262358","title":"Le Déchiffrage du Code : Les femmes qui ont changé la façon de voir les ordinateurs","authors":["Anne-Claire Olivo"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Qu'ont en commun la mathématicienne anglaise du 19ème siècle Ada Lovace, la créatrice de mode innovante Anouk Wipprecht et la ministre actuelle du numérique de Taiwan, Audrey Tang? Elles ont toutes impacté notre façon de voir les ordinateurs et le codage. Ce livre met en lumière certaines femmes inspirantes dans le monde de la technologie, depuis un siècle.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/718336/size7/673001d175ce2760146ea7f626f8e1f0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/718336/size7/673001d175ce2760146ea7f626f8e1f0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-262358","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-262358","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":641,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-293912","title":"L'homme qui voyait de l'art partout","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mehlli Gobhai a vu de l'art dans des eaux boueuses, dans des arbres dépouillés de leurs feuilles, dans les piétinements d'un corbeau, et dans bien d'autres choses encore. Viens faire la connaissance de ce peintre inspirant et découvre comment l'art est partout et peut nous aider à voir le monde autrement.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/433438/size7/57ac0a1b3775ce938ca762eda9019d2a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/433438/size7/57ac0a1b3775ce938ca762eda9019d2a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-293912","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-293912","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":642,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-49788","title":"Tumi va au parc pour la première fois","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"C'est la première fois que Tumi va au parc. Elle est enchantée, il y a tellement de choses à découvrir ! Elle peut même s'y faire un nouvel ami.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/94916/size7/e163888393ac7afbf4c3b5b7a771e305.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/94916/size7/e163888393ac7afbf4c3b5b7a771e305.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-49788","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-49788","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":643,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-148377","title":"Mumtaz brode ses rêves","authors":["Dr. Priti Bhatia and Tarka Indulkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La jeune Mumtaz est venue de son village à Lucknow pour apprendre de nouveaux points de suture pour le chikankari qu'elle fait avec d’autres femmes de son village. Grâce à son ami Munnu, elle apprend un nouveau type de broderie, qu'elle ne l'avait jamais  imaginé! L'histoire sensible de Jolly Rohtagi est illustrée par Ram Soni au moyen de l'art du découpage de papier.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118163/size7/cb7cdd8d49e3e690fae53b5375f67eb7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118163/size7/cb7cdd8d49e3e690fae53b5375f67eb7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-148377","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-148377","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":644,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16894","title":"Deux garçons affamés","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Deux garçons affamés. Et dix petits gâteaux.\nMiam, miam, miam !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40736/size7/e4b1a14a06216e8d56acd568054cb7f2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/40736/size7/e4b1a14a06216e8d56acd568054cb7f2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16894","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-16894","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":645,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26512","title":"Le monde d'en haut et celui d'en bas","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Dans les forêts indiennes, le monde d'en haut et le monde d'en bas se méfient depuis toujours l'un de l'autre. Mais tout change lorsque Gopa, le petit loir, fait tomber son livre sur la tête de Fatima. Découvre cette petite histoire sur la canopée et l'amitié.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723877/size7/512e37faaf23415856672bb730140ee1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723877/size7/512e37faaf23415856672bb730140ee1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26512","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26512","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":646,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-412781","title":"Sharanya parle aux robots","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Le nouvel élève de l'école ne veut pas parler à Sharanya, malgré tous les efforts de celle-ci. Pourquoi ne la comprend-il pas ? Sharanya peut-elle trouver un moyen de communiquer avec lui ? Découvre-le dans cette petite histoire.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720046/size7/61f7713e7da97aaeaba6086bf69eca76.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/720046/size7/61f7713e7da97aaeaba6086bf69eca76.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-412781","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-412781","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":647,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25628","title":"Mes amis","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"J'ai plein d'amis. Je les aime tous, mais l'un d'entre-eux plus que les autres !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721912/size7/066122b27bde426119a6c1d4284800f1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721912/size7/066122b27bde426119a6c1d4284800f1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25628","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25628","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":648,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-641234","title":"Mes amis","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"J'ai beaucoup d'amis. Je les aime tous mais spécialement l'un d'entre eux. Peux-tu deviner qui est-ce ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721910/size7/08a4e9f9c5199165073e54117f25ceeb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721910/size7/08a4e9f9c5199165073e54117f25ceeb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-641234","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-641234","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":649,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-48601","title":"Le cochon intelligent","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Pigounet, le cochon aime jouer ! Un jour, Pigounet est parti. Reviendra-t-il ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85540/size7/19f1e6ea35e32023afc85d0ee0d8beb0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85540/size7/19f1e6ea35e32023afc85d0ee0d8beb0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-48601","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-48601","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":650,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25630","title":"Les pouvoirs magiques de Chiu","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Chiu voit des choses incroyables que les autres ne peuvent pas voir. Des fusées volantes, des poissons qui nagent sur le tableau noir... Sa grand-mère l'emmène chez l'ophtalmologue pour tirer les choses au clair.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722813/size7/196de06440ab4625dccdce4e70396bd7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722813/size7/196de06440ab4625dccdce4e70396bd7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25630","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25630","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":651,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-100243","title":"Ma drôle de chevelure","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Voici une petite histoire sur une drôle de chevelure, comme il en existe tant.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495682/size7/6425b416f54968582a9647db125736de.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495682/size7/6425b416f54968582a9647db125736de.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-100243","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-100243","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":652,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-407834","title":"Je peux sentir...","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un après-midi d'hiver, en Inde, à Shantiniketan, Mini sent quelque chose de délicieux et décide de suivre son nez. Suis Mini et découvre quelle surprise l'attend.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706357/size7/e619d7631277c90319d1b47e0d884bca.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706357/size7/e619d7631277c90319d1b47e0d884bca.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-407834","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-407834","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":653,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43798","title":"Wangari Maathai, semeuse d'espoir","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Dans un village situé sur les contreforts du Mont Kenya, une petite fille travaille dans les champs avec sa maman. La disparition des forêts l'inquiète, mais elle connaît le pouvoir des petites graines.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38302/size7/5d549c1f79ee67ff88457eb15e032565.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38302/size7/5d549c1f79ee67ff88457eb15e032565.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-43798","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-43798","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":654,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-95233","title":"Les petits morceaux d'argile partent à l'aventure","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Les petits morceaux d'argile s'ennuient au milieu des champs. Ils veulent partir explorer le vaste monde. Leur amie, Miss Rafale de vent, leur conseille de se transformer en jolies poteries. Ils pourront ainsi visiter plein d'endroits. Que va-t-il leur arriver ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119943/size7/ab159cd231cfe4d907d3f0b0d19fd13e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/119943/size7/ab159cd231cfe4d907d3f0b0d19fd13e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-95233","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-95233","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":655,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-345834","title":"La femme qui murmurait à l'oreille des plantes","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La jeune Jaishree n'aime rien de plus que les plantes. Elle veut les comprendre, c'est pourquoi elle décide de passer sa vie à les étudier. Cette biographie de l'écologiste Dr Jaishree Subrahmaniam est une histoire de passion et de bon sens.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/491323/size7/1990bf6c5f6788bca49cd0131c95f55a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/491323/size7/1990bf6c5f6788bca49cd0131c95f55a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-345834","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-345834","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":656,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-345961","title":"As-tu déjà grimpé à un arbre ?","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"As-tu déjà grimpé à un arbre ? Riniki rêve de grimper aux arbres dans tout son pays, l'Inde. Rejoins-la alors qu'elle escalade, rampe et grimpe sur le jacquier, le platane , le khejri et d'autres arbres.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495551/size7/2d67536698e82439794800d91ba40bef.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495551/size7/2d67536698e82439794800d91ba40bef.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-345961","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-345961","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":657,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-99515","title":"Les jacinthes d'eau","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Des millions de jacinthes d'eau poussent dans le delta du Mékong, près du village de Nep. Nep pensait tout savoir sur les jacinthes d'eau, mais en observant sa maman les faire sécher et tresser leurs tiges, elle se pose des questions.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120481/size7/e9be7768e55510539ac5a2dfc328778d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120481/size7/e9be7768e55510539ac5a2dfc328778d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-99515","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-99515","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":658,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42142","title":"Veuillez entrer votre mot de passe","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Manju souhaite faire des jeux sur le téléphone de sa cousine, mais celui-ci est verrouillé par un mot de passe. Les mots de passe sont des clés pour conserver les informations en sécurité. Ouvre ce livre pour en savoir plus. Et inutile d'entrer un mot de passe !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725415/size7/535de83b4fa2d0a1a0b5327e87724891.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725415/size7/535de83b4fa2d0a1a0b5327e87724891.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42142","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42142","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":659,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-148993","title":"Manu mélange de l’argile et du soleil","authors":["Dr. Priti Bhatia and Tarka Indulkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Le père et le grand-père de Manu sont potiers, et Manu apprend cet art. Cette histoire vivante raconte des joies simples et des difficultés de la vie d’un potier, et la manière dont il  ramasse de l’argile et fabrique des poteries pour les vendre aux marchés de la ville.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118161/size7/d1e55131fcfd9ea433134f57104b2ee2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118161/size7/d1e55131fcfd9ea433134f57104b2ee2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-148993","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-148993","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":660,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42274","title":"Diya donne des cours de maths à son père","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Le papa de Diya n'est jamais allé à l'école. Elle décide donc de jouer les professeurs avec lui. Papa l'écoute attentivement la plupart du temps, sauf les jours de cours de maths. Diya va-t-elle réussir à les lui enseigner?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524659/size7/c55e8e922116b1ad507a3d2b05223006.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524659/size7/c55e8e922116b1ad507a3d2b05223006.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42274","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42274","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":661,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62061","title":"La roue qui voulait se rendre utile","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La roue déteste rouler sur des routes brûlantes ou pleines de bosses. Elle décide donc de quitter la voiture et de se trouver un autre véhicule. Mais le camion est trop lourd et elle n'est pas adaptée au vélo. Elle rencontre un petit garçon qui se cherche un nouvel ami. Pourra-t-elle lui être utile ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/371263/size7/ee9db84d7d1150b1c86336f3dc04360f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/371263/size7/ee9db84d7d1150b1c86336f3dc04360f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-62061","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-62061","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":662,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-507308","title":"La terrasse de Mamie","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Toutes les vacances, nous allons chez notre mamie. Pourquoi ? Notre maison à Mumbai n'a ni terrasse ni notre mamie.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727427/size7/32d508c5df880c96c70e0c6aa0dcb722.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727427/size7/32d508c5df880c96c70e0c6aa0dcb722.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-507308","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-507308","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":663,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-37532","title":"Ajja l'étourdi","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ajja se prépare pour sa promenade du soir. Il lui manque quelque chose mais ne s'en souvient plus. Heureusement, Sujju est là pour l'aider. Un livre qui explore le concept des contraires.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/63222/size7/80e0c49ab4a062ed86712a78b846f0a0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/63222/size7/80e0c49ab4a062ed86712a78b846f0a0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-37532","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37532","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":664,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-101557","title":"Liberté pour les poissons !","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nous aimons tous admirer les poissons, en particulier ceux qui sont colorés, qui tournent en rond dans nos aquariums. Mais les poissons aiment-ils cela ? Découvre la réponse en suivant la conversation de Raju avec un poisson multicolore.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722296/size7/df538b82c3564bb42b0d7213482d820a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722296/size7/df538b82c3564bb42b0d7213482d820a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-101557","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-101557","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":665,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24842","title":"Toilette de chat","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Contrairement à toi, les chats ne prennent jamais de bain. Et pourtant, nous les trouvons propres. Ce petit livre fait partie de la série « Les Animaux autour de nous ».","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704876/size7/64305c3dcc61674c119e049ed04c6f3f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704876/size7/64305c3dcc61674c119e049ed04c6f3f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24842","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24842","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":666,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-44139","title":"Où est passée la batte de cricket?","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Une batte de cricket a disparu de l'entrepôt de Rehman Chacha. Les soupçons se portent aussitôt sur le jeune Ahmed. Découvre ce qu'il va se passer dans cet amusant conte du Cachemire.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709415/size7/e95e51b7c1b18b6cf495e95f90fd659e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709415/size7/e95e51b7c1b18b6cf495e95f90fd659e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-44139","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-44139","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":667,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16293","title":"J'aime ci, j'aime pas ça","authors":["Marie"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Pensez-vous que ce petit garçon aime aller à l'école? Si vous voulez savoir, il suffit de tourner les pages de ce livre.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704667/size7/8c71055ce1d056e9c4ed3d8ddf07d0f5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704667/size7/8c71055ce1d056e9c4ed3d8ddf07d0f5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16293","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisiti