it","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"La famille de Sitara part visiter le Taj Mahal. Mais les enfants qui sucent leur pouce ne sont pas autorisés dans les trains. Pauvre Sitara ! Va-t-elle rater ce magnifique voyage juste parce qu'elle suce son pouce ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/66201/size7/eba059167763ce56ee9701d9255a8fcb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/66201/size7/eba059167763ce56ee9701d9255a8fcb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42695","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42695","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":726,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-26535","title":"Le défilé des épouvantails","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Les épouvantails sont installés dans les champs pour faire peur aux oiseaux et aux animaux. Mais la petite Gauri n'en est pas tout à fait sûre.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721021/size7/9448fd2878fc1f55703df493c6ddd850.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721021/size7/9448fd2878fc1f55703df493c6ddd850.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-26535","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-26535","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":727,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-41450","title":"Des étoiles pour Ramya","authors":["goofy"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"D'où viennent les boucles d'oreilles de Ramya ? \nOù sont parties les étoiles ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697344/size7/6dac34f354bcb34c50707ac6ec4b973b.jpg"