ou déménage","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Monsieur Pou en a assez d'habiter dans un endroit nauséabond. Hop, hop, hop, il se met en quête d'une nouvelle maison. Viens découvrir dans cette petite histoire ce qui va lui arriver.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117536/size7/cfaeb04d78e3f52d5e1137ce7fabf996.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117536/size7/cfaeb04d78e3f52d5e1137ce7fabf996.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-41606","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-41606","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":778,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-430345","title":"Aventure estivale","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"C'est l'été, viens jouer avec nous ! Les éclaboussures, les bulles et les aventures en camping sont quelques-unes de nos choses préférées.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/504051/size7/88e8e9e72f3c885864ed257ed2fd1ac6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/504051/size7/88e8e9e72f3c885864ed257ed2fd1ac6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-430345","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-430345","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":779,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62604","title":"Je me promène avec Maman","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Aller à la clinique à pied peut être drôle. Il y a tellement de choses merveilleuses à découvrir en chemin !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527494/size7/453ffaa2b9d2495f11514f63