 ? Jo a hâte de le découvrir.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642415/size7/2fafdf32008513e30427985979964220.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642415/size7/2fafdf32008513e30427985979964220.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-593326","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-593326","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":848,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-593325","title":"Un nuage de barbe à papa","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Un nuage rose de barbe à papa ajoute un peu d'espoir et de joie dans les rues de Mumbai.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642430/size7/6221fdfb5794f5ad0980342ee1549e35.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642430/size7/6221fdfb5794f5ad0980342ee1549e35.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-593325","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-593325","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":849,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-336781","title":"La Boîte à Boutons","authors":["Marc GARIN"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Quoi que vous portiez, un bouton le sait. Après tout, c'est comme ça qu'un bouton fonctionne. Une histoire aussi mignonne qu'un bouton.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-336781","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-336781","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":850,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-466251","title":"Vive l'amitié ! Une pièce de théâtre humoristique pour les enfants","authors":["Marc GARIN"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Lorsque Vikram tombe malade, Yamraj pense qu'il est temps de le prendre en charge. Les amis de Vikram, d'une obstination exaspérante, pensent le contraire. La pièce aborde un sujet sérieux et le présente sous un angle léger. Les enfants peuvent facilement et rapidement mettre en scène et réaliser eux-mêmes cette pièce hilarante. Parfait pour les journées scolaires annuelles et les événements de quartier.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699246/size7/af9f6093a29e3d59668e6c35efe10c2a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699246/size7/af9f6093a29e3d59668e6c35efe10c2a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-466251","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-466251","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":851,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-62630","title":"Rima a perdu son oncle !","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rima est enchantée d'aller à la fête traditionnelle en compagnie de son oncle. Mais tandis qu'elle observe toutes les choses merveilleuses qui l'entourent, elle se rend compte que son oncle a disparu. Rima parviendra-t-elle à le retrouver au milieu de cette foule immense ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93518/size7/cbaaad1ee459031171dbabe5deedf12b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93518/size7/cbaaad1ee459031171dbabe5deedf12b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.