s://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/637480/size7/fc118e6546ab870f9240314a704dccf9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/637480/size7/fc118e6546ab870f9240314a704dccf9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-593330","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-593330","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":862,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-412807","title":"Sois prudent, petit poussin !","authors":["Sak Untala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rania veut à tout prix protéger le petit poussin et sa maman. Mais de nombreuses menaces pèsent sur la survie de la grande outarde indienne.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725157/size7/871c16caf664d0153a35c59751334ca9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725157/size7/871c16caf664d0153a35c59751334ca9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-412807","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-412807","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":863,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-473614","title":"La boite","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Papa rentre à la maison avec une boîte. Ennuyant. Jusqu'à ce que les amis de Max et Andi viennent jouer… Que vont-ils faire de la boite ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/536176/size7/1e1d0aad51527ce4d12c75bf91158516.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/536176/size7/1e1d0aad51527ce4d12c75bf91158516.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-473614","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-473614","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":864,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-319383","title":"À qui appartient ce bouton ?","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Métal Tim se lance dans l'aventure pour rendre un bouton perdu. En chemin, il part en exploration, s'échappe miraculeusement et se fait de nouveaux amis.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/190288/size7/6210011290e01b032b1d1bb0cc288133.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/190288/size7/6210011290e01b032b1d1bb0cc288133.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-319383","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-319383","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":865,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-428807","title":"La chatte qui a mangé le Kheer","authors":["Tarka Indulkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ils ont préparé du keer mais personne ne pouvait pas le manger. Lisez cette histoire pour trouver la raison.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/335914/size7/7f983bb598155d418c3cc84ef4837709.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/335914/size7/7f983bb598155d418c3cc84ef4837709.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-428807","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-428807","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":866,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-652671","title":"C'est ici que nous vivons","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Une journée ordinaire se déroule à travers les yeux de Jugnu et Noorie, deux félins de Shantiniketan, une ville indienne : les rayons du soleil matinal filtrent par les fenêtres, les vendeurs de poissons et de fruits font leur tournée et les enfants partent à l'école. Pourtant, alors que les heures passent et qu'une tempête printanière, s'abat soudainement, cette journée peut-elle être autre chose qu'extraordinaire ? Arrête-toi, contemple le quotidien de Jugnu et Noorie, et découvre les moindres détails de cet album sans texte.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/346798/size7/66152c7f4dd3c710a56f60d5e17054c2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/346798/size7/66152c7f4dd3c710a56f60d5e17054c2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-652671","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-652671","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":867,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-652672","title":"Un match de kabaddi","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Suis un match de kabaddi entre l'équipe jaune et l'équipe rose.\nLe kabaddi est un sport collectif originaire d'Inde qui se joue entre deux équipes de sept joueurs sur un terrain divisé en deux. Le but est simple : un joueur, appelé « raider », doit pénétrer dans le camp adverse, toucher un ou plusieurs adversaires, puis revenir dans son propre camp sans être plaqué au sol. Tout cela en retenant son souffle et en récitant « kabaddi, kabaddi » continuellement !\nSi le raider réussit à revenir, les adversaires qu'il a touchés sont éliminés ; sinon, c'est lui qui sort du jeu.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725442/size7/1f941d39cefe0653c28bdecdf71746ac.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725442/size7/1f941d39cefe0653c28bdecdf71746ac.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-652672","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-652672","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":868,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-652673","title":"Je ne veux pas aller dormir !","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Nandi ne veut pas dormir. En aucune façon! Elle veut partir à l'aventure. Rejoins Nandi et laisse libre cours à ton imagination.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130504/size7/6edd3368f087bd27eeb1acdf625c6293.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130504/size7/6edd3368f087bd27eeb1acdf625c6293.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-652673","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-652673","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":869,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-652886","title":"Les trois cheveux de Nozibele","authors":["Cyrille Largillier"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Trois filles ramassant du bois décident de se rafraîchir au bord de la rivière. L'une d'elles oublie son collier. Quelle aventure l'attend lorsqu'elle retournera le chercher ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127037/size7/c89b811274756ef737af6e108928f473.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127037/size7/c89b811274756ef737af6e108928f473.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-652886","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-652886","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisit