ै और याद दिलाती है कि हमारा भविष्य हमारे ही हाथों में है। इस किताब में शामिल कविताओं में ओरांग उटान, हसदेव अरण्य के जंगल, गंगा डॉल्फिन और पोंडिचेरी शार्क की ज़ुबानी सुनिए यह कहानियाँ।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721331/size7/772b3d930ec8af783d7a1a163c6b23de.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721331/size7/772b3d930ec8af783d7a1a163c6b23de.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-314509","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-314509","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":970,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-577873","title":"उगते तारे","authors":["Devika Bajpai"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"क्या तारे भी ऊगते हैं? जो भी यही पता करना चाहता है।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642415/size7/2fafdf32008513e30427985979964220.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/642415/size7/2fafdf32008513e30427985979964220.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-577873","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-577873","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":971,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-594472","title":"मैं हूँ सबसे प्यारा","authors":["Priyanka Gautam"],"language":"me","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"स्वयं को, और विस्तार से अपने आसपास के लोगों को समझने के लिए एक सरल किताब।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/517246/size7/98cd6cf3f692f693b68cfb9e24838a4b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/517246/size7/98cd6cf3f692f693b68cfb9e24838a4b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-594472","type":"appli