","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":554,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38103","title":"Fati Ari Tuuŋ Tia","authors":["Bushira  Gariba"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Fati hԑmii wʋ-ŋaala a ka mʋmʋ ʋ waalɩŋ nԑ ba bene kaa ŋmɩnsɩ tenɩŋ deeŋ. La turu daha Gana lԑ.\nOsu kԑrɩnteŋ kpalɩŋ nԑ laa teniŋ deeŋ kakʋ lɩɩ dɩ ba kԑŋ ʋ wɩa sii wɩa nyʋŋ Gana lԑ dɩ kԑrɩmɩŋ mʋ sɩpaaŋ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/90633/size7/725605a3cf6c390d5f035cd03c89fe2f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/90633/size7/725605a3cf6c390d5f035cd03c89fe2f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38103","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38103","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":555,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-58638","title":"در ورای دروغ","authors":["DD Library"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"بیژن و مرسل به خاطر عصبانیت پدر، زیر سایه‌ی ترس زنده‌گی می‌کنند. آیا زنده‌گی آنان تغییر خواهد کرد؟ داستانی را که می‌خوانید در باره خشونت خانواده‌گی، اندوه و امید است","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713827/size7/f0bc807027e81b582713864f4cb60cf1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713827/size7/f0bc807027e81b582713864f4cb60cf1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-58638","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-58638","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":556,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-181184","title":"खोदलक पहाड़, निकलल चूहा: चीनक एकटा लोककथा","authors":["Devendra Jha"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"एक दिन श्रीमती चांगकेँ बेटाक चिट्ठी भेटैत छैक। ओ वारियर बेनसँ ओहि पत्रकेँ पढ़ि देबा लेल कहैत अछि। चिट्ठीकेँ सरसरी नजरिएँ देखिते वारियर बेन भोकारि पाड़ि कऽ कानऽ लगैत छथि।  श्रीमती चांग सेहो कानऽ लगैत अछि।  ओही काल पेडलर पेंग, जे ओही बाटे कतहु जाइत रहथि, ओहो हिनका सभकेँ कनैत देखि कानऽ लगलाह। श्रीमती चांगक बेटाकेँ की भेलैक?  से पढ़ू एहि रोचक चिनी लोककथामे।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-181184","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-181184","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":557,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-59386","title":"Kitu Kizuri Kamwe","authors":["Rachel Andisi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Muzi hupenda kujenga na midoli yake. Lakini anapo viwacha nyuma kusafiri kwa kina uGogo, anagundua kitu maalum kuhusu dunia. Na anajifunza kitu kipya kujihusu.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118153/size7/bc2ba70b6ef08fef7c20b01264e48156.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118153/size7/bc2ba70b6ef08fef7c20b01264e48156.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-59386","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-59386","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":558,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-57756","title":"Запчето што се ниша","authors":["Anica Petkoska"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Запчето на Бети што се ниша одбива да излезе! Научете како, со помош на една народна приказна од Хималаите, Бети го губи нејзиното запче.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/55586/size7/40838dac3ea07f5046062e3785fa72f9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/55586/size7/40838dac3ea07f5046062e3785fa72f9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-57756","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-57756","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":559,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-54287","title":"\"मोर मांछटा!  \"नाए , मोर मांछटा!\"","authors":["Yuman Hussain  Team Azad India Foundation"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"तीन डा दोस्तेर आर तीन डा चालाक माछ लार एकटा मजेदार किस्सा !","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721012/size7/1db7298d5b01da68f1fd305946c8895a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721012/size7/1db7298d5b01da68f1fd305946c8895a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-54287","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-54287","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":560,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-116184","title":"छुप्पन छुपाइ !","authors":["Indra Chaudhary"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"सनियाकी जलमदिनमे खेले जइसो खेल खेलनसे हमए बहुत कुछ सिखपा हएँ ।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713555/size7/f35c9e0ae7b19a3cefc15f016bf28ec6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713555/size7/f35c9e0ae7b19a3cefc15f016bf28ec6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-116184","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-116184","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":561,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-540329","title":"Dunia Kallu 4 – Peramal Idola","authors":["Suryo Waskito"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Selamat datang di Khajuria, desa tempat Kallu dan kawan-kawannya tinggal. Di sana mereka bermain, berpetualang, mempertanyakan tradisi-tradisi di desa itu, mengabaikan orang-orang yang merundung mereka, atau sekadar beraktivitas sehari-hari. Ikuti semua petualangan yang membuat mereka semakin cerdik dan saksikan apa yang mereka temui di sana!\n\nKali ini, seorang Ahli Astrologi, Pembaca Garis Tangan, Tantra, Peramal, dan Numerolog ternama di dunia datang ke desa mereka. Apa yang bisa dia ramal selain urusan masa depan? Jangan bertanya ke peramal lain, baca saja buku ini sampai selesai.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705851/size7/27f5aca19d2274317df16f424b61507c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705851/size7/27f5aca19d2274317df16f424b61507c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-540329","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-540329","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":562,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-346141","title":"Pipi, Kelelawar Kecil","authors":["Erawati Heru Wardhani"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Pipi, Kelelawar Kecil\nPipi adalah seekor kelelawar. Ia suka makan nyamuk untuk makan malamnya. Kadang ia berlomba dengan teman-temannya siapa yang makan nyamuk paling banyak. Ini semacam permainan anak-anak bagi mereka. Apa yang membuat mereka bisa begitu mudah menangkap serangga? Kalau menurut Dokter Ella, namanya Ekolokasi. Apa itu ekolokasi? Cari jawabannya dalam cerita kecil ini.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716375/size7/0bb000dc2ee9314a7c7f07e30040eb94.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716375/size7/0bb000dc2ee9314a7c7f07e30040eb94.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-346141","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-346141","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":563,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-232616","title":"सब उस बिल्ली की गलती है!","authors":["Sahariya Hansraj"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"इस कहानी को लडका केवे छ कि ओ उका होमवर्क एक शरारती बिल्ली को कारण पूरा को नि कर पायो।काफी बेकार बहानो मालुम पड़े छे? उके लार लारां काई होयो उको थां पढ़ेगा तो थां पावेगा कि एके को बाद एक कस्या कस्या अजीवोगरीव चीजां  होती चली गई होती चली गई!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696669/size7/8717a72070ac52bd090aeebc8e6b36e6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696669/size7/8717a72070ac52bd090aeebc8e6b36e6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-232616","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-232616","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":564,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-366123","title":"Tarian Burung Flamingo","authors":["Adani Nur Sabrina"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Bagaikan hamparan bunga teratai di atas air, pemandangan flamingo merah muda merupakan salah satu panorama alam yang paling memesona. Mengapa mereka berwarna merah muda? Apakah mereka berdandan? Apakah lehernya yang sangat panjang itu hanya tersusun dari satu tulang? Ini adalah buku kumpulan foto yang akan menjawab semua pertanyaan tentang burung yang sangat anggun ini.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/35241/size7/754e9eccdfecc87ccbcee58026ff636e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/