tps://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/228078/size7/27fb6acf2a41c5fc6b1474b302bfa897.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-91328","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-91328","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":617,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25441","title":"বিলাপকারী তিনজন!","authors":["Helga Fraser"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"মিসেস চ্যাং একদিন তার ছেলের কাছ থেকে একটি চিঠি পায়। সে ওয়ারিয়র ওয়েনকে এটি পড়ে শোনাতে বলে। চিঠিটি এক নজর দেখেই ওয়ারিয়র ওয়েন কান্নায় ভেঙে পড়ে। অচিরেই মিসেস চ্যাং-ও কান্না শুরু করে দেয়। এরপর সেখান দিয়ে যাওয়ার সময় পেডলার পেং দুজনের সঙ্গে কান্নায় যোগ দেয়। মিসেস চ্যাংয়ের ছেলের কী হয়েছে? চীনের এই মজার লোককাহিনী পড়ে তুমি নিজেই সেটা জেনে নাও।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697452/size7/b5e2e167fa9057e1165e90a3e62fce43.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25441","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25441","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":618,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-613220","title":"I Wish/હું ઈચ્છું કે…","authors":["Harshavi Patel"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What do children dream of? What do they wish for? What freedoms are most precious to them? In this book, 16 children from all over the country share what they wish to have the freedom to do. These wishes, ranging from the whimsical to the poignant, from the blunt to the deceptively simple, are full of hope and the promise of a better future. / બાળકો કેવાં સપનાં જુએ છે? તેમની ઈચ્છાઓ શી છે? શાની શાની આઝાદી તેમને માટે સૌથી વધુ મૂલ્યવાન છે? આ પુસ્તકમાં દેશભરમાંથી સોળ બાળકોએ પોતાની ઈચ્છા વ્યક્ત કરી છે કે તેમને સ્વાતંત્રતા હોય તો તેઓ શું શું કરે? તરંગીથી લઈને ઠરેલ, ધારદાર અને એટલી સરળ કે આપણે છેતરાઈ જઈએ - એવી આ ઈચ્છાઓ ઉજ્જવળ ભવિષ્યની આશાઓ અને સંભાવનાઓથી ભરપૂર છે.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727361/size7/28f98b78cd90c88d9beb309f0b736657.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727361/size7/28f98b78cd90c88d9beb309f0b736657.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-613220","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-613220","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":619,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-539887","title":"Cepuk Cepuk","authors":["Ahmad Husni"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Saat berjalan ke sekolah, Konkon membuat banyak bunyi-bunyian. Di samping Konkon, ada Oimili dan teman sekelas mereka yang ikut berjalan dan mendengarkan.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/580942/size7/64ef262735bae98332df63da6d68389a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/580942/size7/64ef262735bae98332df63da6d68389a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-539887","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-539887","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":620,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-428865","title":"लकीरी","authors":["Bhima Madkami"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ओयतुर कवि नद सोबा तद नु नेल्ला तद सपना इले मिंदे कि गुलय दुनिया तव लकीरी मायी अत्ता!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727184/size7/44cec01e185be251620561bf58021d26.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/72718