weaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721708/size7/e06593123cad33ccaac20b9451642c4d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-318717","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-318717","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":692,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-105774","title":"अमीनाचं नेमकं चाललंय काय? / अमिनाक नेक्की तानेद काद?","authors":["Sundarlal Atram"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"एका रविवारच्या आळसावलेल्या दुपारी प्रत्येकालाच एक प्रश्न पडलाय. अमीनाचं नेमकं चाललंय काय? नारळाची करवंटी, रंग, बटणं आणि वर्तमानपत्रं कुठंच दिसत नाहीत. हे सारं गेलं कुठं? / ओक्कोद आयतारामता बोंदवारुळ पाते सेबलूङी ओक्कोद प्रश्न पाटटीन. अमीनाकनेत नेक्की तानेद चालू आन्डाद? नारेलाने टोकरे रेंग गुन्डयाल आनी वर्तमानपत्र एत्तीनाय काडका तोतेव. इदाव सारे एल सेद्देव?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495580/size7/bce292876fe0cffa390e460a5b5e0b88.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495580/size7/bce292876fe0cffa390e460a5b5e0b88.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-105774","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-105774","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":693,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-93387","title":"A House for Mouse / Nnḓu ya Mbevha","authors":["Tshifhiwa  Gangazhe"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mouse is looking for a new house. Friendly animals offer to share their homes with him. But nothing is right until he finds his own little spot, warm and cosy. / Mbevha i khou ṱoḓa nnḓu ntswa. Phukha dzine dza vha na matshilisano dza ḓiṋekedzela u shumisa mahaya adzo nayo. Fhedzi ho vha hu si na fh ethu he ya i lugela u swikela i tshi wana fh ethu hayo huṱuku hu dudelaho