ch fruit?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127094/size7/db95bbe732126e9b7dd459a38227fc1c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127094/size7/db95bbe732126e9b7dd459a38227fc1c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-63819","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-63819","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":826,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-226029","title":"كوتافي راجا ومملكتُهُ الناعِسَة","authors":["Mohammed Ahmed"],"language":"QU","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"يُعاني كوتافي راجا الأرَقَ في الليل، بينما لا يستطيعُ مقاومةَ النُّعاسِ في النهار. يَطلُبُ المساعدةَ من الجميعِ لعلَّهُ يَجِدُ حلًّا لهذهِ المشكلةِ، إلا أن كلَّ محاولاتِه تبوءُ بالفشلِ، إلى أن... \nسافر معنا إلى مملكة كوتافي راجا عبرَ صفحاتِ هذه القصةِ الشائقةِ واكتشف أحداثَها بنفسِك.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118231/size7/9734b4374359de228b2b2badb59750a9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118231/size7/9734b4374359de228b2b2badb59750a9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-226029","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-226029","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":827,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25709","title":"মরুর গণনা","authors":["Helga Fraser"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"মরুর দুনিয়ার সংখ্যাগুলো নাচে, ঢেউ খেলে। সেখানে লম্বা ভাগ অঙ্কের সুন্দর লেজ আছে। কিন্তু একদিন স্কুলে এই দুনিয়া খান খান হয়ে ভেঙে পড়ে। এলাকায় মরু পরিচিত হয় ভবঘুরে ছেলে হিসেবে। তারপর একজন আবার তাকে শেখার আনন্দ আবিষ্কারে সাহায্য করে। হৃদয় উষ্ণ করা এই গল্পটি পড়ে এসব জেনে নাও।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696874/size7/9ff16cdbaba183411b9f0abc8173386f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696874/size7/9ff16cdbaba183411b9f0abc8173386f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25709","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25709","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":828,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-90089","title":"कल्पना री साईकिल","authors":["Govind Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"कल्पना साईकिल हलावणी सीखे री हैं,बीजु ओ घतुई आसोन नी लाग तो !वा बार बार पडती री ने वणे कतरी वेला चोटेय लागी | बिजू का वणे आखिर मेसाईकिल हलावणी अऐ? के वणे हिम्मत हारे ने कोशिश करनी छोडी ? साहित्यअकादमी रे बालक साहित्य पुरुसकार ती सम्मानित लेखिका रे कलम, ती हिम्मत नी हारने ने कोशिश करता रेवा रे बारे मे दिल ने छूवा वाली आ एक कहानी |","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713553/size7/3ad6ce1af3d4d426a2cb31704c688037.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713553/size7/3ad6ce1af3d4d426a2cb31704c688037.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-90089","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-90089","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":829,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-47942","title":"Umtfwana wamake wami","authors":["Sara M Mohale"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Umntfwana wamake indzaba ya Neo, umfanyana logcine sekangubhuti lomkhulu. Emuva kwekuba nguye kuphela umnftwana empilweni yakhe yonkhe, Neo utayitsatsa njani indzaba yasesi wakhe lomusha Ingabe batali bakhe batomphatsa ngalokuhlukile? Neo uyasaba kwekutsi angeke asanakwa. Ucabanga kwekutsi batali bakhe angeke basamnaka kakhulu njengakucala, angakefiki umntfwana lomusha Wesab