aver.org.in/illustration_crops/700475/size7/87fc5b8f1397a63daae7e68a63dae475.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-251940","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-251940","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":905,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-251876","title":"ଗୁରୁ ଓ ପିଚୁର ଛୁଟିଦିନ / ଗୁରୁଅଡ଼େ ପିଚୁ ଚୁଟୀଦିନା","authors":["Jalandhar Tuika"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ଗୁରୁ ଆଉ ପିଚୁକୁ ପାଖରେ ଖେଳିବା ପାଇଁ ଜାଗା ନଦେବାରୁ ସେମାନଙ୍କର ମନଦୁଃଖ ହୋଇଥିଲା। ତାଙ୍କ ସହ ଯାଇ ଚାଲନ୍ତୁ ଦେଖିବା ସେମାନେ ଖୋଜୁଥିବା ଖେଳିବା ଜାଗା। / ଗୁରୁ ଅଡ଼େ ପିଚୁ ଡ଼େକେଏଁ ଖାହିଲି ତାକି ଜାଗା ହିୟାତାକି ଏୱାସିକା ମନଦୁଃଖ ଆୟାସେ ଏୱାସିକା ଡ଼ାଇ ହାଜାନା ଯାଦୁ ହେନା ଏୱାସିକା ଏୱାସିକା ଦାହାପିନି ଖାହିନି ଜାଗା।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722963/size7/a8ebe3620e8f0c4efe7a4021ea268154.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722963/size7/a8ebe3620e8f0c4efe7a4021ea268154.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-251876","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-251876","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":906,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-106095","title":"नंदिनी कुठे आहे? / नंदिनी एत्तीन आंडाद?","authors":["Paikuji Atram"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"शेतामध्ये वेगवेगळ्या आकारांच्या गायी असतात. मालिनीला त्या गायींना रानामध्ये चरायला घेऊन जायचं असतं. ज्यावेळी ती गायींवर लक्ष ठेवून असते, नेमकी त्याच वेळी तिची धाकटी चुलत बहीण नंदिनी हरवते. मग नंदिनीला शोधण्यासाठी मालिनी तिचा माग काढू लागते. तिला ती शोधून काढते का? ही गोष्ट वर्गीकरणाच्या, म्हणजेच वस्तू वेगळ्या करण्याच्या संकल्पनेची मुलांना ओळख करून देते. / वेगाळत वेगरे वेगरे आकारताव कुटेल आनाव. मालिनीङ आदाव कुटेल आळावीङ  मिपेङ कोसाकाद आनाद. एपुळ आद कुटेलपोदे लक्ष इळत आपाद, नेम्माना दापूळी आदने सिन्नाम तोरंदाल नंदिनी देवळीलाद. मारी नंदिनीङ किरावेङ मालिनी किरावा तिरगात. आदुङ आद ओपाळादा ? इद गोट्टी वर्गीकरण मेंजे वस्तूकेव वेगरे वेगरे आनाव इद गोट्टीनेत बालाकुलूंङ ओरकी सिय्याद.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716441/size7/487f7b6f222158fac25528b8cb4aff36.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716441/size7/487f7b6f222158fac25528b8cb4aff36.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-106095","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-106095","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":907,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-109788","title":"روز لباس‌شویی","authors":["DD Library"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"روز لباس‌شویی، روز مورد علاقه ماری است. با همسایه‌های ماری هم آشنا شوید. \n  آن‌ها یک روز را دوختن، شستن، خشک کردن و اتو کردن لباس‌ها می‌پردازند","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/55464/size7/56deae620a87cdf1061749233170a37b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/55464/size7/56deae620a87cdf1061749233170a37b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-109788","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-109788","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":908,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-235991","title":"सुणी काई","authors":["Ramesh  Chand sahariya"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ध्यान से सुनें तो पायेंगे कि पक्षियों के पास बहुत कुछ कहने को है।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527532/size7/d554b58ed4a31df51c45cca2a90e4aa0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527532/size7/d554b58ed4a31df51c45cca2a9