ା। କଣ ମନୁଷ୍ୟ ଏବଂ ଜୀବଯନ୍ତୁ ଏତେ ଗୁଡିଏ ସୂର୍ଯ୍ୟ କୁ ଦେଖି ଖୁସିରେ ଥିଲେ? ତୁମେ ନିଜେ ଗଳ୍ପ ପଢି଼ବାକୁ ଚେଷ୍ଟା କର।/ନେନା ମିଏଡ୍ ଆଦିବାସୀ କଆଃ କାହାନୀ, ନେନ୍‌ରେ ବିର୍‌ରେନ୍ ଜୀ-ଜନ୍ତୁକ, ବିର୍‌ ବୁରୁକଲଅ ଜୁଳିକେନ୍‌ତେ ଚିଲିକେକ ତାଇକେନା, ଏନା ନେନ୍‌ରେ ଚିର୍‌ଗେଲଃତାନା। ଆଇୟେ ସିଙ୍ଗିକ ସିରିମେରେକ ତାଇକେନା। ହୋଽକ ଅଣ୍ଡଃ ଜୀ-ଜନ୍ତୁକ ସିଙ୍ଗିକ ନେଲ୍‌ତେ ରାଁସାଅତାଇକେନାକ ଏନ୍ତେ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699941/size7/f5b8370b8b0ef32a6c37699844bae873.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699941/size7/f5b8370b8b0ef32a6c37699844bae873.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-195275","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-195275","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1432,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-105497","title":"តើពួកគេទៅណា?","authors":["Let's Read"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"តើពួកគេនាំគ្នាទៅណាហ្នឹង? នៅតាមផ្លូវ តើរីងរីងជួបអ្នកណា?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527564/size7/992863eb023def9d801a11003d7e9e00.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527564/size7/992863eb023def9d801a11003d7e9e00.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-105497","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-105497","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1433,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-59457","title":"सनिका रंगोमिठाज","authors":["rajkanya gavate"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"उरा रारांगो बी च्योटो मजा व्हय! पोनी फाटकोगा रांगो टुनी होना व्हय, घाले बला!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697317/size7/fae553c96cec531f760c79641f63a924.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/69731