ن په ساعت کې هغې د ټولګې له کړکۍ څخه بیرون ته کتل، یو ځل یې عقاب ولید چې په هوا کې الوزي. سالار له خپل ځان سره فکر وکړ چې دغه الوتونکی باید ډېر خوشاله وي، ځکه چې الوتلای شي. هغې همداشان خوښول چې د الوتکې الوتنه هم وویني.    سارلا غواړي کله چې ستره شي په راتلونکې کې پیلوټه شي او الوتکې ته الوتنه ورکړي","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/711239/size7/76fe943740d2496ae267805d81599763.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/711239/size7/76fe943740d2496ae267805d81599763.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-59698","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-59698","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1439,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-571680","title":"नीमा आजै हुं खाई रई है?","authors":["Upendra ‘Annu’ KD"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"या है नीमा जैनै खावू घणू गमै। रसभरी लीची, मोटं मोटं जाम्बू, खाटी आमली, रूपारौ लीलो पालकौ- हेत्तू ऐनै गमैं। आवौ नीमा नै हातै मलीनै आपड़ै भी आखू वरस कय नै कय खातं रं...सावतं रं।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712721/size7/2f46f2aea0d54ba83cce96e1c6f9d5d9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712721/size7/2f46f2aea0d54ba83cce96e1c6f9d5d9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-571680","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-571680","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1440,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-142265","title":"Dhaala Abbaa","authors":["Mulualem Daba"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A folktale about the wisdom of a father, the insight of a son, and the value of farming.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/1