W-194346","title":"ନୀମା ଆଜି କଣ ଖାଇବ? / ନୀମା ତିସିଂ ଚିକାନାଃମ୍-ଜମିୟା","authors":["Pandab Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ଚାଲ ସେହି ନୀମାକୁ ଭେଟିବା ଯିଏ ଖାଇବାକୁ ଭଲପାଏ। ରସାଳ ଲିଚୁ, ମୋଟା ମୋଟା ଜାମ୍ମୁକୋଳି, ଖଟା ତେନ୍ତୁଳୀ ଏବଂ ଛନ ଛନିଆଁ ସବୁଜ ଶାଗ ସବୁ ଖାଇବାକୁ ବହୁତ ଭଲ ପାଏ। ଆସ ନୀମା ସହ ମିଶି ଆମେ ମଧ୍ୟ ବର୍ଷସାରା କିଛି ନା କିଛି ଖାଉଥିବା। / ଦଲାବୁ ନୀମାତାଃବୁ ସେନଃଆ। ଜମ୍ ଲାଗିଡ୍ ଏସୁଃ ରାଁସାଅ-ଆଃ। ରାସିୟେନ୍ ଲିଚୁ। ମୁଟା ମୁଟା କୁଦେ, ମରଃଏ ଜଜ ଅଣ୍ଡଃ ଲେଏର୍ ଲେବେର ଗାଦେଡ୍‌ ଆ-ଆଃ। ସାବେନ୍ ଜମ୍‌ଲାଗିଡ୍‌ ରାଁସାଅ-ଆଃ। ଏଲାବୁ ନୀମା ଲଅଃ ଜୁଳିକେନ୍‌ତେ ବର୍‌ଷ ଜାକେଡ୍ ଜା-ନାଃରେୟବୁ ଜମାକା-ନଃଆ।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712721/size7/2f46f2aea0d54ba83cce96e1c6f9d5d9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712721/size7/2f46f2aea0d54ba83cce96e1c6f9d5d9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-194346","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-194346","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1484,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-105776","title":"चिऊची जादूची शक्ती / चिऊनेत केदीने शेक्ती","authors":["Jaywant Tekam"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"इतर कोणाला न दिसणाऱ्या मस्त मस्त गोष्टी चिऊला दिसतात. तिला घरात रॉकेट्स उडताना आणि फळ्यावर मासे पोहताना दिसत असतात. तिच्या या जादूच्या शक्तीबद्दल जाणून घेण्यासाठी आजी मग तिला डोळ्यांच्या डॉक्टरांकडे घेऊन जाते. / वेंडोको एरुङनाय काडाक्तेरसेला मस्त मस्त गोट्टीकुल चिउकूङ कान्डाकताव आदूङ एल्लात राकेटूल नेगायाकाव आनी पळात काय्येल इंदाकाव कान्डाकताव. आदने इद्द केदीने शेक्तीबेदोल माईत काकेंङ मुरतालबेक मारी आदुन कान्डले डाक्टेरनाङ कोस्त साद.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722813/size7/196de06440ab4625dccdce4e70396bd7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722813/size7/196de06440ab4625dccdce4e70396bd7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-105776","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-105776","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1485,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-60393","title":"म्हारी गाड़ी","authors":["Pradeep Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"मु खेदी हूँ मारे घोड़े एक नैनकी गाड़ी है | एक फूटरी ने लोबी गाड़ी है | मु ट्रम- ट्रम करेने मु अटे ने वटे जाऊ वणनो साथी दुनिया री सैर पी करो","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709197/size7/07f56b1cecb466139edbec1330051a29.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/709197/size7/07f56b1cecb466139edbec1330051a29.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60393","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60393","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1486,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-194504","title":"ଆମ୍ବ ପଡିଲା ପ୍ଲପ୍/ଉଲି ଇୟୁଃୟେନେ ପଅଃ","authors":["Asman Sae"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ଆମ୍ବଟିଏ ଗଛରୁ ପଡିଲା ପ୍ଲପ୍। ତା’ପରେ କ’ଣ ହେଲା? ପାରା, ମାଙ୍କଡ, ସିଂହ ଓ ଅନ୍ୟ ପଶୁ ପକ୍ଷୀମାନଙ୍କ ସହ ମିଶି ଏହି ରୋଚକ ଗପରୁ ଜାଣ।/ଉଲି ଦାରୁଇତେ ଇୟୁଃୟେନେ ପଅଃ। ଏନାପରେ ଚିକେନେଃକ ହବାୟାନା? ଦୁଦୁଲୁମ, ଗାଇ, କୁଲେ, ଅଣ୍ଡଃ ଏଟାଃ ପଶୁପକ୍ଷୀକ ସହ ମିଶେନ୍ ତେ ନେନ୍ ବାଣିଏଁ ଗପଏତେ ଏତନ୍‌ପେ।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723612/size7/bb2545112bd96070db240d74fdca5aa6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723612/size7/bb2545112bd96070db240d74fdca5aa6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-194504","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-194504","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1487,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-106101","title":"रस्त्यातले दोस्त?/पावता सोपत्याकेर","authors":["Suresh Atram"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"सोनू, मोनू आणि रीना या तिघांनी मिळून, ‘रस्त्यातले रंग’ या पुस्तकात अनेक गोष्टी शोधल्या होत्या. या मालिकेच्या दुसऱ्या भागात, ते आता खेळायला बाहेर पडले आहेत. एवढे सगळे प्राणी तिथे भेटतील, असं त्यांना वाटलंच नव्हतं. तुम्हालाही त्यांना भेटायचं आहे का? / सोनुक, मोनुक आनी रीनाक इवर मुग्गुरनाय कुळत्ना, 'पावताद रेंग' इद पुस्तकतेंग लेय गोटटिकूल ओपारेत आंडडेर. इद मालिकेताद वेन्डोकोद भागतेंग आवर इंडी आळेंग वाकाल कुरित आंडडार. इंगेळ सेब्बी जनावसील आत्तीन ओपाळदाव इनांग आवरुंग वाटीलती तोत्तीन. इमुंगनाय आदावलुन भेटीलनेती वाटीला दा?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703806/size7/ca4ec79c4a3534baf1250338357fe8ec.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703806/size7/ca4ec79c4a3534baf1250338357fe8ec.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-106101","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-106101","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1488,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-396796","title":"Kelinci di Bawah Pohon","authors":["Nurul Koida"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Suatu hari, seekor kelinci sedang tertidur. Tiba-tiba jatuh sebuah apel dari atas pohon. Lalu terdengar seruan, “Lari, kelinci. Ayo lari” Dan kekacauan pun bermula.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127140/size7/97b32f2757e71ed961e4875defd4af9d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/127140/size7/97b32f2757e71ed961e4875defd4af9d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-396796","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-396796","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1489,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-59168","title":"Njem nnukwu Obere Nnụnụ","authors":["Nkem Osuigwe"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Obere Nnụnụ hụrụ Onye Ukwu ahụ n'anya. Ma, olee ebe Onye Giant nọ? Obere Nnụnụ na-aga njem ịchọta ya","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118247/size7/993a850d571731acbf727c386c72efb2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118247/size7/993a850d571731acbf727c386c72efb2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-59168","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-59168","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1490,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-364200","title":"Sir M. Visvesvaraya: Sang Insinyur Pembangun Bendungan, Jembatan, dan Bangsa","authors":["Adani Nur Sabrina"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Saat masih kecil, Vishwa menempuh perjalanan jauh untuk bisa sampai ke sekolah. Saat menjadi mahasiwa, dia mengajar dua anak kecil untuk menyambung hidup. Dan saat menjadi insinyur, dia membangun berbagai bendungan, jembatan, institusi pendidikan, dan asas demi terwujudnya India modern. Bacalah buku ini untuk mengetahui cara Sir M. Visvesvaraya mengamati dunia di sekitarnya, mempelajari semua yang ada di sekelilingnya, membuat keputusan berani, serta selalu bekerja keras.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725457/size7/13b195dae0c939e0eb0b24e8e93cb63c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725457/size7/13b195dae0c939e0eb0b24e8e93cb63c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-364200","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-364200","type":"applicatio