ip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-95205","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":60,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-172764","title":"Ndi funa u vhala","authors":["Maphaha Nelson"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A story about reading.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/235022/size7/9f0ef652482649f3a62111cac60a16f6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/235022/size7/9f0ef652482649f3a62111cac60a16f6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-172764","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-172764","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":61,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-96907","title":"Mbok, Ngudaiang Langite Mawarna Pelung?","authors":["Hadi Sutresna"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Adi cenik ngelah liu petakon teken Mbokne. Ia nawang Mbokne ngelah pasaut ane liu, ulian ia sesai maca buku utawi ane lenan. Di bukune ene, adi cenik metakon-takon nguda langite mawarna pelung. Dugas Mbok nakonang teken ia nguda ia nakonang keto, lantas paminehne ngalimbak . Mirib ke ento kamen pelung raksasa makebat di langite ane ngaenang pelung, wiadin tuara buka keto? Pastika, pamuputne i Mbok ngelah pasaut ane beneh. Nanging satonden ragane nyumuin mamaca buku ane nglilayang ene anggon ngalih pasautne, tegarang orahang teken tiang: Apa ngranaang ragane makeneh langite mawarna pelung?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722412/size7/c9131925228d1e8ba22cbb83656b4e17.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722412/size7/c9131925228d1e8ba22cbb83656b4e17.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-96907","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-96907","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":62,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-95911","title":"Ainaki Anansi Ng'itung'a Ng'ikoio","authors":["Dennis  Lokitare"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Long ago, the sky kept all stories locked up in a wooden box. People asked clever Anansi to ask the sky god for the stories. The sky god agreed, but only if Anansi performed three seemingly impossible tasks.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/137799/size7/63c23317d8a03be42e4ee2b01f280188.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/137799/size7/63c23317d8a03be42e4ee2b01f280188.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-95911","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-95911","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":63,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-58343","title":"टेलीफ़ोन बेल ती सेल तक","authors":["Mada Ram"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"जन टेमरा बेल पेलु टेलिफोन वनायु वन टेमरा खाली शहर में दो फोन था। आज हर कनने पाडे एक सेल फोन है अन किताब में बेल रा टेलिफोन ती सेल फोन रे विकास री कोनी रो ठा पडी।","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716429/size7/4e13bfbe328c114f3ca7223d66f6674f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716429/size7/4e13bfbe328c114f3ca7223d66f6674f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-58343","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-58343","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":64,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-330910","title":"Amakota kabab' uMkhize","aut