98","title":"Wán wo wù fiirsin é ŋàŋ","authors":["Beatrice Tafon Takeh","Mbinkar Emmanuel Keelen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Jealousy and Stupidity can be fatal combination!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/140292/size7/c83a5747d12e61014df2a0af75c4efa7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/140292/size7/c83a5747d12e61014df2a0af75c4efa7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-95398","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-95398","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":811,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-136814","title":"Hlapi le mpho","authors":["Nal’ibali"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ka Labohlano le lengwe leo le kgethegilego, tatago Yusuf o ile a apara pele seetša se tlala lefaufaung. O ile a tšea jase ya gagwe ya serobaphefo le mongatse wa wulu o motalamorogo wa go khupetša ditsebe tša gagwe. O ile a dumediša morwa wa gagwe ka go emiša seatla e le ge a\nre a šale gabotse. Mahlo a Yusuf a ile a taga ge Papa a re, “Lehono ke letšatši le ke tla swarago hlapi ka lona gomme ka go tlela yona mo gae bjalo ka mpho.”","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/155649/size7/3118077f575876e068b4279d62872201.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/155649/size7/3118077f575876e068b4279d62872201.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-136814","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-136814","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":812,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-189012","title":"কুইলীয় কুহুয়া","authors":["mitali hansda"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"কোহল সিরিঞে খজ আ সিরিঞ।  ললদিন সিরিঞ লৗগিঃ এ কুরুমুটুয়া, বাই দাড়িয়া আ। দাসায় সময় এ কুরুমুটুয়ায়,বাই দাড়িয়া আ।  রাবাং দিন সিরিঞে কুরুমুটুয়া, মেনখান উনি বাই সিরিঞ দাড়িয়া কানা। আম চিঃ এম মনেয়া কোহল তিশ হয় সিরিঞ দাড়িয়া আ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/102794/size7/a4fa8956423c4f42525fe14c0fcc9b9d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/102794/size7/a4fa8956423c4f42525fe14c0fcc9b9d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-189012","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-189012","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":813,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-410922","title":"Encik. Maseleni","authors":["Jaja R"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Orang Mwese adalah petani yang baik dan menjalani kehidupan yang bahagia. Mereka menanam semua jenis biji-bijian dan kacang. Haiwan itu juga gembira kerana selalu ada banyak makanan. Tetapi satu tahun hanya terdapat sedikit hujan dan tanamannya jarang. Oleh itu, haiwan-haiwan itu mula memakan apa sahaja makanan yang mereka dapati di kampung. Penduduk kampung tidak menyukai ini dan mula mengejar mereka. Menurut anda apa yang akan mereka lakukan untuk keluar dari masalah ini?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118034/size7/3f1e3fc14c981085fdd01a7b3fd1ef41.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/118034/size7/3f1e3fc14c981085fdd01a7b3fd1ef41.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-410922","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-410922","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":814,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-151335","title":"U mwemwela ha Sizwe","authors":["Tshifhiwa  Gangazhe"],"languag