 गंमत म्हणजे मीराशिवाय दुसरं कोणीच तिला पाहू शकत नाही. कारण अमीरा म्हणजे एक कल्पनेतलं साळिंदर आहे. चला, आपणही या दोन मैत्रिणींसोबत अनेक खऱ्या-खोट्या साहसी सफरींवर जाऊ या!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117617/size7/835e1d375a9f1cb096053b2a8491e360.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117617/size7/835e1d375a9f1cb096053b2a8491e360.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-45044","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-45044","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":26,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-433238","title":"हातांची गंमत","authors":["Makarand Dambhare"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"आपला हात काय काय करू शकतो? या हातांची गंमत माहीत आहे का? चला वाचू या.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727549/size7/987a082335102dbda4f5e0a491ace374.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727549/size7/987a082335102dbda4f5e0a491ace374.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-433238","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-433238","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":27,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-131","title":"बाबाच्या मिश्या","authors":["Madhuri Purandare"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"अनूला बाबाचं सगळ्यात जास्त काय आवडतं, तर त्याच्या मिश्या.\nखरं म्हणजे तिला मिश्यावाली सगळीच माणसं आवडतात.\nमिश्या बघितल्या की तिला काय काय भन्नाट कल्पना सुचतात.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721686/size7/0eaa2e9b2d4d4c465ba2c5e05a6f092c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721686/size7/0eaa2e9b2d4d4c465ba2c5e05a6f092c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-131","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-131","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":28,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-15748","title":"उद्या भेटू","authors":["Utkarsha Manish"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"निरोप घेताना तुम्ही “भेटू उद्या” असं म्हणता ना?\nया मुलाच्या दोस्तांनी खरंच तो अर्थ घेतला.\nआणि मग काय झालं?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527535/size7/9be34d190fad7085748a74f11b261f0a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527535/size7/9be34d190fad7085748a74f11b261f0a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-15748","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-15748","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":29,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38111","title":"वाघेंडा, गेंडास्वल आणि अस्वाघ","authors":["Mrinalinee  Vanarase"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"टिंगू वाघोबाला आपली केशरी-पिवळी केसाळ कातडी अजिबात आवडत नव्हती. त्यानं आपली कातडी रंगा नावाच्या गेंड्याला दिली आणि त्याची कातडी स्वतःला घेतली. थोडया काळातच टिंगूला आपली मूळ कातडी हवीशी वाटू लागली, म्हणून तो ती परत मागायला रंगाकडे गेला. पण रंगानं तर तोवर ती कातडी बबलू अस्वलाला देऊन त्याची कातडी स्वतःला घेतली होती. हे वाघेंडा, गेंडास्वल आणि अस्वाघ पुन्हा एकदा वाघोबा, गेंडा आणि अस्वल बनतील का? या प्राण्यांनी काय मजेदार घोटाळा करून ठेवलाय, पाहूया.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726495/size7/0f748e0a30ec491c6c7ac54cd4157b8e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726495/size7/0f748e0a30ec491c6c7ac54cd4157b8e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38111","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38111","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":30,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-23000","title":"कोण बरं स्वच्छ करतंय सारं?","authors":["Mrinalinee  Vanarase"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"जंगल इतकं स्वच्छ कसं असतं? जंगलात काहीही वाया जात नाही. कसं ते पाहू या.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188968/size7/715cc0ac513fbf98008ab8be6fa089d2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188968/size7/715cc0ac513fbf98008ab8be6fa089d2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-23000","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-23000","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":31,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-16556","title":"टिंग टाँग!","authors":["Sandhya Taksale"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"या छोटूला झोपायचंय पण झोप कशी लागणार?\nबघा बरं, कोणत्या गोष्टी त्याला त्रास देत आहेत?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123536/size7/4715c5ce5d3320cc4921d64fde8272ef.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123536/size7/4715c5ce5d3320cc4921d64fde8272ef.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-16556","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-16556","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":32,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-30044","title":"मोठ्ठ्या पर्वतांमधला छोटासा पक्षी","authors":["Varsha Gajendragadkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"नवे बूट खरेदी करण्यासाठी मीरा बाजारात निघाली आहे. वाटेत मीरा, तिचा भाऊ आणि आई एका जखमी पक्ष्यावर 