; पण स्टेजवर उभं राहून गाण्याची तिला भीती वाटते. शाळेच्या वार्षिक स्नेहसंमेलनात मोठ्या संख्येनं उपस्थित असलेल्या प्रेक्षकांसमोर तिला गायला जमेल?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524458/size7/494a9f0a61a10b2065089e090ff8017f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524458/size7/494a9f0a61a10b2065089e090ff8017f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61662","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61662","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":82,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-342664","title":"चांदोबा कुठे गेला?","authors":["Kanchan Bannerjee"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"चांदोबा दिवसा कुठे जातो? चला शोधू या!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727432/size7/3128da21a30b7187295cd4539b58927b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727432/size7/3128da21a30b7187295cd4539b58927b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-342664","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-342664","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":83,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-308656","title":"भभो म्हैस","authors":["Sushrut Kulkarni"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"एके दिवशी पावसात भभो म्हशीची शिंगं भिजली. वारा वाहू लागला, तेव्हा तिच्या ओल्या शिंगांवर धूळ-माती जमली. एकदा एक चिमणी उडत उडत आली. तिच्या चोचीतून एका झाडाचं एक बी भभोच्या शिंगांवर पडलं. त्या बीमधून कोंब आला आणि एक रोप उगवलं. आपल्या शिंगावर उगवलेल्या या झाडाचं भभो काय करेल? तुम्हाला काय वाटतं?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93904/size7/7497d29c1c21ab7acb6c159708ce9bd9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93904/size7/7497d29c1c21ab7acb6c159708ce9bd9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-308656","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-308656","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":84,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-12462","title":"घुम-घुम सुसरीची रोमांचक सहल","authors":["Rama  Murkunde"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"घुम-घुम सुसरीला तिच्या पहिल्याच पोहण्याच्या फेरीत उमगतं की तिच्या घरचे पुढे निघून गेलेत आणि ती मागेच राहिली आहे. तिला तिच्या घरचे भेटतील का? घुम-घुमच्या सोबत तुम्हीही गंगा नदीची सहल करा आणि नवनव्या प्राण्यांना भेटा.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723978/size7/fef3cb2e4de26e284dc81d72ff16571a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723978/size7/fef3cb2e4de26e284dc81d72ff16571a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-12462","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-12462","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":85,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61116","title":"पिल्लू मासा ‘फुगला!’","authors":["Meera Joshi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"एक लहानगा पफरफिश, म्हणजे शरीर फुगवणारा मासा, समुद्राच्या पाण्यानं बनलेल्या एका डबक्यात अडकतो. आपल्या समुद्रातल्या घरी परतायचा मार्ग त्याला सापडेल का?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724195/size7/7c77fc33d367383329d2c2e7c042303b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/724195/size7/7c77fc33d367383329d2c2e7c042303b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61116","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/stor