","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-393585","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":420,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-112386","title":"करामती बटण","authors":["Jui Kulkarni"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"तुम्ही कुठलेही कपडे घाला, बटणाला त्याबद्दल माहीत असतं. कारण त्यांच्याप्रमाणेच तर बटण वर-खाली होतं ना.  बटणासारखीच ही छोटीशी आणि गोड गोष्ट.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/159542/size7/379b719a78e778054323d97de6f0d54c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-112386","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-112386","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":421,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-39638","title":"आता तू संपलास","authors":["manohar chamoli"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"एकदा बेडकाने गांधीलमाशीला पकडले.यआता तू संपलीसल बेडूक म्ह़णाले. पण गांधीलमाशीला बेडकाच्या पाठी काहीतरी दिसले. बेडूकही काही वेळातच संपणार होता. या विनोदी साखळीत प्रत्येक प्राणी हा दुसर्‍या प्राण्याच्या तावडीत सापडतो आणि जवळ-जवळ संपतोच. गांधीलमाशी मात्र आपल्या चातुर्याने सर्वांना वाचवते.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101394/size7/769b9b95f2896b83fb2aa16001371d4f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/101394/size7/769b9b95f2896b83fb2aa16001371d4f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-39638","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-39638","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":422,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-95353","ti