ाऱ्या गोष्टी पहाता येतात, झालंच तर खूप दूरचे तारे जवळ दिसतात. ही सगळी किमया करणाऱ्या या काचा असतात तरी कशा? त्यांचं कार्य कसं चालतं? पाहू या गोष्टीत.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/94920/size7/bb37fccabe337577e1fe6a33eb2adf44.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/94920/size7/bb37fccabe337577e1fe6a33eb2adf44.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50891","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50891","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":768,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-60207","title":"ऑटर कसे व्हावे?","authors":["Asmita Chitale"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"एक अनुभवी ऑटर छोट्या छोट्या पिल्लांना काय बरं सांगतो आहे? नदीतल्या या मजेशीर प्राण्यांबद्दल आणखी जाणून घेण्यासाठी जरा कान देऊन या ऑटरआजोबांचं म्हणणं ऐका बरं!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715404/size7/365e0c31b59a2d51ada925f28ec98ab9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/715404/size7/365e0c31b59a2d51ada925f28ec98ab9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60207","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60207","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":769,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-9394","title":"सारस","authors":["Shubhada Chaukar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"निसर्ग, झाडं, प्राणी यांच्याशी खेड्यातल मुलांचं जगणं जोडलेलं असतं. आुष्भर लक्षात राहील असा एक धडा ही मुलं कशी शिकली, ते सांगणारी ही हृदयस्पर्शी कथा.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722857/size7/6fb60231ce2aa30ab7722953f3d0c925.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722857/size7/6fb60231ce2aa30ab7722953f3d0c925.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-9394","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-9394","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":770,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-110092","title":"मेगन आणि मृत्यूची राजकन्या","authors":["Meera Joshi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"फ्रिट्सचा केबलकारमधून पाठलाग करता करता मेगनच्या लक्षात येतं, की ती कुठल्यातरी चमत्कारिक जगात अडकून पडलेली आहे. ही आहे होपानगरी आणि तिथली महाविचित्र राजकन्या. आता मेगन आणि फ्रिट्सला घरी परतण्यासाठी एकापेक्षा एक भयंकर, भीतीदायक गुहा पार करायच्या आहेत. पण त्याआधी मेगनला महाविचित्र राजकन्येनं घातलेली तीन कोडी सोडवावी लागणार आहेत.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727154/size7/b53ed09e0cc6e49999ce7b28ca94c2bb.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727154/size7/b53ed09e0cc6e49999ce7b28ca94c2bb.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-110092","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-110092","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":771,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-580808","title":"आपला खरा मित्र कोण?","authors":["Abhijit Pendharkar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rhino, Crocodile, Giraffe and Zebra all have an unlikely friend. Can you guess who he is?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706095/size7/61695b92450e5cf6696869c4b800dd6e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/706095/size7/61695b92450e5cf6696869c4b800dd6e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-580808","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyw