ುಗ ನಾರ್ಗೆಗೆ ಆರ್ನಾ, ಐರಿಸ್ ತಮ್ಮ ಶಾಲೆಯ ಪರಿಚಯ ಮಾಡಿಸಿದ್ದು ಹೇಗೆ? ತಿಳಿಯೋಣ ಬನ್ನಿ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/354874/size7/9c6042fcaf09adad8d5cb470f6ffe56a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/354874/size7/9c6042fcaf09adad8d5cb470f6ffe56a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-473173","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-473173","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1058,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-209441","title":"ಕುಣಿತ ಮರೆತ ನವಿಲು","authors":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಹಿನಾಳ ಕುಣಿತವನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ ನವಿಲು ಕುಣಿಯುವುದನ್ನು ಮರೆಯಿತು.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/285296/size7/fdb378a472f71021e971a650d68c810b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/285296/size7/fdb378a472f71021e971a650d68c810b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-209441","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-209441","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1059,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-185998","title":"ಬೋಗೆ  ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಕಂಡಿತು ಭರವಸೆ?","authors":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"language":"bo","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಶಾಲೆಗಳು ಮುಚ್ಚಿ, ವೈದ್ಯರಾದ  ಅಪ್ಪ ಅಮ್ಮ  ಕೊವಿಡ್‌ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ಹೋರಾಡಲು ಆಸ್ಪತ್ರೆಯಲ್ಲಿಯೇ ಉಳಿಯಬೇಕಾಗಿ ಬಂದು ಏಷ್ಯಾದ ಬೊ ತನ್ನ ಚಿಕ್ಕಮ್ಮನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಇರಬೇಕಾಯಿತು. ಅವನಿಗೆ ಅವರದ್ದೇ ಯೋಚನೆ.  ಆಗ ಅವನು ಏನು ಮಾಡಿದ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/206549/size7/c440ea312362221478fde7cde363673a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/206549/size7/c440ea312362221478fde7cde363673a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-185998","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-185998","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1060,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-544770","title":"ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟೊ","authors":["Hema Hebbagodi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟೊ ಎನ್ನುವ ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟಿಕಾಸುರ ಕಂಡದ್ದನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ಕಬಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ! ಅದು ಬೆಳೆಯುತ್ತ, ಬೆಳೆಯುತ್ತ ತನ್ನ ಹಾದಿಯಲ್ಲಿರುವುದನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನಾಶಪಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟೊನನ್ನು ತಡೆಹಿಡಿದು ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸಲು ಸಾಧ್ಯವೇ? ನಮ್ಮ ಈ ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟಿಕ್‌ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆಗೆ ಪರಿಹಾರವೇನು ಎನ್ನುವುದೇ ಈ ಕತೆ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621649/size7/625fd6b28f719bd13fa2a8586cf49696.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621649/size7/625fd6b28f719bd13fa2a8586cf49696.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-544770","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-544770","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1061,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-223239","title":"ಜಾಣ ಬೆಕ್ಕು","authors":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಸಫಿಯು ಜಾಣತನಕ್ಕೆ ಹೆಸರಾದ ಬೆಕ್ಕು! ಅದರ ಜಾಣತನದ ಕತೆಯನ್ನು ನೀವೇ ಓದಿ ತಿಳಿಯಿರಿ!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/253186/size7/12d218fb4d4baa7c1463938230643b3c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/253186/size7/12d218fb4d4baa7c1463938230643b3c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-223239","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-223239","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1062,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-457586","title":"ಫಣಿಯ ಚಪ್ಪಲಿಗಳ ತಮಾಷೆ","authors":["Hema Khurshapur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಫಣಿ ಮತ್ತು ಅವನ ಚಪ್ಪಲಿಗಳ ತಮಾಷೆಯ ಕತೆಯನ್ನು ಓದಿ!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697338/size7/449bff38f5fe0e95bef02ec46b2b9307.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/697338/size7/449bff38f5fe0e95bef02ec46b2b9307.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-457586","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-457586","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1063,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-630742","title":"ನಮ್ಮ ಮನೆ","authors":["Shwetha"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ನಮ್ಮ ಮನೆಗೆ ಸ್ವಾಗತ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721923/size7/731f5cd98087de43ac46a2e1d49b9710.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721923/size7/731f5cd98087de43ac46a2e1d49b9710.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-630742","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-630742","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1064,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-622279","title":"ಅಚ್ಛಾಚಿಯ ರಂಗುರಂಗಿನ ಕೊಡೆ","authors":["Hema Khurshapur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಶಾಲೆಗೆ ಹೋಗಿ ಬರುವಾಗ ಸಹ್ಯಾದ್ರಿ ಮತ್ತೊಮ್ಮೆ ಕೊಡೆ ಕಳೆದುಕೊಂಡಳು. ಅಷ್ಟೇ ಈಗ ಅಮ್ಮನಿಗೆ ಗೊತ್ತಾದರೆ! ಆದರೆ, ಅಚ್ಛಾಚಿ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಹೊಸ ಕೊಡೆ ಮಾಡಲು ಸಹಾಯ ಮಾಡಲಿದ್ದಾರೆ. ಇದು ಪೈ ನಕ್ಷೆಗಳ ಪರಿಕಲ್ಪನೆಯನ್ನು ಪರಿಚಯಿಸುವ ಕತೆ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727418/size7/37170842b20a8ced11ae674f17ce3855.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727418/size7/37170842b20a8ced11ae674f17ce3855.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-622279","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-622279","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1065,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-209475","title":"ಗೂಬೆರಾಜನ ರಾತ್ರಿ","authors":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ರಾತ್ರಿಯಾಯಿತು. ಗೂಬೆರಾಜನ ಸಭೆಯೂ ಶುರುವಾಯಿತು.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283796/size7/5bd5aefbeffb0a95e36efc078822af1c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/283796/size7/5bd5aefbeffb0a95e36efc078822af1c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-209475","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-209475","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1066,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-473108","title":"ನಮ್ಮ ಸುತ್ತ: ಪದಾರ್ಥ ಪ್ರಪಂಚ","authors":["Ranu Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ನೀವು ಸಂತೆಯಲ್ಲಿದ್ದೀರಾ ಎಂದುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ. ನಿಮ್ಮೆದುರಿಗೆ ಏನೇನೆಲ್ಲಾ\nಕಾಣುತ್ತಿದೆ? ಈ ಎಲ್ಲ ಪದಾರ್ಥಗಳಲ್ಲೂ ಒಂದು ಅಂಶ ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯವಾಗಿದೆ, \nಅದೇನೆಂದು ಕಂಡುಹಿಡಿಯುವಿರಾ? ಓದುಗರಿಗೆ ವಸ್ತುಸ್ಥಿತಿ, ಘನ, ದ್ರವ \nಹಾಗೂ ಅನಿಲಗಳ ಗುಣ ವಿಶೇಷಗಳ ಪರಿಚಯಿಸುವ ಕತೆ ಇದು.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716106/size7/02e339023b3e541b1468c97c115b5098.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716106/size7/02e339023b3e541b1468c97c115b5098.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-473108","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-473108","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1067,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-162068","title":"ಫಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಹಸಿರು ಹಾವು","authors":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಹಿರಿಯರು ಹೇಳಿದಂತೆ ಮಾಡಬಯಸುವ ಫಾತಿಗೆ ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದು ದಿನವೂ ಹೊಸತೇ. ತಂದೆಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ಕಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಸಂಗ್ರಹದಲ್ಲಿ ತೊಡಗಿದ ಫಾತಿಗೆ ಅಚ್ಚರಿಯೊಂದು ಎದುರಾಗುತ್ತದೆ. ಉತ್ತರ ಘಾನಾದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಳೆಯುವ ಹುಡುಗಿಯೊಬ್ಬಳ ದಿನಚರಿಯನ್ನು ಆಧರಿಸಿದ ಒಂದು ಕತೆ ʻಫಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಹಸಿರು ಹಾವುʼ","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/62460/size7/731db424da42564f209ccf9e5c96a6c4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/62460/size7/731db424da42564f209ccf9e5c96a6c4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-162068","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-162068","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1068,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-592291","title":"ಒಂದು ವೇಳೆ...?","authors":["Pushpak M"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ನಂದಿ ಯೋಚಿಸುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಳೆ, ತನ್ನ ಸುತ್ತ ನಾನು ಅಂದುಕೊಂಡಂತೆಲ್ಲ ಆಗಿದ್ದರೆ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85674/size7/fb841454b707169f4ae43b8ade313bcc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85674/size7/fb841454b707169f4ae43b8ade313bcc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-592291","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-592291","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1069,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-648444","title":"ಬೋಧಾ ರಕ್ಷಕರು","authors":["Bhat Ananthesha"],"language":"","readingLevel":"Level 3","publisher":"","summary":"ಒಂದು ಕೆಟ್ಟ ಸುದ್ದಿ ಇದೆ - ಬೋಧಾ ಸುತ್ತಮುತ್ತಲಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಹಳ್ಳಿಗಳು ಪ್ರವಾಹಕ್ಕೆ ಸಿಲುಕಿವೆ. ಆದರೆ ಬೋಧಾ ಸುರಕ್ಷಿತ ಮತ್ತು ಸದೃಢವಾಗಿದೆ! ಈ ಗ್ರಾಮವನ್ನು ವಿಪತ್ತಿನಿಂದ ರಕ್ಷಿಸಿದ್ದು ಏನು? ಬೋಧಾದ ರಕ್ಷಕರು ಯಾರು? ಗೌತಮ ಎಂಬ ಬುದ್ಧಿವಂತ ವ್ಯಕ್ತಿ ಈ ಕಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ರಹಸ್ಯವನ್ನು ಹಂಚಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಾನೆ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/410162/size7/b42667dc6d17a0af3efed8f052cc333d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/410162/size7/b42667dc6d17a0af3efed8f052cc333d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-648444","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-648444","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1070,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-186491","title":"ನಿಕೌಗೆ ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಕಂಡಿತು ಭರವಸೆ?","authors":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಶಾಲೆಗಳು ಮುಚ್ಚಿವೆ. ಓಷನಿಯಾ ಪ್ರದೇಶದ  ನಿಕೌನ ಕುಟುಂಬ ಈಗಷ್ಟೆ ತಮ್ಮ ನಿವಾಸವನ್ನು ಹೊಸ ಜಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ಬದಲಾಯಿಸಿದ್ದಾರೆ. ಅವನಿಗೆ ಜೊತೆಗಾರರಿಲ್ಲದ ಕೊರತೆ. ಅವನು ತನ್ನ ಕೊರತೆಯನ್ನು ಹೇಗೆ ನೀಗಿಸಿಕೊಂಡ ಎಂಬುದನ್ನು ತಿಳಿಯಲು ಈ ಕಥೆಯನ್ನು ಓದಿರಿ.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527555/size7/545d9538aebce5f9a06175d4e235c2ac.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527555/size7/545d9538aebce5f9a06175d4e235c2ac.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-186491","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-186491","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1071,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-651686","title":"ಕಬಡ್ಡಿ ಕಬಡ್ಡಿ","authors":["Hema Khurshapur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಕಬಡ್ಡಿ ಆಟ ನಡೆಯುತ್ತಿದೆ. ಒಂದು ಗುಲಾಬಿ ತಂಡ, ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಹಳದಿ ತಂಡ. ನೀವು ಯಾವ ತಂಡ ಸೇರಿ ಆಟ ಆಡುತ್ತೀರಿ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725442/size7/1f941d39cefe0653c28bdecdf71746ac.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/725442/size7/1f941d39cefe0653c28bdecdf71746ac.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-651686","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-651686","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1072,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-473172","title":"ನಮ್ಮ ಸೂಪರ್ ಹೀರೋಗಳು","authors":["Deepthi N"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಸೂಪರ್ ಹೀರೋಗಳೆಂದರೆ ಸದಾ ಮೇಲಂಗಿಗಳನ್ನು ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡು, ಕೈಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಆಯುಧಗಳನ್ನ ಹಿಡಿದು ಸದಾ ಹಾರಬೇಕು ಎಂದೇನೂ ಇಲ್ಲ. ಕೆಲವು ಸೂಪರ್‌ ಹೀರೋಗಳು ಮಾಸ್ಕ್‌, ರಕ್ಷಾಕವಚಗಳನ್ನಷ್ಟೇ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡಿರಬಹುದು. ಕೆಲವರು ಸ್ಟೆಥೋಸ್ಕೋಪ್, ಥರ್ಮೊ ಮೀಟರ್ ಹಿಡಿದಿರಬಹುದು. ಕೆಲವರು ಮೈಕ್ರೊಸ್ಕೋಪ್‌ ಮೂಲಕ ಲ್ಯಾಬ್‌ ರಿಪೋರ್ಟ್‌ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುವವರಷ್ಟೇ ಆಗಿರಬಹುದು. ಕೋವಿಡ್‌ ಸಂದರ್ಭದಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರತಿದಿನ ನಮಗೆ ಎದುರಾದ ಸೂಪರ್‌ ಹೀರೋಗಳು ಇವರು.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-473172","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-473172","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1073,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-153118","title":"ನೀರಾನೆ ಕುಣಿಯಬೇಕಂತೆ!","authors":["Priyadarshini Shettar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ನೀರಾನೆ ಕುಣಿಯಬೇಕಂತೆ! ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಜೊತೆಯಾಗುವರು ಯಾರು?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/86908/size7/9e5f5a8635052315e4d550572471ac04.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/86908/size7/9e5f5a8635052315e4d550572471ac04.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-153118","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-153118","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1074,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-457146","title":"ಚಿನುನ ಉಡುಗೊರೆ","authors":["Hema Khurshapur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"ಚಿನು ತನ್ನ ತಂದೆಗೆ ಸಹಾಯ ಮಾಡುವುದನ್ನು ತುಂಬಾ ಆನಂದಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ, ಅವನಿಗೂ