g/acquisition"}]},{"id":193,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-60804","title":"Drip-Drop-Drip","authors":["Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"100daysreadingcampaignPunjab2022","publisher":"","summary":"What is this strange sound you can hear in \nthe forest–Drip-Drop-Drip?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721648/size7/bf7c31d602d29510073b0f23cb0d1688.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721648/size7/bf7c31d602d29510073b0f23cb0d1688.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60804","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60804","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":194,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-8881","title":"Turtle Story","authors":["Kartik Shanker"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Under cover of darkness, baby olive ridley turtles hatch from sun-warmed eggs on remote beaches. One of them, the little hatchling who is the narrator of our story, is delighted to make it across the beach and into the ocean without losing her way or being captured by predators. \n\nBut can our little olive ridley survive the dangers of the ocean? Will she make it past the deadly sharks and the terrible fishing nets and reach adulthood? Will she ever have the pleasure of laying her own brood of eggs?\n\nFind out in this charming life story of an olive ridley turtle, and meet several other interesting creatures along the way.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/27753/size7/e21f0014824d4500d005ff02b9529442.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/27753/size7/e21f0014824d4500d005ff02b9529442.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-8881","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-8881","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":195,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-60932","title":"Dance, Mihlali!","authors":["Matona Fatman"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The day of the concert is approaching, and Mihlali is getting more and more nervous. Will she ever be ready to dance in front of all those people?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130507/size7/abbca912f758719547f7dc1afe9eac68.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130507/size7/abbca912f758719547f7dc1afe9eac68.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-60932","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-60932","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":196,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-3787","title":"Long Live Friendship! A Humorous Play for Children","authors":["Meera Dixit"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Vikram falls sick, Yamraj thinks its time to take him in. Vikram’s maddeningly stubborn friends think otherwise. The play takes a serious issue and presents it in a light-hearted vein. Children can easily and quickly stage and self-direct this hilarious play. Perfect for annual school days and neighbourhood events.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699246/size7/af9f6093a29e3d59668e6c35efe10c2a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699246/size7/af9f6093a29e3d59668e6c35efe10c2a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-3787","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-3787","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":197,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-33603","title":