hing be done to stop her from playing with her food?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91617/size7/7665b5719e56df1b97c01a18608f9f09.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/91617/size7/7665b5719e56df1b97c01a18608f9f09.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24191","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24191","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":207,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-326772","title":"Beauty Is Missing","authors":["Priya Kuriyan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tessamma’s beloved buffalo is missing! No one knows what happened to her but constable Jincy is determined to find out. She goes all over the village, questioning people and looking for clues. Will Jincy be able to find Beauty the buffalo? The game is afoot in this mystery about a music-loving buffalo.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703483/size7/32d97f0835d6c7513042c8ab55b3ce74.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/703483/size7/32d97f0835d6c7513042c8ab55b3ce74.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-326772","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-326772","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":208,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10730","title":"More or Less? Need to Guess!","authors":["Gayathri Tirthapura"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"So many mithai boxes to count, so little time! Can Ranjita and Vikram do it? Yes, using a cool math trick called 'Approximately More-or-Less'! Read this fun wedding story to learn the trick yourself!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712829/size7/da3cb47b4e548e2e6f4f4ebd366e9ac0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712829/size7/da3cb47b4e548e2e6f4f4ebd366e9ac0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10730","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10730","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":209,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-11050","title":"Gul in Space","authors":["Richa  Jha"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"What would you like to do on your birthday? How about taking a walk in OUTER SPACE! Here’s a story that will make you jump with joy… and if there’s no gravity under you, you might just stay exactly where you are! Get ready to explore the space with Astronaut Gul.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712826/size7/58683be3e3871b08499fc6cb1786c206.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712826/size7/58683be3e3871b08499fc6cb1786c206.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-11050","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-11050","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":210,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-25840","title":"It's Play Time","authors":["Neha Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Rahi and her classmates are getting ready for their school play. Everyone is excited and nervous\nabout their performance. Will everything go as planned?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123538/size7/58b7c973afb2776c934b384c459d490d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/123538/size7/58b7c973afb2776c934b384c459d490d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-25840","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-25840","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":211,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61788","title":"How Pintu Found Pi","authors":["Sarat  Talluri Rao"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Pintu is lonely in his new school. Whenever he approaches his classmates, they form a closed circle. Then Pintu finds pi.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/718341/size7/5ba950a3c80d17bc15f123072ca97a74.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/718341/size7/5ba950a3c80d17bc15f123072ca97a74.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61788","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-61788","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":212,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-336656","title":"Picnic on Grass","authors":["Venkataraghavan Subha Srinivasan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Grass can be of different kinds. It can be soft, it can be rough, you can smell it and even taste it.  Best of all is that you can picnic on grass.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/474156/size7/d3b59531e7aa166d232530da42547ac8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/474156/size7/d3b59531e7aa166d232530da42547ac8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-336656","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-336656","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":213,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-353206","title":"The Birthday Menu","authors":["Meenu Thomas"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It is Kanchi’s birthday and she can’t go out to her favourite restaurant. Knowing that baingan bharta is all she has to look forward to, she is really upset. But her neighbours in Sunrise Society know that the best way to turn things around is with a feast! A story about community, compassion, and the food we eat.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727417/size7/6a5199c6c3a470dbd30154529ea8a4bc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727417/size7/6a5199c6c3a470dbd30154529ea8a4bc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-353206","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-353206","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":214,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-184","title":"Look At Me","authors":["Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"100daysreadingcampaignPunjab2022","publisher":"","summary":"Meet the children in the book. They are just like you!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721874/size7/8ecac1b7b1c40058b7d2b62254e358d7.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/721874/size7/8ecac1b7b1c40058b7d2b62254e358d7.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-184","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-184","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":215,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-29919","title":"Teaching Pa","authors":["Amrutash Misra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Diya’s Pa has never gone to school. So she decides to teach him herself. Pa listens to her most of the time, but Maths Days are difficult. How does Diya manage?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524659/size7/c55e8e922116b1ad507a3d2b05223006.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/524659/size7/c55e8e922116b1ad507a3d2b05223006.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-29919","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-29919","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":216,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-36947","title":"A Whistling Good Idea","authors":["Rahul Raghavan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"reading","publisher":"","summary":"Ma wants Nivi to turn off the pressure cooker after three whistles. But Nivi wants to read  her new book instead! Find out how she cleverly does both.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713820/size7/735e2105b6ba7d1d28b34e8940ff584c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713820/size7/735e2105b6ba7d1d28b34e8940ff584c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-36947","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-36947","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":217,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-139495","title":"The Right Way School","authors":["Shabnam  Minwalla"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The Right Way School has only the right way of doing things and that’s how Mrs Gambhir teaches as well. Until one day a girl with wild hair and endless curiosity joins the school and stumps everyone with her questions, her merry voice, and her behaviour. What will happen next?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188969/size7/3bacc5d88dc24dcb3711be73fb8f289a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/188969/size7/3bacc5d88dc24dcb3711be73fb8f289a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https