n this book about noticing and recognising patterns.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/472786/size7/c73d494d112953afae92ffe68d3d5f6f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/472786/size7/c73d494d112953afae92ffe68d3d5f6f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-374691","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-374691","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":238,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-1658","title":"Ammu's Puppy","authors":["Sowmya Rajendran"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ammu does not have a puppy. But she tells her friends that she does! Her puppy's name is Shankar, she says. Shankar loves bananas, she says. She tells them so much about Shankar that her friends want to come home and meet him. Now what will Ammu do?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696665/size7/5c7d534c8828504a66ff3855ce3b80ab.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/696665/size7/5c7d534c8828504a66ff3855ce3b80ab.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-1658","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-1658","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":239,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-122951","title":"Pranav the Pattern Detective","authors":["Aditya Swaminathan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It is an ordinary day for Pranav until he spots something special in a tree. This discovery sets him on a journey that changes the way he views the world around him. Shapes will never look the same again.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/182211/size7/1c0f7c208e02eb005dabac5c14150631.jpg","thum