hors":["Varsha  Joshi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Round, fat pooris are a treat in most Indian homes. Why do they puff? There is a whole lot of science behind this simple question.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712715/size7/ff6bc354d6dd3c347b5b06c130c85cd2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/712715/size7/ff6bc354d6dd3c347b5b06c130c85cd2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-3841","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-3841","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":292,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-1067","title":"Naughty Dog","authors":["Kanchan Bannerjee"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"If you had a tail, you would wag it after reading this book. This book is one of the four books in the 'Animals Around Us' series.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704905/size7/6ba1aebea83f179aa77599f8f256fc8d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/704905/size7/6ba1aebea83f179aa77599f8f256fc8d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-1067","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-1067","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":293,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-8828","title":"Maaloo, Kaaloo ...and who?","authors":["Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Maaloo and Kaaloo are back! This time they are playing detective at Grandma’s house in the hills.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722825/size7/a8f6d625f16864f8d814762e38c0e384.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722825/size7/a8f6d625f16864f8d814762e38c0e384.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-8828","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-8828","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":294,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-266069","title":"Our Beautiful World","authors":["Bibek Bhattacharya"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Humans have been around for 2,00,000 years. But in the last 250 years, we have created a monster: climate change. This monster is making the planet hotter, and threatening the lives of those we share the planet with. How did we get here? And what comes next? This non-fiction book tells us why we should be hot under the collar about the climate crisis.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621795/size7/bf212bf61e522b6f4d6d83b07ad4934f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/621795/size7/bf212bf61e522b6f4d6d83b07ad4934f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-266069","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-266069","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":295,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-24769","title":"Keya's Day at the Beach","authors":["Radha Rangarajan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Join Keya the Soldier Crab as she explores the beach with her Ma, and meets many different crabs.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714194/size7/56f741bbf87a304122d2aa03d106d334.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714194/size7/56f741bbf87a304122d2aa03d106d334.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24769","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/