in his house. In fact, he is quite scared of the bat.\nHow can Suppi and Amma get the bat back to her family?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/57856/size7/f1e874aeb6aad2c5558fea57c8273c6c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/57856/size7/f1e874aeb6aad2c5558fea57c8273c6c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-28951","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-28951","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":457,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-69028","title":"The Girl Who Thinks in Numbers: Data Warrior  Prukalpa Sankar","authors":["Shreyasi Singh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Prukalpa Sankar loves numbers. They help her see patterns and solve community problems. How does she do this?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/718388/size7/20706d3f0f69d8952f5afdb3b86786f6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/718388/size7/20706d3f0f69d8952f5afdb3b86786f6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-69028","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-69028","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":458,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-37104","title":"The Tino, the Rhear and the Biger","authors":["Ashok Rajagopalan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tingu Tiger is not happy with his furry orange skin, so he exchanges it with Ranga Rhino. But when he wants his skin back, Ranga has already given it to Bubloo Bear! Will the tino, rhear and biger go back to being tiger, rhino and bear? Find out in this fun story about muddled up animals.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726495/size7/0f748e0a30ec491c6c7ac54cd4157b8e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/726495/size7/0f748e0a30ec491c6c7ac54cd4157b8e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-37104","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37104","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":459,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-326351","title":"A Tea Garden Party","authors":["Swati Sengupta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Abha is going to the cool hills of Darjeeling. On the way she stops at a tea factory. She has so many questions! Is tea a leaf? Where does it grow? What makes it taste so good? Go on a tour of a tea garden and factory and find the answers to these questions with Abha.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/422097/size7/b064c2ac77aba307892edb71ceb40ca9.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/422097/size7/b064c2ac77aba307892edb71ceb40ca9.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-326351","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-326351","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":460,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-267809","title":"A Tree's Heart","authors":["Radha Rangarajan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Did you know trees are storytellers? Listen carefully and you can hear them whisper many stories — of forest fires and rain, of summer and winter, of our past and future. Look carefully around a tree’s heartwood and you will discover many tales, like the one in this book.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716359/size7/c8fe91246e9c51abbdb60013eab5f3df.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716359/size7/c8fe91246e9c51abbdb60013eab5f3df.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-267809","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-267809","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":461,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-96518","title":"Peepre in the Postbox","authors":["Aditi De"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Peepre the ant finds herself in a postbox! Share her journey to discover how mail travels from one place to another.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527530/size7/1b275e4076d102c3764850e6e59bebe6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/527530/size7/1b275e4076d102c3764850e6e59bebe6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-96518","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-96518","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":462,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10395","title":"Apu's Giant Earthquake","authors":["Sudeshna  Shome Ghosh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Did Apu’s singing cause the earth to tremble and shake? Or was it an earthquake? Find out more in this humorous and fascinating story about earthquakes.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713578/size7/2e61153788e79629615dbd8dd46a58fc.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/713578/size7/2e61153788e79629615dbd8dd46a58fc.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10395","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10395","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"