://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-14785","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":585,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-265897","title":"At Home","authors":["Shweta Ganesh Kumar"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ammini misses school, and her brother Unni misses his aunt. Both of them miss playing in the park. But everyone has to stay indoors. Maybe they can go out for a walk today? Ammini hopes so. A day in the life of two children in a time of lockdowns and social distancing.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362389/size7/92cfd489ab32329c3852cad118700016.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362389/size7/92cfd489ab32329c3852cad118700016.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-265897","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-265897","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":586,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-263984","title":"Everyday Superheroes","authors":["Minakshi  Dewan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Superheroes don’t always wear capes, or carry weapons. They don’t always fly. Some superheroes wear masks and protective suits. Some carry stethoscopes and thermometers. And some look through microscopes and examine lab reports. A book on everyday heroes in the time of a pandemic.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/716009/size7/face7ba6c7f85b3a809b4af747dd3ccf.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-263984","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/S