er mole rat and she wanted to see everything. Every\nnight, she packed her explorer's kit: her sunglasses, binoculars, magnifying\nglass and of course, her favourite – a strip of sticker bandages. “An explorer is\nalways prepared,” she said. Every time she dug in a new direction and returned\nthrough a new burrow!\nThis time our unlikely explorer has surfaced near the sea. Enjoy a walk along\nthe beach with her as she befriends a host of strange creatures.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117644/size7/345aa877047222aeb24a3b5c333a5da8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/117644/size7/345aa877047222aeb24a3b5c333a5da8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-19724","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-19724","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":712,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-103055","title":"The Mundu Magicians","authors":["Gayathri Bashi"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Unni wants to be a mundu magician, just like his Ammumma. What can he make with Ammumma’s old mundus?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727155/size7/bdd4148a9ee1b51b8a0aaf8e6bf57d54.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727155/size7/bdd4148a9ee1b51b8a0aaf8e6bf57d54.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-103055","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-103055","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":713,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-42646","title":"Black Ant","authors":["Brian Kavanagh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Black Ant is a courageous ant who likes to go on adventures in the bush, meet other animals and learn new things. What do you think will happen on her next adventure?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99522/size7/c7619b9b0b3b2df8ae5de6bf6539ef6f.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99522/size7/c7619b9b0b3b2df8ae5de6bf6539ef6f.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-42646","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-42646","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":714,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38635","title":"The Birthday Chocolate","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Tutul wants to give her friend some chocolate for her birthday. But nobody in her family is ready to help her! Tutul needs a new plan! Can her clever idea convince the shopkeeper to give her some birthday chocolate?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/646387/size7/ff1df4b48c7dcd320e96152a03c86f3e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/646387/size7/ff1df4b48c7dcd320e96152a03c86f3e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38635","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38635","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":715,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-37239","title":"Cicada's Song","authors":["Alisha Berger"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Cicada loves to sing. She wants to learn new songs. She decides to visit birds and insects to learn from them. Will Cicada have the chance to sing new songs?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93874/size7/6a2a68bdd190f3d01e363776795b72e6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93874/size7/6a2a68bdd190f3d01e363776795b72e6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-37239","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37239","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":716,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-33561","title":"Who Drives the Driverless Car?","authors":["Vidya Pradhan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Story time! Paati is here for the summer and Suvi wants to make the most of it. As her grandma starts describing the Pushpaka Vimana, Suvi wonders if it’s like a driverless car, which drives you safely to any destination you name. Buckle up, enjoy the ride!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717239/size7/5e819e64be3f8479367fb429bdb9cff8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/717239/size7/5e819e64be3f8479367fb429bdb9cff8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-33561","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-33561","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":717,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38407","title":"Girisha from the Hills","authors":["Rose Larsen"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When a wild elephant turns up in Girisha’s village, people are afraid, but not Girisha. She is brave. What do you think she will do to calm the elephant?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93517/size7/0138eafb4464e555f9ceb389bc1291c0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93517/size7/0138eafb4464e555f9ceb389bc1291c0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38407","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38407","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":718,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-37264","title":"Frog's Bright Idea","authors":["Magdalena  Cooper"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Frog is hungry! But he can’t catch any insects or moths. Frog has a bright idea, and he is never hungry again. Guess what he did?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/97810/size7/ded0be23eb52e996e06d2158bcc1a942.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/97810/size7/ded0be23eb52e996e06d2158bcc1a942.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-37264","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-37264","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":719,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-252821","title":"Something's Stuck Around the Duck","authors":["Katie Pyle"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Nandini and Kavitha go to the park, they find a lot of garbage lying around.\nA duck has tried to eat a piece of plastic but now it is stuck around her beak.\nCan the girls help save the duck and clean up the park for good?\n\nRead on to find out!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/351172/size7/c8030b6dc58074e0eb25fca6a9ce7af4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/351172/size7/c8030b6dc58074e0eb25fca6a9ce7af4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-252821","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-252821","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":720,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-43602","title":"Sani, the Beautiful Little Girl","authors":["Erica Cuellar"],"language":"",