tcast of the family. Read on to find out what happens!","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/133765/size7/5ae251b54846672d8b9dc73c854dc8df.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/133765/size7/5ae251b54846672d8b9dc73c854dc8df.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-24641","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-24641","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":768,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-50119","title":"Gappu Gola","authors":["Sherein Bansal"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"As Gappu Gola pops out of the box, madness tumbles out in this nonsense verse.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727080/size7/6b02033d91d678fd198870c0e0c63af5.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727080/size7/6b02033d91d678fd198870c0e0c63af5.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-50119","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-50119","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":769,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-61091","title":"Let's have an Inside Day!","authors":["Lerato Mbangeni"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Who says a rainy day can’t turn into an exciting inside day?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495652/size7/85817a94320055f6dbe550c491995d2b.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/495652/size7/85817a94320055f6dbe550c491995d2b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-61091","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-6