 passing by warned him that if he cut the very branch he was sitting on, he would surely fall down and die. Find out what the woodcutter did in this hilarious tale from enchanting Ethiopia.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699931/size7/16d65735feb6912fdd617ec9907fe4bf.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/699931/size7/16d65735feb6912fdd617ec9907fe4bf.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-660","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-660","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":773,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-28170","title":"Just Like Me","authors":["Hani  du Toit"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"It’s Rahah’s birthday party. Mum wants to know who she will invite. Will they all fit in?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85476/size7/7f7ef6d943fa1099838a8a1508f14b46.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/85476/size7/7f7ef6d943fa1099838a8a1508f14b46.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-28170","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-28170","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":774,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-135279","title":"The Travelling Bug","authors":["Kalyani  Ganapathy","Lungshai Leisan","Ogin Nayam","Prabhakar Dabral","Rajiv Eipe","Ruchi Shah","Tanya Kotnala"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ow! Binita Beetle gets bitten by the travel\nbug and so what does she do? She packs\nher bags and has a grand adventure. As\nshe travels to different lands, Binita sheds\nher old skin, becoming part of the new\nspaces and embracing new experiences,\nas she discovers the magic of music,\ntravel, and friendship.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/186217/size7/f48f1aee36c884851130acd8dbaf70c6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/186217/size7/f48f1aee36c884851130acd8dbaf70c6.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-135279","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-135279","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":775,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-1591","title":"Where is Gogo?","authors":["Mala Kumar","Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Toto spotted Gogo's empty cage, he knew he was in trouble. Would you like to help Toto find Gogo?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722400/size7/03af4ace340bf149dc2cee14949f59ba.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722400/size7/03af4ace340bf149dc2cee14949f59ba.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-1591","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-1591","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":776,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-539333","title":"Goal!","authors":["Radhika Shenoy"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Every Sunday, Heena watches a group of girls playing football from her window. She wants to join them. But convincing Ammi and Abbu is not going to be easy. Will she be able to join the team? Run, kick and score goals and experience freedom like never before?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722712/size7/9dad0be4a882027e361a9250311b4692.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722712/size7/9dad0be4a882027e361a9250311b4692.jpg","acqui