t introduces young readers to animals and their tracks.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714338/size7/79cec9b30eb76917a457653a32a5b3e2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/714338/size7/79cec9b30eb76917a457653a32a5b3e2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-55713","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-55713","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":849,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-821","title":"Here Comes the Camel and Other Poems","authors":["Manisha Chaudhry"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Prayag Shukla's poems in Hindi have enchanted young and old alike. This collection of poems translated into English brings the joy of his writing to a new set of readers. Siraj Saxena's innovative artwork adds to the appeal of this classic collection.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722421/size7/17071390c8bd0a61c5c5913877f15057.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722421/size7/17071390c8bd0a61c5c5913877f15057.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-821","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-821","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":850,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-266160","title":"Aarna and Iris' Big Task","authors":["Reshma Thapa Gurung"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Aarna and Iris have a new task! There’s a new student in class, and they have to help him settle in. So they set about introducing Norgay to their school in a novel way — by using their senses.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/354874/size7/9c6042fcaf09adad8d5cb470f6ffe56a.