"readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Moutushi is a little sunbird who loves brightly-coloured flowers. Didima has lots of them growing in her flower pots. Moutushi drinks nectar from the flowers, and in return gives Didima a beautiful gift. What could this gift be?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727152/size7/b9fdf12f3422f5e91081a4a304273b2d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/727152/size7/b9fdf12f3422f5e91081a4a304273b2d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-102786","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-102786","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":944,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-270742","title":"Barefoot Kanu Dadu","authors":["Ananya Dasgupta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Chinar loves football. She wants to win the World Cup when she grows up. One day, when she asks Ma for a new pair of shoes, she hears the story of Kanu dadu, who played against the British barefoot—and won.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362417/size7/45998f2b66540b0461b38115b3ef0cf4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/362417/size7/45998f2b66540b0461b38115b3ef0cf4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-270742","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-270742","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":945,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-10826","title":"Kallu's world 4 - Hero Horoscope Man","authors":["Subhadra Sen Gupta"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Welcome to Khajuria – a village where young Kallu and his gang run delightful adventurous riots almost everyday. Sometimes they question village traditions, defy bullies or just go about their daily business, but Kallu and his gang are up for anything. Join them as they grow wiser and wittier, happily roaming the village finding new things to do, and see what they come up with!\nA world renowned 'Astrologer – Palmist – Tantra Expert  – Futurologist – Numerologist...etc' is visiting the village. What could he predict other than the future... class test questions perhaps? Or perform a few magic tricks? What happens when Kallu's gang decides to check out the 'horoscope man'? No need to go to an astrologer to find out. Just read on…","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705851/size7/27f5aca19d2274317df16f424b61507c.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/705851/size7/27f5aca19d2274317df16f424b61507c.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-10826","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-10826","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":946,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-139044","title":"Hope, Where are you for Kate?","authors":["Armand Doucet","Elisa Guerra"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"The schools are closed and Kate from America is bored and wants the attention of her family. They are busy. What does she do next?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/206547/size7/a3dca9fef7511b2b14d0eb5ab412a30a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/206547/size7/a3dca9fef7511b2b14d0eb5ab412a30a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-139044","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-139044","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":947,"opdsId":"urn:uuid: