elp come from an unexpected source?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/689443/size7/7b18aa845fd61ebede141b52a960c978.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/689443/size7/7b18aa845fd61ebede141b52a960c978.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-603512","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-603512","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1341,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-94525","title":"Elephant and Chameleon","authors":["Stella  Badaru"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A king sets a difficult task, but the reward is to marry the princess. Who will succeed Elephant or Chameleon ?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/138793/size7/bc5aa53eae24ca770caa6c6dc42d7829.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/138793/size7/bc5aa53eae24ca770caa6c6dc42d7829.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-94525","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-94525","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1342,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-13915","title":"Katiiti’s Song","authors":["Philippa Namutebi  Kabali-Kagwa"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Every day, Katiiti’s mother calls her with a beautiful song. One day, a crafty gorilla tries to sing as sweetly as her mother.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38533/size7/8e25b2b2933ccd9fca54676b22b7adc0.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/38533/size7/8e25b2b2933ccd9fca54676b22b7adc0.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-13915","type":"application/pdf+zip","