eccc7fe9b.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-94278","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-94278","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1401,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-38072","title":"Ou Ou Wants to Have Friends","authors":["Shannon David"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Ou Ou likes to sing, dance and play. But he does not like his sharp porcupine spines because no one wants to play with him. A little mouse sees that Ou Ou is a good friend and his spines are not scary. Will the other animals see it too?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93511/size7/94cd17b7de02a28ee46765da68566ea4.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93511/size7/94cd17b7de02a28ee46765da68566ea4.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-38072","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-38072","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1402,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-23078","title":"The Cat's Lost Bread","authors":["Magdalena  Cooper"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Three cats always make sure they have three pieces of delicious sweet bread for dinner. But one day they find that a piece of their sweet bread has gone missing. The next day, the same thing happens! Can you help them find the thief?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120448/size7/68ee91788554c0b644271db145ac5481.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/120448/size7/68ee91788554c0b644271db145ac5481.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-23078","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acqui