pring. They share laughter in the warm sun and dreams under the moonlight. As time goes by, the bull slowly fades away and becomes a distant memory. But, as with all things in nature, there’s always a homecoming.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/672582/size7/64a9c5f6e3ade615aeaa0dd9a0128d2e.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/672582/size7/64a9c5f6e3ade615aeaa0dd9a0128d2e.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-608851","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-608851","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1452,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-49488","title":"Devil's scarf","authors":["Azeb Worku  Sibane"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A couple promises a gift to the devil on the birth of their child. How will they get out it?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93403/size7/fdd9fa2236b0754c488ccfe23e462189.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/93403/size7/fdd9fa2236b0754c488ccfe23e462189.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-49488","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-49488","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1453,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-314534","title":"A Balloon Ride","authors":["Deepa Ganesh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"How nice it would be to soar in the sky with a bunch of balloons. Little Yentanna takes off with his balloons. This fantastical poem takes a journey with a child and balloons to the moon.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/723777/size7/5baa0e9dd10e0d144d1e4e1f324956e6.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.st