 join them?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722301/size7/7e30514f8925ef67847bd3024b16b204.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/722301/size7/7e30514f8925ef67847bd3024b16b204.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-17478","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-17478","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1459,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-22366","title":"Hamisi's Lucky Day","authors":["Adelheid Marie Bwire"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Hamisi goes to buy his uniform and spots a shirt he wants. His father says he doesn't have the money for it. What will happen to Hamisi's wish?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130943/size7/4301ba557d8658d098e9b0c3cde586a2.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/130943/size7/4301ba557d8658d098e9b0c3cde586a2.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-22366","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-22366","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1460,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-612122","title":"The Growing Up Book","authors":["Yamini Vijayan"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Dealing with the changes that come with puberty can be confusing and difficult. This engaging and informative book prepares preteens and teens for some of the most complex years of their lives.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/676918/size7/a6cf8415233915d3e377842e3c066cee.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/676918/size7/a6cf8415233915d3e377842e3c066cee.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-612122","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-612122","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1461,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-45908","title":"Mother Hen","authors":["Brian Kavanagh"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Mother Hen wants to throw a party for her newly-hatched chicks, but she needs help gathering supplies. Who will help Mother Hen?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99524/size7/1d28f8e62ec7bb75b6a3b90b29ee9153.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/99524/size7/1d28f8e62ec7bb75b6a3b90b29ee9153.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-45908","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-45908","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1462,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-153638","title":"The Man on the Seat of Justice","authors":["Dr. Ramneet Kaur"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Algu Chowdhry and Jumman Sheikh are different from each other in every way one can imagine. Yet both of them are best friends, helping out each other in every way they can. But their friendship is suddenly threatened by a situation neither thought they would find themselves in. Algu is chosen to deliver justice in a panchayat where Jumman is the wrong-doer. Will Algu forego the truth to save his friend? Or will his duty towards justice destroy their friendship?","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/311724/size7/a699cdd38d39be59bb9d74afb0bb4830.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/311724/size7/a699cdd38d39be59bb9d74afb0bb4830.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-153638"