to save her village from water scarcity, Rini sets out on a mission to discover new water resources. At the end of her journey she discovers a hidden magical spring. As she attempts to take the water for her village, she encounters the spring’s old guardian and fierce protector, Fiara. Will Rini be able to take water for her village? Read this story to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754755/size7/9f8b75022fee2bbb70c161f44f5f1f4a.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754755/size7/9f8b75022fee2bbb70c161f44f5f1f4a.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-653132","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-653132","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1627,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-664984","title":"Passang's First Syabru","authors":["Tashi Chong Sherpa"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"Passang is back home for Losar and he is very excited to dance his first Syabru! But what is this? Everyone is comparing him to his Gaga, the best Syabru dancer in Naghi! He cannot dance as well as her. What if he is an embarrassment? What if this joyous occasion is not joyous at all? Join little Passang as he navigates his way through the anxiety and excitement.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/756352/size7/b706543b92aaeffd4904e8683959c44d.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/756352/size7/b706543b92aaeffd4904e8683959c44d.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-664984","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-664984","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1628,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-665570","title":"