.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754823/size7/7d00724bdd3f168bd8be691c181fc440.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-652918","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-652918","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1631,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-653057","title":"The Fishing Trip","authors":["Thomas Malsom"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"When Thoni wanted to eat her mother’s special fish curry, she and her friends decided to go on a fishing adventure. But once they reach\nthe river, there were no fish! With things going against their plan, help comes from an unexpected source. Will Thoni and her friends be\nable to enjoy the fish curry? Read this story to find out.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754822/size7/4ade617964443e527c00a0cb4b2bece1.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754822/size7/4ade617964443e527c00a0cb4b2bece1.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/pdf/SW-653057","type":"application/pdf+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"},{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.in/api/v0/story/epub/SW-653057","type":"application/epub+zip","rel":"http://opds-spec.org/acquisition"}]},{"id":1632,"opdsId":"urn:uuid:SW-664155","title":"The Fabrics of Our Identity","authors":["SauraMandala Foundation"],"language":"","readingLevel":"","publisher":"","summary":"A journey through North-east India showcased by traditional garments worn by men and women from the region.","coverUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754778/size7/3eec7410785cad4facfff363a5da51a8.jpg","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/754778/size7/3eec7410785cad4facfff363a5da51a8.jpg","acquisitions":[{"href":"https://storyweaver.org.